            ['start_time' => 345.85, 'end_time' => 347.07, 'target_text' => 'Allah make it easy.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mempermudahkan segala urusan.', 'order' => 93],
            ['start_time' => 347.17, 'end_time' => 350.56, 'target_text' => 'It\'s Scottish water, but masha Allah, it\'s good and it\'s pure and it\'s clean.', 'source_text' => 'Ia air Scotland, namun masya-Allah, ia amat elok, suci dan bersih.', 'order' => 94],
            ['start_time' => 350.65, 'end_time' => 357.51, 'target_text' => 'But look, there was a man who gave water from a well that was not a clean in the sense that, you know, when you get water', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi lihatlah, dahulu ada seorang lelaki yang memberi minum air dari sebuah perigi yang tidaklah bersih dalam erti kata, anda tahu apabila mengambil air', 'order' => 95],
            ['start_time' => 357.62, 'end_time' => 360.79, 'target_text' => 'from a well in your shoe, there is a little bit of dirt in it, right?', 'source_text' => 'dari perigi menggunakan kasut anda, sudah tentu ada sedikit sisa kotoran di dalamnya, bukan?', 'order' => 96],
            ['start_time' => 360.89, 'end_time' => 363.59, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not how we have today.', 'source_text' => 'Ia tidak sebersih bekalan air yang kita nikmati hari ini.', 'order' => 97],
            ['start_time' => 363.69, 'end_time' => 365.56, 'target_text' => 'And he was serving that water to a dog.', 'source_text' => 'Dan lelaki itu memberi minum air tersebut kepada seekor anjing.', 'order' => 98],
            ['start_time' => 365.65, 'end_time' => 366.12, 'target_text' => 'What\'s a dog?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah itu anjing?', 'order' => 99],
            ['start_time' => 366.21, 'end_time' => 367.35, 'target_text' => 'A dog is not a human.', 'source_text' => 'Seekor anjing bukanlah seorang manusia.', 'order' => 100],
            ['start_time' => 367.45, 'end_time' => 372.79, 'target_text' => 'A dog is nothing to do with the the the the the status of a human being in the eyes of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Seekor anjing langsung tiada kaitan dengan darjat kemuliaan seorang manusia di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 101],
            ['start_time' => 372.89, 'end_time' => 374.63, 'target_text' => 'But a dog is just a creature of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi anjing itu adalah makhluk ciptaan Allah jua.', 'order' => 102],
            ['start_time' => 374.73, 'end_time' => 381.31, 'target_text' => 'Perhaps there is such connection between us and a dog that there are a few more rules regarding interaction with a dog in', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin ada pertalian tertentu antara kita dengan anjing sehinggakan terdapat beberapa peraturan khusus mengenai interaksi dengan anjing di dalam', 'order' => 103],
            ['start_time' => 381.41, 'end_time' => 382.31, 'target_text' => 'Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Islam.', 'order' => 104],
            ['start_time' => 382.41, 'end_time' => 388.15, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a very tricky topic because people say, are you or are you not allowed to interact with dogs as Muslims?', 'source_text' => 'Ini topik yang agak sensitif kerana orang sering bertanya, adakah anda dibenarkan atau tidak berinteraksi dengan anjing sebagai orang Islam?', 'order' => 105],
            ['start_time' => 388.25, 'end_time' => 391.03, 'target_text' => 'Definitely you are, but there are a few rules you need to know.', 'source_text' => 'Sudah tentu anda dibenarkan, tetapi terdapat beberapa garis panduan yang wajib anda ketahui.', 'order' => 106],
            ['start_time' => 391.13, 'end_time' => 392.23, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah hakikatnya.', 'order' => 107],
            ['start_time' => 392.33, 'end_time' => 393.75, 'target_text' => 'So, it\'s not like we hate dogs.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, ia bukanlah bermakna kita membenci anjing.', 'order' => 108],
            ['start_time' => 393.85, 'end_time' => 394.67, 'target_text' => 'No, we don\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 109],
            ['start_time' => 394.77, 'end_time' => 400.03, 'target_text' => 'To the degree that even if you were to see pigs, it\'s haram to be bad and cruel to a pig.', 'source_text' => 'Sehinggakan sekiranya anda melihat babi sekalipun, adalah haram untuk kita bersikap zalim dan kejam terhadap babi.', 'order' => 110],
            ['start_time' => 400.13, 'end_time' => 401.95, 'target_text' => 'You\'re not allowed to consume it, correct?', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak dibenarkan memakannya, betul bukan?', 'order' => 111],
            ['start_time' => 402.06, 'end_time' => 403.07, 'target_text' => 'But you have to be kind.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anda tetap wajib berbuat ihsan.', 'order' => 112],
            ['start_time' => 403.17, 'end_time' => 403.71, 'target_text' => 'That\'s an animal.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah seekor haiwan.', 'order' => 113],
            ['start_time' => 403.81, 'end_time' => 409.63, 'target_text' => 'If you gave water to a pig, I\'m sure you would be rewarded by Allah in a way that is unimaginable.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda memberi minum kepada seekor babi, saya yakin anda tetap akan diganjari pahala oleh Allah dengan cara yang tidak terbayangkan.', 'order' => 114],
            ['start_time' => 409.73, 'end_time' => 411.63, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us ease.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mempermudah urusan kita.', 'order' => 115],
            ['start_time' => 411.73, 'end_time' => 413.35, 'target_text' => 'But', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi,', 'order' => 116],
            ['start_time' => 413.45, 'end_time' => 419.23, 'target_text' => 'which has a higher status in the eyes of Allah, a human or a dog?', 'source_text' => 'manakah yang mempunyai darjat lebih tinggi di sisi Allah, seorang manusia atau seekor anjing?', 'order' => 117],
            ['start_time' => 419.33, 'end_time' => 421.21, 'target_text' => 'A human.', 'source_text' => 'Seorang manusia.', 'order' => 118],
            ['start_time' => 422.13, 'end_time' => 425.44, 'target_text' => 'The most noble of the creatures of Allah is humankind.', 'source_text' => 'Makhluk ciptaan Allah yang paling mulia adalah umat manusia.', 'order' => 119],
            ['start_time' => 425.53, 'end_time' => 432.71, 'target_text' => 'And so, imagine if you are quenching the thirst of a human being, will you get more or less of a reward?', 'source_text' => 'Maka, bayangkan sekiranya anda menghilangkan dahaga seorang manusia, adakah anda akan mendapat pahala yang lebih besar atau lebih sedikit?', 'order' => 120],
            ['start_time' => 432.81, 'end_time' => 434.27, 'target_text' => 'You\'re going to get more.', 'source_text' => 'Anda pasti akan memperolehi pahala yang jauh lebih besar.', 'order' => 121],
            ['start_time' => 434.38, 'end_time' => 437.39, 'target_text' => 'It depends on your intention, obviously.', 'source_text' => 'Ia sudah tentu bergantung kepada keikhlasan niat anda.', 'order' => 122],
            ['start_time' => 437.5, 'end_time' => 439.95, 'target_text' => 'But you quenching Zamzam.', 'source_text' => 'Lebih-lebih lagi jika anda memberi minum air Zamzam.', 'order' => 123],
            ['start_time' => 440.06, 'end_time' => 443.75, 'target_text' => 'Zamzam is the purest water ever you can have on earth.', 'source_text' => 'Zamzam adalah air yang paling suci dan murni yang pernah ada di muka bumi ini.', 'order' => 124],
            ['start_time' => 443.85, 'end_time' => 446.39, 'target_text' => 'We\'re not going to get purer than Zamzam, right?', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak akan menemui air yang lebih murni daripada Zamzam, bukan?', 'order' => 125],
            ['start_time' => 446.5, 'end_time' => 448.12, 'target_text' => 'Zamzam', 'source_text' => 'Air Zamzam,', 'order' => 126],
            ['start_time' => 448.21, 'end_time' => 454.71, 'target_text' => 'hadith says Zamzam is so pure that it will have an effect for whatever reason and intention it is drunk for.', 'source_text' => 'hadis menyebut bahawa air Zamzam itu begitu suci sehingga ia memberi kesan mujarab mengikut apa jua tujuan dan niat ia diminum.', 'order' => 127],
            ['start_time' => 454.81, 'end_time' => 456.63, 'target_text' => 'We drink it with a certain niya.', 'source_text' => 'Kita meminumnya dengan niat yang tertentu.', 'order' => 128],
            ['start_time' => 456.73, 'end_time' => 458.51, 'target_text' => 'Inshallah, Allah will give you that.', 'source_text' => 'Insya-Allah, Allah pasti akan mengurniakan apa yang anda hajatkan itu.', 'order' => 129],
            ['start_time' => 458.62, 'end_time' => 459.75, 'target_text' => 'Especially shifa.', 'source_text' => 'Khususnya untuk syifa\'.', 'order' => 130],
            ['start_time' => 459.85, 'end_time' => 461.0, 'target_text' => 'It has in it cure.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalamnya terdapat penawar penyakit.', 'order' => 131],
            ['start_time' => 461.09, 'end_time' => 463.67, 'target_text' => 'We drink Zamzam, masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Kita meminum air Zamzam, masya-Allah.', 'order' => 132],
            ['start_time' => 463.77, 'end_time' => 468.07, 'target_text' => 'And a lot of us have Zamzam at home, even if it\'s a few drops, masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ramai di kalangan kita mempunyai simpanan air Zamzam di rumah, walaupun sekadar beberapa titis, masya-Allah.', 'order' => 133],
            ['start_time' => 468.17, 'end_time' => 469.79, 'target_text' => 'Even if it is a little.', 'source_text' => 'Walaupun hanya sedikit.', 'order' => 134],
            ['start_time' => 469.89, 'end_time' => 477.31, 'target_text' => 'But sometimes, my brothers and sisters, we tend to forget that our duty is to be good to each other and to be kind.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi kadangkala, saudara-saudariku, kita cenderung terlupa bahawa kewajipan kita adalah berbuat baik sesama kita dan saling berlemah lembut.', 'order' => 135],
            ['start_time' => 477.41, 'end_time' => 479.12, 'target_text' => 'And we need to reach out to each other.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita perlu saling menghulurkan tangan bantuan antara satu sama lain.', 'order' => 136],
            ['start_time' => 479.21, 'end_time' => 487.27, 'target_text' => 'And we need to make sure that we understand the Hadith of the dog in a far greater way to say, "If that guy was kind to a', 'source_text' => 'Serta kita perlu memastikan bahawa kita memahami hadis tentang anjing tersebut dalam skop yang jauh lebih mendalam, iaitu:', 'order' => 137],
            ['start_time' => 487.38, 'end_time' => 494.95, 'target_text' => 'dog by giving it water that we would not really drink today, imagine what would be the reward for you and I reaching out with', 'source_text' => '"Sekiranya lelaki itu berbuat ihsan kepada anjing dengan memberinya air yang kita sendiri tidak sanggup meminumnya pada hari ini, bayangkan betapa besarnya ganjaran untuk anda dan saya', 'order' => 138],
            ['start_time' => 495.06, 'end_time' => 502.56, 'target_text' => 'proper drinking water in a bottle to another human, more than a human avid, a person who worships Allah, if that were the', 'source_text' => 'menghulurkan air minuman botol yang bersih kepada sesama manusia, apatah lagi kepada seorang hamba yang beriman dan menyembah Allah!"', 'order' => 139],
            ['start_time' => 502.65, 'end_time' => 505.0, 'target_text' => 'case." So, go easy on each other.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, bersikap santun dan saling bertolak ansurlah sesama kamu.', 'order' => 140],
            ['start_time' => 505.09, 'end_time' => 513.83, 'target_text' => 'You never know which of your which of your deeds will be the deed that will tip the scale, inshallah, granting you and I Jannatul', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak pernah tahu amalan yang mana satu di antara amalan anda yang bakal memberatkan timbangan mizan, insya-Allah, melayakkan anda dan saya memasuki Jannatul', 'order' => 141],
            ['start_time' => 513.93, 'end_time' => 515.07, 'target_text' => 'Firdaus.', 'source_text' => 'Firdaus.', 'order' => 142],
            ['start_time' => 515.17, 'end_time' => 516.19, 'target_text' => 'But now, we have an issue.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi kini, timbul satu persoalan.', 'order' => 143],
            ['start_time' => 516.29, 'end_time' => 517.19, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the problem?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah masalahnya?', 'order' => 144],
            ['start_time' => 517.29, 'end_time' => 518.51, 'target_text' => 'I\'m so busy at work.', 'source_text' => 'Saya amat sibuk di tempat kerja.', 'order' => 145],
            ['start_time' => 518.61, 'end_time' => 520.71, 'target_text' => 'I interact with the opposite sex.', 'source_text' => 'Saya perlu berinteraksi dengan jantina yang berlainan.', 'order' => 146],
            ['start_time' => 520.81, 'end_time' => 524.12, 'target_text' => 'Is it haram to interact with the opposite sex?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah haram berinteraksi dengan jantina yang berlainan?', 'order' => 147],
            ['start_time' => 524.22, 'end_time' => 525.24, 'target_text' => 'Is it haram?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah ia haram?', 'order' => 148],
            ['start_time' => 525.34, 'end_time' => 526.91, 'target_text' => 'No, not at all.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, langsung tidak haram.', 'order' => 149],
            ['start_time' => 527.01, 'end_time' => 533.19, 'target_text' => 'If I\'m allowed to interact with a dog with certain rules, I definitely am definitely allowed to interact with the opposite', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya dibenarkan berinteraksi dengan seekor anjing dengan peraturan tertentu, sudah pasti saya dibenarkan berinteraksi dengan jantina', 'order' => 150],
            ['start_time' => 533.29, 'end_time' => 536.88, 'target_text' => 'sex with a few rules, a few things you need to bear in mind.', 'source_text' => 'berlainan dengan beberapa batasan syariat yang perlu sentiasa anda semat dalam ingatan.', 'order' => 151],
            ['start_time' => 536.98, 'end_time' => 539.27, 'target_text' => 'You know, you you need not to cross certain lines.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu menjaga batas agar tidak melangkaui sempadan tertentu.', 'order' => 152],
            ['start_time' => 539.38, 'end_time' => 540.15, 'target_text' => 'That\'s there.', 'source_text' => 'Itu ketetapan yang jelas.', 'order' => 153],
            ['start_time' => 540.25, 'end_time' => 544.63, 'target_text' => 'So, people say, "Sheikh, why did you talk to this woman?" Why not?', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, orang bertanya, "Syeikh, mengapa anda bercakap dengan wanita ini?" Mengapa tidak?', 'order' => 154],
            ['start_time' => 544.73, 'end_time' => 545.67, 'target_text' => 'What did I do?', 'source_text' => 'Apa kesalahan yang saya lakukan?', 'order' => 155],
            ['start_time' => 545.77, 'end_time' => 546.79, 'target_text' => 'There was no halwa.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada unsur khalwat.', 'order' => 156],
            ['start_time' => 546.89, 'end_time' => 547.88, 'target_text' => 'There was respect.', 'source_text' => 'Penuh dengan rasa hormat.', 'order' => 157],
            ['start_time' => 547.98, 'end_time' => 550.51, 'target_text' => 'We treated her with goodness and dignity.', 'source_text' => 'Kami melayannya dengan kebaikan, santun dan bermaruah.', 'order' => 158],
            ['start_time' => 550.62, 'end_time' => 552.63, 'target_text' => 'We tried to do whatever we had to.', 'source_text' => 'Kami menunaikan apa yang perlu dilaksanakan.', 'order' => 159],
            ['start_time' => 552.73, 'end_time' => 553.63, 'target_text' => 'We lowered our gaze.', 'source_text' => 'Kami menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 160],
            ['start_time' => 553.73, 'end_time' => 554.72, 'target_text' => 'We Whatever we had to do.', 'source_text' => 'Kami mematuhi apa jua yang wajib dipatuhi.', 'order' => 161],
            ['start_time' => 554.81, 'end_time' => 556.27, 'target_text' => 'All those rules in place.', 'source_text' => 'Semua peraturan tersebut sentiasa dipelihara.', 'order' => 162],
            ['start_time' => 556.38, 'end_time' => 558.03, 'target_text' => 'But we interacted.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi urusan interaksi tetap berlaku.', 'order' => 163],
            ['start_time' => 558.13, 'end_time' => 559.48, 'target_text' => 'You go into a pharmacy.', 'source_text' => 'Anda melangkah masuk ke farmasi.', 'order' => 164],
            ['start_time' => 559.57, 'end_time' => 561.19, 'target_text' => 'You need to seek medication.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu mendapatkan ubat-ubatan.', 'order' => 165],
            ['start_time' => 561.29, 'end_time' => 563.55, 'target_text' => 'And there is a young lady there.', 'source_text' => 'Dan terdapat seorang wanita muda yang bertugas di situ.', 'order' => 166],
            ['start_time' => 563.65, 'end_time' => 565.03, 'target_text' => 'And she is looking at you.', 'source_text' => 'Dan dia memandang ke arah anda sambil menyapa,', 'order' => 167],
            ['start_time' => 565.13, 'end_time' => 565.75, 'target_text' => '"Morning, sir.', 'source_text' => '"Selamat pagi, tuan.', 'order' => 168],
            ['start_time' => 565.86, 'end_time' => 572.15, 'target_text' => 'How are you, sir?" Are you going to say la ilaha illallah astaghfirullahal azim wala hawla wala quwwata illa billahi aliyyil', 'source_text' => 'Apa khabar, tuan?" Adakah anda terus membalas dengan la ilaha illallah astaghfirullahal azim wala hawla wala quwwata illa billahi aliyyil', 'order' => 169],
            ['start_time' => 572.25, 'end_time' => 572.72, 'target_text' => 'azim?', 'source_text' => 'azim?', 'order' => 170],
            ['start_time' => 572.81, 'end_time' => 573.24, 'target_text' => 'Correct.', 'source_text' => 'Benar.', 'order' => 171],
            ['start_time' => 573.34, 'end_time' => 579.84, 'target_text' => 'In your heart and mind, you are conscious of Allah, so you say my sister, I\'m looking for paracetamol.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam hati dan sanubari anda, anda sentiasa mengingati Allah, lalu anda membalas, "Saudariku, saya sedang mencari parasetamol."', 'order' => 172],
            ['start_time' => 579.93, 'end_time' => 581.72, 'target_text' => 'This is what I need and so on.', 'source_text' => '"Ini ubat yang saya perlukan" dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 173],
            ['start_time' => 581.81, 'end_time' => 582.75, 'target_text' => 'And what did you do?', 'source_text' => 'Dan apakah yang telah anda lakukan?', 'order' => 174],
            ['start_time' => 582.86, 'end_time' => 586.27, 'target_text' => 'You called her my sister and you interacted with her in a beautiful way.', 'source_text' => 'Anda memanggilnya dengan panggilan \'saudariku\' dan berinteraksi dengannya dengan cara yang amat berhemah.', 'order' => 175],
            ['start_time' => 586.38, 'end_time' => 586.77, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan tahukah anda apa kesannya?', 'order' => 176],
            ['start_time' => 586.86, 'end_time' => 590.12, 'target_text' => 'She might become interested even in the dean of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dia mungkin akan mula tertarik hati kepada keindahan agama Allah ini.', 'order' => 177],
            ['start_time' => 590.22, 'end_time' => 591.48, 'target_text' => 'Correct or not?', 'source_text' => 'Betul atau tidak?', 'order' => 178],
            ['start_time' => 591.57, 'end_time' => 595.39, 'target_text' => 'She would say these people are very, very respectful, polite.', 'source_text' => 'Dia pasti akan berkata bahawa orang Islam ini sangat menghormati orang lain dan amat bersopan santun.', 'order' => 179],
            ['start_time' => 595.5, 'end_time' => 596.75, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what Islam is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah intipati ajaran Islam yang sebenar.', 'order' => 180],
            ['start_time' => 596.86, 'end_time' => 600.95, 'target_text' => 'Respect, politeness, goodness while worshipping Allah alone.', 'source_text' => 'Hormat-menghormati, kesopanan dan berbuat ihsan di samping mengesakan dan menyembah Allah semata-mata.', 'order' => 181],
            ['start_time' => 601.05, 'end_time' => 605.48, 'target_text' => 'What you need to worry about is to make sure Allah is pleased.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara utama yang perlu anda risaukan adalah memastikan Allah reda kepada anda.', 'order' => 182],
            ['start_time' => 605.57, 'end_time' => 608.15, 'target_text' => 'If Allah is pleased, what more do you want?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya Allah sudah reda, apa lagi yang anda inginkan?', 'order' => 183],
            ['start_time' => 608.25, 'end_time' => 609.6, 'target_text' => 'I did something good.', 'source_text' => 'Saya telah melakukan sesuatu kebaikan.', 'order' => 184],
            ['start_time' => 609.69, 'end_time' => 613.15, 'target_text' => 'Now, in my interactions, I might have slipped up a little bit, right?', 'source_text' => 'Namun, dalam pergaulan harian saya, mungkin saya ada sedikit terkhilaf, bukan?', 'order' => 185],
            ['start_time' => 613.25, 'end_time' => 615.19, 'target_text' => 'Went to work, slipped up a little bit.', 'source_text' => 'Keluar bekerja, tergelincir sedikit kesilapan.', 'order' => 186],
            ['start_time' => 615.29, 'end_time' => 618.07, 'target_text' => 'I might have been distracted a little bit.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin fikiran saya ada sedikit terleka.', 'order' => 187],
            ['start_time' => 618.17, 'end_time' => 626.36, 'target_text' => 'The other day, we went into a restaurant and mashallah alhamdulillah la ilaha illallah, the owners were Muslims.', 'source_text' => 'Baru-baru ini, kami berkunjung ke sebuah restoran, dan masya-Allah alhamdulillah la ilaha illallah, pemiliknya adalah orang Islam.', 'order' => 188],
            ['start_time' => 626.45, 'end_time' => 627.31, 'target_text' => 'Right?', 'source_text' => 'Betul bukan?', 'order' => 189],
            ['start_time' => 627.41, 'end_time' => 629.95, 'target_text' => 'And they there was some music in the background.', 'source_text' => 'Dan pada waktu itu, ada alunan muzik dipasang di ruang latar belakang.', 'order' => 190],
            ['start_time' => 630.05, 'end_time' => 630.84, 'target_text' => 'We didn\'t say anything.', 'source_text' => 'Kami tidak menegur atau berkata apa-apa.', 'order' => 191],
            ['start_time' => 630.93, 'end_time' => 633.0, 'target_text' => 'We just went in and said As-salamu alaykum.', 'source_text' => 'Kami hanya melangkah masuk dan mengucapkan, "As-salamu alaykum."', 'order' => 192],
            ['start_time' => 633.1, 'end_time' => 634.6, 'target_text' => 'We had a seat.', 'source_text' => 'Kami pun mengambil tempat duduk.', 'order' => 193],
            ['start_time' => 634.69, 'end_time' => 638.0, 'target_text' => 'In a short time, there was no more music in the background.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam masa yang singkat, muzik di latar belakang tadi terus dipadamkan.', 'order' => 194],
            ['start_time' => 638.1, 'end_time' => 639.55, 'target_text' => 'What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apa yang telah berlaku?', 'order' => 195],
            ['start_time' => 639.65, 'end_time' => 640.36, 'target_text' => 'What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah puncanya?', 'order' => 196],
            ['start_time' => 640.45, 'end_time' => 646.27, 'target_text' => 'Just out of respect, I think, they must have decided, you know, these bearded fellows walked in, let\'s just turn off this', 'source_text' => 'Semata-mata kerana rasa hormat, saya fikir, mereka tentu berkata, "Orang-orang berkopiah dan berjanggut ini baru masuk, mari kita matikan muzik', 'order' => 197],
            ['start_time' => 646.38, 'end_time' => 647.95, 'target_text' => 'thing here, perhaps.', 'source_text' => 'ini seketika."', 'order' => 198],
            ['start_time' => 648.05, 'end_time' => 651.6, 'target_text' => 'I would have thought perhaps maybe in a little while some Quran will start playing.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pada mulanya menyangka mungkin selepas itu mereka akan memasang alunan bacaan ayat suci al-Quran.', 'order' => 199],
            ['start_time' => 651.69, 'end_time' => 652.91, 'target_text' => 'But that didn\'t happen.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi itu tidak berlaku.', 'order' => 200],
            ['start_time' => 653.01, 'end_time' => 653.48, 'target_text' => 'The food came.', 'source_text' => 'Makanan pun tiba.', 'order' => 201],
            ['start_time' => 653.57, 'end_time' => 654.31, 'target_text' => 'It was good enough.', 'source_text' => 'Rasanya cukup enak dan memuaskan.', 'order' => 202],
            ['start_time' => 654.41, 'end_time' => 655.75, 'target_text' => 'I didn\'t ask anything.', 'source_text' => 'Saya langsung tidak meminta apa-apa perubahan.', 'order' => 203],
            ['start_time' => 655.86, 'end_time' => 658.07, 'target_text' => 'No one requested anything to be shut off.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sesiapa pun meminta agar apa-apa ditutup.', 'order' => 204],
            ['start_time' => 658.17, 'end_time' => 661.75, 'target_text' => 'A lot of the times with us, we don\'t even notice the music in the background.', 'source_text' => 'Kebanyakan masa dalam kehidupan kita, kita sendiri tidak perasan bunyi muzik di latar belakang.', 'order' => 205],
            ['start_time' => 661.86, 'end_time' => 665.72, 'target_text' => 'Until someone says, "Can you hear what\'s happening?" I said, "Brother, why did you say that?', 'source_text' => 'Sehinggalah seseorang menegur, "Adakah anda dengar apa yang sedang dipasang itu?" Saya berkata, "Wahai saudaraku, mengapa anda berkata begitu?', 'order' => 206],
            ['start_time' => 665.81, 'end_time' => 670.39, 'target_text' => 'I I didn\'t hear it until you told me." You know, our minds are occupied with something.', 'source_text' => 'Saya langsung tidak mendengarnya sehinggalah anda memberitahu saya." Anda tahu, fikiran kita sering sarat dengan perkara lain.', 'order' => 207],
            ['start_time' => 670.5, 'end_time' => 672.12, 'target_text' => 'Many times we don\'t hear things.', 'source_text' => 'Banyak kali kita sebenarnya tidak mendengar bunyi sekeliling.', 'order' => 208],
            ['start_time' => 672.22, 'end_time' => 677.95, 'target_text' => 'And then when you draw our attention to it, then we notice, "Oh, oh, why did you tell me?" Like this.', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila anda menarik perhatian kami kepadanya, barulah kami tersedar, "Aduh, mengapa pula anda beritahu saya?" Begitulah keadaannya.', 'order' => 209],
            ['start_time' => 678.05, 'end_time' => 683.27, 'target_text' => 'But in all of that, some people sometimes because of the pressure', 'source_text' => 'Namun dalam semua situasi itu, ada sesetengah orang kadangkala disebabkan oleh tekanan', 'order' => 210],
            ['start_time' => 683.38, 'end_time' => 691.75, 'target_text' => 'of peers or society or community or a few people around, they end up doing bad things such as falling into drugs, falling', 'source_text' => 'rakan sebaya, masyarakat, komuniti, atau segelintir orang di sekeliling mereka, akhirnya terjerumus melakukan perkara buruk seperti dadah, terjebak', 'order' => 211],
            ['start_time' => 691.86, 'end_time' => 697.45, 'target_text' => 'into addictions, getting into bad habits, and the list is quite long.', 'source_text' => 'dengan ketagihan, terbiasa dengan tabiat buruk, dan senarainya amat panjang.', 'order' => 212],
            ['start_time' => 697.65, 'end_time' => 703.36, 'target_text' => 'But Allah Almighty, when he loves us, he taps us and brings us back to him.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa, apabila Dia menyayangi hamba-Nya, Dia akan menyentuh hati kita dan memimpin kita kembali kepada-Nya.', 'order' => 213],
            ['start_time' => 703.45, 'end_time' => 706.12, 'target_text' => 'Today we are seated in this place here.', 'source_text' => 'Hari ini kita sedang duduk di tempat yang mulia ini.', 'order' => 214],
            ['start_time' => 706.22, 'end_time' => 709.0, 'target_text' => 'Is it not known as the house of Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah tempat ini dikenali sebagai rumah Allah?', 'order' => 215],
            ['start_time' => 709.1, 'end_time' => 711.63, 'target_text' => 'You are sitting here, you are more than welcome.', 'source_text' => 'Anda sedang duduk di sini, kehadiran anda amat dialu-alukan.', 'order' => 216],
            ['start_time' => 711.74, 'end_time' => 713.31, 'target_text' => 'You are a guest of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Anda semua adalah para tetamu Allah.', 'order' => 217],
            ['start_time' => 713.41, 'end_time' => 718.72, 'target_text' => 'We are here, masha Allah, not to chase you away, but to tell you this is the right place.', 'source_text' => 'Kehadiran kami di sini, masya-Allah, bukan untuk menghalau anda, sebaliknya untuk memberitahu anda bahawa inilah tempat yang paling tepat.', 'order' => 218],
            ['start_time' => 718.81, 'end_time' => 720.31, 'target_text' => 'You want to come, come here.', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda ingin ke mana-mana, datanglah ke sini.', 'order' => 219],
            ['start_time' => 720.41, 'end_time' => 726.12, 'target_text' => 'If I could change anything right here and right now, I would only ask everyone to open all the windows, but don\'t worry, it\'s', 'source_text' => 'Jika ada satu perkara yang ingin saya ubah di sini sekarang juga, saya hanya ingin meminta semua orang membuka semua tingkap, tetapi jangan risau,', 'order' => 220],
            ['start_time' => 726.22, 'end_time' => 727.24, 'target_text' => 'not my place.', 'source_text' => 'ini bukan rumah saya.', 'order' => 221],
            ['start_time' => 727.34, 'end_time' => 727.91, 'target_text' => 'It\'s your place.', 'source_text' => 'Ini rumah anda semua.', 'order' => 222],
            ['start_time' => 728.01, 'end_time' => 730.55, 'target_text' => 'It\'s up to you to decide what you want to do.', 'source_text' => 'Terpulang kepada anda untuk menentukan apa yang ingin anda lakukan.', 'order' => 223],
            ['start_time' => 730.65, 'end_time' => 737.29, 'target_text' => 'But Allah Almighty grant us is How did you like my way of saying, "Guys, it\'s a bit hot in here?" Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kemudahan. Bagaimana anda menilai cara halus saya menyampaikan bahawa, "Tuan-tuan, di dalam ini agak panas?" Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 224],
            ['start_time' => 738.29, 'end_time' => 740.31, 'target_text' => 'Brother, you walked in Zimbabwe.', 'source_text' => '"Wahai saudaraku, anda pernah berkunjung ke Zimbabwe?"', 'order' => 225],
            ['start_time' => 740.41, 'end_time' => 743.48, 'target_text' => 'Yes, Zimbabwe is much cooler than this, my beloved brother.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, Zimbabwe jauh lebih sejuk daripada ini, wahai saudaraku yang dikasihi.', 'order' => 226],
            ['start_time' => 743.57, 'end_time' => 744.67, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Bukan begitu.', 'order' => 227],
            ['start_time' => 744.77, 'end_time' => 748.88, 'target_text' => 'Uh the inside of the buildings, masha Allah, they are much, much cooler.', 'source_text' => 'Bahagian dalam bangunan di sana, masya-Allah, suasananya jauh lebih sejuk dan nyaman.', 'order' => 228],
            ['start_time' => 748.98, 'end_time' => 750.48, 'target_text' => 'Allahumma barik.', 'source_text' => 'Allahumma barik.', 'order' => 229],
            ['start_time' => 750.57, 'end_time' => 756.55, 'target_text' => 'But the outside is a bit Here it\'s cooler outside, but what\'s the point of it being so cool outside at this time of the night', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi di luar agak hangat. Di sini suasananya sejuk di luar, tetapi apa gunanya di luar begitu sejuk pada waktu malam sebegini', 'order' => 230],
            ['start_time' => 756.65, 'end_time' => 757.88, 'target_text' => 'when inside we are sweating?', 'source_text' => 'sedangkan di dalam ini kita semua bermandi peluh?', 'order' => 231],
            ['start_time' => 757.98, 'end_time' => 759.03, 'target_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 232],
            ['start_time' => 759.13, 'end_time' => 761.36, 'target_text' => 'Because of such the numbers, and you know why we\'re sweating?', 'source_text' => 'Disebabkan kehadiran jemaah yang begitu ramai, dan tahukah anda mengapa kita berpeluh?', 'order' => 233],
            ['start_time' => 761.45, 'end_time' => 763.79, 'target_text' => 'Let me tell you why.', 'source_text' => 'Biar saya beritahu anda puncanya.', 'order' => 234],
            ['start_time' => 763.89, 'end_time' => 765.75, 'target_text' => 'The warmth of our hearts.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana kehangatan kasih sayang yang terpancar dari hati sanubari kita.', 'order' => 235],
            ['start_time' => 765.86, 'end_time' => 767.27, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 236],
            ['start_time' => 767.38, 'end_time' => 771.19, 'target_text' => 'Warmth of the hearts, lovely people, beaming faces.', 'source_text' => 'Kehangatan hati, keperibadian insan-insan yang baik, wajah-wajah yang berseri-seri.', 'order' => 237],
            ['start_time' => 771.29, 'end_time' => 773.15, 'target_text' => 'Did that make a difference, guys?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah tingkap yang dibuka tadi memberi perbezaan yang menyegarkan?', 'order' => 238],
            ['start_time' => 773.25, 'end_time' => 776.31, 'target_text' => 'Air conditioning min indillah bis sama.', 'source_text' => 'Penyaman udara terus min \'indillah dari langit.', 'order' => 239],
            ['start_time' => 776.41, 'end_time' => 776.91, 'target_text' => 'Huh?', 'source_text' => 'Kan?', 'order' => 240],
            ['start_time' => 777.01, 'end_time' => 778.72, 'target_text' => 'Beautiful, masha Allah tabarak Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Sungguh indah, masya-Allah tabarakallah.', 'order' => 241],
            ['start_time' => 778.81, 'end_time' => 781.0, 'target_text' => 'Now, why did I say what I said?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa saya berkata seperti yang saya katakan tadi?', 'order' => 242],
            ['start_time' => 781.1, 'end_time' => 782.03, 'target_text' => 'Do you know?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda sebabnya?', 'order' => 243],
            ['start_time' => 782.13, 'end_time' => 783.39, 'target_text' => 'Because I\'m your brother.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana saya adalah saudara anda.', 'order' => 244],
            ['start_time' => 783.5, 'end_time' => 784.91, 'target_text' => 'In some cases, your younger brother.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi sesetengah daripada anda, saya adalah adik anda.', 'order' => 245],
            ['start_time' => 785.01, 'end_time' => 786.63, 'target_text' => 'In some cases, your older brother.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi sesetengah yang lain, saya adalah abang anda.', 'order' => 246],
            ['start_time' => 786.73, 'end_time' => 792.91, 'target_text' => 'If I didn\'t open my mouth, I would finish the whole talk regretting that why didn\'t you say open the windows?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya tidak bersuara, saya pasti akan menamatkan seluruh ceramah ini dengan rasa kesal mengapa saya tidak meminta agar tingkap dibuka.', 'order' => 247],
            ['start_time' => 793.01, 'end_time' => 795.55, 'target_text' => 'So, I had to say it in a very diplomatic way.', 'source_text' => 'Maka saya terpaksa menyampaikannya secara sangat berhemah dan diplomatik.', 'order' => 248],
            ['start_time' => 795.65, 'end_time' => 797.74, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 249],
            ['start_time' => 798.34, 'end_time' => 799.51, 'target_text' => 'Very technical.', 'source_text' => 'Sangat teknikal pendekatannya.', 'order' => 250],
            ['start_time' => 799.62, 'end_time' => 801.15, 'target_text' => 'But did it not open the windows?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi bukankah tingkap akhirnya berjaya dibuka?', 'order' => 251],
            ['start_time' => 801.25, 'end_time' => 801.65, 'target_text' => 'Yes.', 'source_text' => 'Ya.', 'order' => 252],
            ['start_time' => 801.73, 'end_time' => 803.43, 'target_text' => 'Alhamdulillah, so it worked.', 'source_text' => 'Alhamdulillah, ia ternyata membuahkan hasil.', 'order' => 253],
            ['start_time' => 803.53, 'end_time' => 809.72, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why I say sometimes when we are telling you something, you might not realize how we are saying it, but we get to the', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah saya katakan, kadangkala apabila kami menasihati anda tentang sesuatu, anda mungkin tidak menyedari gaya bahasa kami menyampaikannya, tetapi kita tetap mencapai', 'order' => 254],
            ['start_time' => 809.81, 'end_time' => 811.36, 'target_text' => 'same end result.', 'source_text' => 'hasil matlamat akhir yang sama.', 'order' => 255],
            ['start_time' => 811.45, 'end_time' => 812.43, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what\'s important.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah perkara yang paling penting.', 'order' => 256],
            ['start_time' => 812.53, 'end_time' => 813.75, 'target_text' => 'End result is what is important.', 'source_text' => 'Matlamat akhirlah yang menjadi keutamaan.', 'order' => 257],
            ['start_time' => 813.86, 'end_time' => 815.43, 'target_text' => 'How I said it, different.', 'source_text' => 'Cara penyampaian saya mungkin berbeza.', 'order' => 258],
            ['start_time' => 815.53, 'end_time' => 820.88, 'target_text' => 'You will hear from all the scholars and those who want to remind you of Allah to pray five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'Anda akan mendengar daripada semua alim ulama dan para pendakwah yang mengingatkan anda tentang Allah agar menunaikan solat lima waktu sehari semalam.', 'order' => 259],
            ['start_time' => 820.98, 'end_time' => 824.6, 'target_text' => 'But each one will use a different method to tell you exactly the same thing.', 'source_text' => 'Namun setiap daripada mereka akan menggunakan pendekatan berbeza untuk menyampaikan mesej yang sama.', 'order' => 260],
            ['start_time' => 824.69, 'end_time' => 826.84, 'target_text' => 'The idea is to get to the end result.', 'source_text' => 'Tujuannya adalah untuk mencapai hasil akhir yang diinginkan.', 'order' => 261],
            ['start_time' => 826.93, 'end_time' => 829.48, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what is the ultimate end result for a moment?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apakah matlamat akhir yang paling agung bagi setiap saat kehidupan kita?', 'order' => 262],
            ['start_time' => 829.57, 'end_time' => 830.55, 'target_text' => 'Say it.', 'source_text' => 'Sebutlah ia bersama-sama.', 'order' => 263],
            ['start_time' => 830.65, 'end_time' => 831.95, 'target_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus.', 'source_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus.', 'order' => 264],
            ['start_time' => 832.05, 'end_time' => 835.43, 'target_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus, one of the only places better than Aberdeen.', 'source_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus, antara satu-satunya tempat yang jauh lebih indah daripada Aberdeen.', 'order' => 265],
            ['start_time' => 835.53, 'end_time' => 836.67, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 266],
            ['start_time' => 836.77, 'end_time' => 838.31, 'target_text' => 'May Allah protect you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah memelihara anda semua.', 'order' => 267],
            ['start_time' => 838.41, 'end_time' => 841.36, 'target_text' => 'I see the guys are smiling because they\'re disagreeing with me, right?', 'source_text' => 'Saya melihat para jemaah tersenyum kerana tidak bersetuju dengan perbandingan saya tadi, betul bukan?', 'order' => 268],
            ['start_time' => 841.45, 'end_time' => 846.43, 'target_text' => 'There are a lot of other more beautiful places, but inshallah, for me, it\'s something big because it\'s not like I come to', 'source_text' => 'Pasti ada banyak lagi tempat lain yang lebih indah, namun insya-Allah, bagi saya ia suatu perkara yang amat bermakna kerana bukanlah selalu saya berpeluang datang ke', 'order' => 269],
            ['start_time' => 846.53, 'end_time' => 847.79, 'target_text' => 'Aberdeen all the time.', 'source_text' => 'Aberdeen.', 'order' => 270],
            ['start_time' => 847.89, 'end_time' => 848.6, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 271],
            ['start_time' => 848.69, 'end_time' => 856.6, 'target_text' => 'But nonetheless, I was saying sometimes we develop bad habits and we get into something that we are not happy with as time', 'source_text' => 'Namun apa pun, seperti yang saya katakan tadi, kadangkala kita terbiasa dengan tabiat buruk dan terjerumus ke dalam perkara yang lama-kelamaan membuatkan kita berasa tidak', 'order' => 272],
            ['start_time' => 856.69, 'end_time' => 857.63, 'target_text' => 'passes.', 'source_text' => 'tenang.', 'order' => 273],
            ['start_time' => 857.74, 'end_time' => 866.55, 'target_text' => 'At some point, because of our friends who may be involved in addictions and various other distractions, we feel happy.', 'source_text' => 'Pada mulanya, disebabkan pengaruh rakan-rakan yang mungkin terlibat dengan ketagihan dan pelbagai perkara yang melalaikan, kita berasa seronok.', 'order' => 274],
            ['start_time' => 866.65, 'end_time' => 875.39, 'target_text' => 'And we don\'t realize that Allah Almighty, out of his father and his mercy, he will bring us to his house because we have a', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita tidak sedar bahawa Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa, dengan limpah kurnia dan rahmat-Nya, akan memimpin kita kembali ke rumah-Nya kerana masih ada', 'order' => 275],
            ['start_time' => 875.5, 'end_time' => 879.38, 'target_text' => 'flicker of Iman in our hearts.', 'source_text' => 'sekelumit sinar iman di dalam hati kita.', 'order' => 276],
            ['start_time' => 880.41, 'end_time' => 885.84, 'target_text' => 'Do you know there is a Hadith where the Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam says there will come a time when Can you move aside', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda terdapat hadis di mana Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam bersabda bahawa akan tiba suatu masa di mana — bolehkah anda berganjak ke tepi sedikit', 'order' => 277],
            ['start_time' => 885.93, 'end_time' => 891.12, 'target_text' => 'because every day we deal with the movement of this and everyone complains that the the video is cracking.', 'source_text' => 'kerana setiap hari kami berdepan masalah pergerakan tripod ini dan semua orang mengadu bahawa rakaman video bergegar dan terputus-putus.', 'order' => 278],
            ['start_time' => 891.22, 'end_time' => 893.72, 'target_text' => 'So you have to move a little bit aside.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi anda perlu beralih ke tepi sedikit.', 'order' => 279],
            ['start_time' => 893.81, 'end_time' => 903.79, 'target_text' => 'But my beloved brothers, there is a Hadith that says that Allah Almighty will instruct the angels at the time to say, "Remove', 'source_text' => 'Namun wahai saudara-saudaraku yang dikasihi, terdapat sebuah hadis yang menyatakan bahawa Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa akan memerintahkan para malaikat pada ketika itu dengan berfirman, "Keluarkanlah', 'order' => 280],
            ['start_time' => 903.89, 'end_time' => 914.48, 'target_text' => 'from Jahannam anyone who has even an atom\'s weight worth of Iman." So we have Iman, Allah will bring us to his house by his', 'source_text' => 'dari neraka Jahannam sesiapa sahaja yang memiliki iman walaupun sekecil zarah." Maka selagi kita mempunyai iman, Allah akan membawa kita ke rumah-Nya dengan kehendak-', 'order' => 281],
            ['start_time' => 914.57, 'end_time' => 915.07, 'target_text' => 'will.', 'source_text' => 'Nya.', 'order' => 282],
            ['start_time' => 915.17, 'end_time' => 922.55, 'target_text' => 'And I always say, my brother, when you do something bad, my beloved sister, when you sinned against Allah, if you have a feeling', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya sentiasa berpesan, wahai saudaraku apabila anda melakukan keburukan, wahai saudariku yang dikasihi apabila anda terlanjur berdosa kepada Allah, sekiranya timbul rasa', 'order' => 283],
            ['start_time' => 922.65, 'end_time' => 926.36, 'target_text' => 'in your heart of regret, it\'s a sign that you are a believer.', 'source_text' => 'penyesalan di dalam hati anda, itu adalah petanda bahawa anda seorang yang beriman.', 'order' => 284],
            ['start_time' => 926.45, 'end_time' => 929.55, 'target_text' => 'Because if you were not a believer, why would you regret?', 'source_text' => 'Kerana sekiranya anda bukan seorang yang beriman, mengapa pula anda perlu berasa menyesal?', 'order' => 285],
            ['start_time' => 929.65, 'end_time' => 931.89, 'target_text' => 'What is the regret?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah erti penyesalan itu?', 'order' => 286],
            ['start_time' => 936.89, 'end_time' => 942.55, 'target_text' => 'If If your good deed makes you a little bit happy, you know, when you get up early for salatul Fajr, tahajjud, you did something', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya amalan soleh anda membuatkan anda berasa sedikit gembira — anda tahu, apabila anda bangun awal pagi untuk solat Subuh, bertahajud, anda melakukan suatu', 'order' => 287],
            ['start_time' => 942.65, 'end_time' => 945.27, 'target_text' => 'good, you gave a charity, you went to Mecca for Umrah, etc.', 'source_text' => 'kebaikan, anda bersedekah, anda menunaikan umrah di Makkah dan sebagainya —', 'order' => 288],
            ['start_time' => 945.38, 'end_time' => 953.0, 'target_text' => 'If it that makes you feel happy within and content and fulfilled and your your bad deed makes you regret and sad, that is', 'source_text' => 'sekiranya perkara tersebut mendatangkan rasa bahagia, tenang dan lapang di dalam jiwa anda, dan sebaliknya amalan buruk membuatkan anda berasa kesal dan pilu, itu', 'order' => 289],
            ['start_time' => 953.1, 'end_time' => 955.36, 'target_text' => 'a sign that you are a believer.', 'source_text' => 'adalah bukti nyata bahawa anda seorang yang beriman.', 'order' => 290],
            ['start_time' => 955.45, 'end_time' => 957.19, 'target_text' => 'There is accountability in you.', 'source_text' => 'Masih ada rasa tanggungjawab dan kepekaan hisab di dalam diri anda.', 'order' => 291],
            ['start_time' => 957.29, 'end_time' => 958.63, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why you feel that way.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah puncanya mengapa anda merasai perasaan sedemikian.', 'order' => 292],
            ['start_time' => 958.74, 'end_time' => 965.07, 'target_text' => 'If there was no accountability in you, subhanallah, you would not need to feel good or bad for anything.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya tiada kepekaan hisab dalam diri anda, subhanallah, anda tidak akan berasa gembira mahupun bersalah terhadap apa jua yang anda lakukan.', 'order' => 293],
            ['start_time' => 965.17, 'end_time' => 971.6, 'target_text' => 'So, my beloved brothers and sisters, Allah brings you to his house and you are sitting here with all the people from the same', 'source_text' => 'Maka, wahai saudara-saudariku yang dikasihi, Allah memimpin anda ke rumah-Nya dan anda duduk di sini bersama warga sekota atau', 'order' => 294],
            ['start_time' => 971.69, 'end_time' => 974.43, 'target_text' => 'city or village and mashallah, what are we listening to?', 'source_text' => 'sekampung, dan masya-Allah, apa yang sedang kita dengarkan?', 'order' => 295],
            ['start_time' => 974.53, 'end_time' => 977.79, 'target_text' => 'We\'re listening to someone telling us, "Come, let\'s go to Allah together.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sedang mendengar seruan seseorang yang mengajak kita, "Marilah kita bersama-sama kembali mendekatkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 296],
            ['start_time' => 977.89, 'end_time' => 978.43, 'target_text' => 'Come.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah.', 'order' => 297],
            ['start_time' => 978.53, 'end_time' => 986.34, 'target_text' => 'I have weaknesses, you have weaknesses, I have sinned, you have sinned, but surely shouldn\'t we stop that now?', 'source_text' => 'Saya ada kelemahan, anda ada kelemahan, saya pernah berbuat dosa, anda pernah berbuat dosa, tetapi tidakkah wajar untuk kita menghentikannya sekarang?', 'order' => 298],
            ['start_time' => 999.73, 'end_time' => 1001.24, 'target_text' => 'Is it not time?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah sudah tiba masanya?', 'order' => 299],
            ['start_time' => 1001.34, 'end_time' => 1008.19, 'target_text' => 'Is it not time that the believers, their hearts turn towards Allah and revelation and the truth?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah sudah sampai masanya bagi orang-orang yang beriman agar hati mereka tunduk dan khusyuk mengingati Allah, wahyu-Nya dan kebenaran?', 'order' => 300],
            ['start_time' => 1008.29, 'end_time' => 1009.24, 'target_text' => 'Is it not time?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah sudah tiba masanya?', 'order' => 301],
            ['start_time' => 1009.34, 'end_time' => 1010.51, 'target_text' => 'What are you waiting for?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah lagi yang anda tunggu?', 'order' => 302],
            ['start_time' => 1010.62, 'end_time' => 1013.79, 'target_text' => 'How long do you want before you come back to Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa lama lagi masa yang anda perlukan sebelum kembali kepada Allah?', 'order' => 303],
            ['start_time' => 1013.89, 'end_time' => 1020.99, 'target_text' => 'Come slowly but surely if need be, but make sure the movement is in the right direction, not in the wrong direction.', 'source_text' => 'Kembalilah secara perlahan-lahan tetapi pasti sekiranya perlu, namun pastikan langkah anda menuju ke arah yang benar, bukan ke arah yang salah.', 'order' => 304],
            ['start_time' => 1021.09, 'end_time' => 1023.51, 'target_text' => 'You are struggling with your prayer, guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Anda sedang bergelut untuk menjaga solat anda, tahukah anda?', 'order' => 305],
            ['start_time' => 1023.62, 'end_time' => 1025.84, 'target_text' => 'We all have our struggles.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua mempunyai ujian dan perjuangan masing-masing.', 'order' => 306],
            ['start_time' => 1025.93, 'end_time' => 1032.89, 'target_text' => 'But the weakness would be from four you go to three and from three you go to two, that is a loss.', 'source_text' => 'Namun kelemahan yang nyata adalah apabila daripada empat waktu solat anda merosot ke tiga, dan daripada tiga berkurang menjadi dua — itu suatu kerugian yang nyata.', 'order' => 307],
            ['start_time' => 1033.06, 'end_time' => 1040.15, 'target_text' => 'Successful is a person whom from two when he\'s struggling but he goes to three because of dedication and the love of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Orang yang berjaya adalah seseorang yang walaupun bergelut daripada dua waktu, dia berusaha meningkat ke tiga waktu kerana keazaman dan rasa cintanya kepada Allah.', 'order' => 308],
            ['start_time' => 1040.25, 'end_time' => 1047.88, 'target_text' => 'My beloved children, my beloved youth, my mothers, my sisters, my brothers, my elders, whoever you are, let\'s do better than', 'source_text' => 'Wahai anak-anakku yang dikasihi, para pemuda, ibu-ibuku, para saudariku, para saudaraku, para wargatua sekalian, sesiapa jua anda — marilah kita beramal lebih baik daripada', 'order' => 309],
            ['start_time' => 1047.97, 'end_time' => 1049.08, 'target_text' => 'we did yesterday.', 'source_text' => 'apa yang kita lakukan semalam.', 'order' => 310],
            ['start_time' => 1049.17, 'end_time' => 1050.8, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s always be stronger.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah kita sentiasa menjadi insan yang lebih teguh.', 'order' => 311],
            ['start_time' => 1050.89, 'end_time' => 1057.8, 'target_text' => 'It is very sad to see people sometimes they are closer to Allah and then they become distant.', 'source_text' => 'Amat mendukacitakan apabila melihat orang yang dahulunya begitu dekat dengan Allah, kemudiannya menjauhkan diri.', 'order' => 312],
            ['start_time' => 1057.89, 'end_time' => 1059.23, 'target_text' => 'That\'s not a good sign.', 'source_text' => 'Itu bukan petanda yang baik.', 'order' => 313],
            ['start_time' => 1059.34, 'end_time' => 1066.84, 'target_text' => 'I say if you\'re going to sin, don\'t encourage others to sin because you might quit the sin at some point and those whom you\'ve', 'source_text' => 'Saya berpesan, sekiranya anda terlanjur melakukan dosa, jangan sesekali mengajak orang lain berbuat dosa kerana anda mungkin bertaubat suatu hari nanti, sedangkan orang yang', 'order' => 314],
            ['start_time' => 1066.93, 'end_time' => 1072.06, 'target_text' => 'encouraged might become sadaka in the wrong sense.', 'source_text' => 'anda pengaruhi itu mungkin menjadi \'sedekah jariah\' pada jalan keburukan.', 'order' => 315],
            ['start_time' => 1072.41, 'end_time' => 1073.99, 'target_text' => 'What is a sadaka in the wrong sense?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang dimaksudkan dengan \'sedekah jariah\' pada jalan keburukan?', 'order' => 316],
            ['start_time' => 1074.1, 'end_time' => 1081.12, 'target_text' => 'In the same way I would get a reward for doing a good deed, I will also be sinful for doing a bad deed, but if my good deed', 'source_text' => 'Sebagaimana saya beroleh pahala apabila melakukan kebaikan, saya juga menanggung dosa apabila melakukan maksiat. Namun sekiranya amalan baik saya', 'order' => 317],
            ['start_time' => 1081.21, 'end_time' => 1086.51, 'target_text' => 'encouraged others to do good, I will continue to get a good deed for as long as they did the good.', 'source_text' => 'mendorong orang lain turut berbuat baik, saya akan terus menerima pahala kebaikan itu selagi mana mereka mengamalkannya.', 'order' => 318],
            ['start_time' => 1086.62, 'end_time' => 1094.95, 'target_text' => 'And if my bad deed encouraged others to do bad, I will continue to receive a sin for as long as they did bad because of them', 'source_text' => 'Dan sekiranya perbuatan buruk saya mendorong orang lain melakukan kemungkaran, saya akan berterusan menanggung dosa selagi mana mereka berbuat jahat kerana', 'order' => 319],
            ['start_time' => 1095.06, 'end_time' => 1096.08, 'target_text' => 'watching me.', 'source_text' => 'melihat perbuatan saya.', 'order' => 320],
            ['start_time' => 1096.17, 'end_time' => 1103.36, 'target_text' => 'Woman sunna sunnatan sayyi\'atan falahu izruha wa wizru man \'amila biha ila yawmil qiyamati.', 'source_text' => 'Wa man sanna sunnatan sayyi\'atan fa \'alayhi wizruha wa wizru man \'amila biha ila yawmil qiyamah.', 'order' => 321],
            ['start_time' => 1103.45, 'end_time' => 1107.12, 'target_text' => 'La yanqusu dhalika min awzarihim shay\'.', 'source_text' => 'La yanqusu dhalika min awzarihim shay\'a.', 'order' => 322],
            ['start_time' => 1107.21, 'end_time' => 1112.99, 'target_text' => 'Very scary hadith where the Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam says, firstly he speaks about those who set a good example,', 'source_text' => 'Sebuah hadis yang amat menggetarkan hati di mana Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam bersabda — pertamanya Baginda menyebut tentang mereka yang menunjukkan teladan yang baik,', 'order' => 323],
            ['start_time' => 1113.1, 'end_time' => 1118.23, 'target_text' => 'they get a reward for the for the deed they did and they get a reward for everyone who followed that good deed.', 'source_text' => 'mereka beroleh ganjaran pahala atas amalan yang dilakukan dan pahala bagi setiap insan yang mencontohi amalan soleh tersebut.', 'order' => 324],
            ['start_time' => 1118.34, 'end_time' => 1125.39, 'target_text' => 'But those who set a bad example, they receive a sin for that particular example they set and they get a sin for everyone who', 'source_text' => 'Sebaliknya mereka yang memulakan contoh teladan yang buruk, mereka menanggung dosa atas amalan buruk yang dimulakan dan menanggung dosa setiap insan yang', 'order' => 325],
            ['start_time' => 1125.49, 'end_time' => 1127.67, 'target_text' => 'followed it from them.', 'source_text' => 'mengikutinya selepas mereka.', 'order' => 326],
            ['start_time' => 1127.78, 'end_time' => 1131.95, 'target_text' => 'So I say my brothers, when you are smoking your weed,', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu saya berpesan, wahai saudaraku, sekiranya anda sedang menghisap ganja sekalipun,', 'order' => 327],
            ['start_time' => 1132.06, 'end_time' => 1134.67, 'target_text' => 'feel it within your heart, I need to quit this habit.', 'source_text' => 'sematkanlah rasa keinsafan di dalam lubuk hati anda bahawa, "Aku mesti meninggalkan tabiat buruk ini."', 'order' => 328],
            ['start_time' => 1134.78, 'end_time' => 1139.71, 'target_text' => 'But don\'t ever call the other youngsters who are innocent and doing nothing, "Guys, do you know what this is all about?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jangan sesekali anda mengajak anak-anak muda lain yang suci dan tidak tahu apa-apa dengan berkata, "Kawan-kawan, tahu tak benda ini macam mana rasanya?', 'order' => 329],
            ['start_time' => 1139.82, 'end_time' => 1140.88, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s try it out, guys.', 'source_text' => 'Jomlah cuba sama-sama.', 'order' => 330],
            ['start_time' => 1140.97, 'end_time' => 1141.95, 'target_text' => 'It\'s quite good.', 'source_text' => 'Rasanya memang best.', 'order' => 331],
            ['start_time' => 1142.06, 'end_time' => 1145.8, 'target_text' => 'You know, no one who smoked weed died in Corona.', 'source_text' => 'Tahu tak, sesiapa yang hisap ganja langsung tak mati masa musim wabak Corona dulu.', 'order' => 332],
            ['start_time' => 1145.89, 'end_time' => 1149.6, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what they say." La hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah dakwaan mereka." La hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'order' => 333],
            ['start_time' => 1149.69, 'end_time' => 1150.51, 'target_text' => 'Have you ever heard that?', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah anda mendengar alasan sebegini?', 'order' => 334],
            ['start_time' => 1150.62, 'end_time' => 1152.08, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak.', 'order' => 335],
            ['start_time' => 1152.17, 'end_time' => 1153.88, 'target_text' => 'I\'m glad you haven\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bersyukur anda tidak pernah mendengarnya.', 'order' => 336],
            ['start_time' => 1153.97, 'end_time' => 1155.23, 'target_text' => 'Because it\'s not true.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana ia sama sekali tidak benar.', 'order' => 337],
            ['start_time' => 1155.34, 'end_time' => 1158.15, 'target_text' => 'But that\'s what they were claiming in order to get others on weed.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi itulah helah yang mereka cipta semata-mata untuk menjerumuskan orang lain ke kancah ketagihan ganja.', 'order' => 338],
            ['start_time' => 1158.25, 'end_time' => 1160.75, 'target_text' => 'I say, but why are you on weed now suddenly?', 'source_text' => 'Saya bertanya, "Tetapi mengapa tiba-tiba sekarang kamu menghisap ganja?"', 'order' => 339],
            ['start_time' => 1160.86, 'end_time' => 1161.84, 'target_text' => 'Before they used to hide it.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu mereka menyembunyikannya.', 'order' => 340],
            ['start_time' => 1161.93, 'end_time' => 1163.8, 'target_text' => 'Now they say, "Sheikh, you know, I have one weakness.', 'source_text' => 'Kini dengan selamba mereka berkata, "Syeikh, saya ada satu kelemahan.', 'order' => 341],
            ['start_time' => 1163.89, 'end_time' => 1166.39, 'target_text' => 'I\'m just on weed." La ilaha illallah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya cuma hisap ganja saja." La ilaha illallah.', 'order' => 342],
            ['start_time' => 1166.49, 'end_time' => 1167.75, 'target_text' => 'Keep it away from who am I?', 'source_text' => 'Jauhkanlah pengakuan itu daripada saya, siapalah saya ini?', 'order' => 343],
            ['start_time' => 1167.86, 'end_time' => 1168.56, 'target_text' => 'I\'m not your Lord.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bukan Tuhan kamu.', 'order' => 344],
            ['start_time' => 1168.65, 'end_time' => 1169.71, 'target_text' => 'Why do you have to tell me?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa kamu perlu mengaku dosa kepada saya?', 'order' => 345],
            ['start_time' => 1169.82, 'end_time' => 1171.04, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t have to confess to me.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu tidak perlu meluahkan pengakuan dosa kepada saya.', 'order' => 346],
            ['start_time' => 1171.13, 'end_time' => 1171.99, 'target_text' => 'This is Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Inilah agama Islam.', 'order' => 347],
            ['start_time' => 1172.1, 'end_time' => 1175.47, 'target_text' => 'In Islam, confession is only to your Lord, not to anyone else.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam Islam, pengakuan dosa hanyalah semata-mata kepada Tuhanmu, bukan kepada mana-mana makhluk lain.', 'order' => 348],
            ['start_time' => 1175.58, 'end_time' => 1176.75, 'target_text' => 'You want help, go and seek it.', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda memerlukan rawatan dan pertolongan, pergilah dapatkannya.', 'order' => 349],
            ['start_time' => 1176.86, 'end_time' => 1179.08, 'target_text' => 'But don\'t come and say proudly that you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jangan datang dan bercakap dengan rasa megah bahawa tahukah anda?', 'order' => 350],
            ['start_time' => 1179.17, 'end_time' => 1180.08, 'target_text' => 'I just have one addiction.', 'source_text' => '"Saya cuma ada satu ketagihan saja.', 'order' => 351],
            ['start_time' => 1180.17, 'end_time' => 1181.71, 'target_text' => 'I\'m addicted to zina.', 'source_text' => 'Saya cuma ketagih berzina."', 'order' => 352],
            ['start_time' => 1181.82, 'end_time' => 1183.63, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t have to tell I just have.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak perlu berkata, "Saya cuma ada."', 'order' => 353],
            ['start_time' => 1183.73, 'end_time' => 1186.15, 'target_text' => 'That just have is an insult to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Perkataan \'cuma ada\' itu adalah suatu penghinaan terhadap kemurkaan Allah.', 'order' => 354],
            ['start_time' => 1186.25, 'end_time' => 1187.04, 'target_text' => 'How can you say that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana anda sanggup memperkecilkan dosa sedemikian?', 'order' => 355],
            ['start_time' => 1187.13, 'end_time' => 1189.17, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a sin.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah suatu perbuatan dosa.', 'order' => 356],
            ['start_time' => 1191.21, 'end_time' => 1192.23, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a massive sin.', 'source_text' => 'Ia suatu dosa yang teramat besar.', 'order' => 357],
            ['start_time' => 1192.34, 'end_time' => 1194.39, 'target_text' => 'You think it\'s small, but no, it isn\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menyangkanya perkara kecil, hakikatnya tidak sama sekali.', 'order' => 358],
            ['start_time' => 1194.49, 'end_time' => 1197.6, 'target_text' => 'So, we ask Allah to strengthen us and to grant us goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, kita memohon kepada Allah agar mengurniakan kita kekuatan dan melimpahkan kebaikan kepada kita.', 'order' => 359],
            ['start_time' => 1197.69, 'end_time' => 1202.04, 'target_text' => 'When you have removed your hijab, for example, don\'t encourage others to do that.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda membuka hijab anda, sebagai contoh, janganlah mengajak wanita lain melakukan perkara yang sama.', 'order' => 360],
            ['start_time' => 1202.13, 'end_time' => 1207.12, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t display it and tell people, "Guys, I took it off because, you know, I don\'t think this and don\'t think that." There', 'source_text' => 'Jangan menunjukkannya di media sosial dan memberitahu orang ramai, "Kawan-kawan, saya buka tudung sebab saya fikir begini dan begitu." Pasti', 'order' => 361],
            ['start_time' => 1207.21, 'end_time' => 1209.67, 'target_text' => 'will be people who did not doubt at all.', 'source_text' => 'ada insan yang asalnya langsung tiada rasa ragu-ragu terhadap kewajipan bertudung.', 'order' => 362],
            ['start_time' => 1209.78, 'end_time' => 1216.36, 'target_text' => 'When you instill the doubt, one day, 10 years down the line, and I have seen this, when you don the hijab again, but they', 'source_text' => 'Namun apabila anda menyemai keraguan itu, suatu hari nanti 10 tahun akan datang — dan saya pernah menyaksikan sendiri perkara ini — apabila anda memakai semula hijab tetapi mereka', 'order' => 363],
            ['start_time' => 1216.45, 'end_time' => 1219.63, 'target_text' => 'all went astray because of you, what\'s going to happen?', 'source_text' => 'semua telah tersesat jalan disebabkan kata-kata anda dahulu, apakah yang bakal terjadi?', 'order' => 364],
            ['start_time' => 1219.73, 'end_time' => 1221.6, 'target_text' => 'We hope and pray that Allah forgive you.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sentiasa berharap dan berdoa semoga Allah mengampunkan anda.', 'order' => 365],
            ['start_time' => 1221.69, 'end_time' => 1223.28, 'target_text' => 'And Allah forgive all of us.', 'source_text' => 'Dan semoga Allah mengampunkan dosa kita semua.', 'order' => 366],
            ['start_time' => 1223.38, 'end_time' => 1229.21, 'target_text' => 'So, I have a very, very interesting encouragement for you tonight.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, saya mempunyai satu peringatan dan motivasi yang amat menarik untuk anda pada malam ini.', 'order' => 367],
            ['start_time' => 1229.38, 'end_time' => 1230.6, 'target_text' => 'I want to change my life.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin mengubah hidup saya.', 'order' => 368],
            ['start_time' => 1230.69, 'end_time' => 1231.95, 'target_text' => 'I want to make it better.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mahu menjadikannya lebih baik.', 'order' => 369],
            ['start_time' => 1232.06, 'end_time' => 1234.39, 'target_text' => 'I want to get closer to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mahu mendekatkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 370],
            ['start_time' => 1234.49, 'end_time' => 1236.99, 'target_text' => 'Any one of us could say this, and we should be saying this.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap daripada kita mampu mengucapkan tekad ini, dan sememangnya kita patut melafazkannya.', 'order' => 371],
            ['start_time' => 1237.1, 'end_time' => 1238.32, 'target_text' => 'I want to become better.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mahu menjadi insan yang lebih baik.', 'order' => 372],
            ['start_time' => 1238.41, 'end_time' => 1239.47, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve committed sins.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah melakukan dosa.', 'order' => 373],
            ['start_time' => 1239.58, 'end_time' => 1241.67, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve done a lot of wrong things in my life.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah melakukan pelbagai kesilapan sepanjang hidup saya.', 'order' => 374],
            ['start_time' => 1241.78, 'end_time' => 1246.8, 'target_text' => 'I am at a position in my life where I feel that perhaps I might die anytime.', 'source_text' => 'Kini saya berada pada fasa kehidupan di mana saya merasakan mungkin maut boleh menjemput saya pada bila-bila masa.', 'order' => 375],
            ['start_time' => 1246.89, 'end_time' => 1247.43, 'target_text' => 'You never know.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak pernah tahu.', 'order' => 376],
            ['start_time' => 1247.54, 'end_time' => 1254.8, 'target_text' => 'There are healthy people, fit people who go to the gym regularly, who are eating healthy, and suddenly, 35, 40 years old,', 'source_text' => 'Ada orang yang sihat tubuh badan, cergas dan kerap bersenam di gimnasium, menjaga pemakanan yang sihat, tiba-tiba pada usia 35 atau 40 tahun,', 'order' => 377],
            ['start_time' => 1254.89, 'end_time' => 1257.04, 'target_text' => 'heart attack, boom, and they\'re gone back to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'diserang sakit jantung, terus menghembuskan nafas terakhir dan kembali menemui Allah.', 'order' => 378],
            ['start_time' => 1257.13, 'end_time' => 1258.71, 'target_text' => 'And one wonders what their condition is.', 'source_text' => 'Dan orang tertanya-tanya bagaimanakah keadaan kesudahan mereka.', 'order' => 379],
            ['start_time' => 1258.82, 'end_time' => 1261.84, 'target_text' => 'May Allah make it easy for us the day he takes us away.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mempermudahkan urusan kita pada hari Dia mengambil kembali nyawa kita.', 'order' => 380],
            ['start_time' => 1261.93, 'end_time' => 1270.43, 'target_text' => 'But I need to ensure that I become better because with your intention and the strength and power of your intention, Allah', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya mesti memastikan bahawa saya berusaha menjadi lebih baik, kerana dengan keikhlasan niat serta kekuatan tekad anda, Allah', 'order' => 381],
            ['start_time' => 1270.54, 'end_time' => 1279.23, 'target_text' => 'will grant you paradise even if you did not complete the circle and the circuit that you intended to compete at the to complete.', 'source_text' => 'akan mengurniakan syurga kepada anda sekalipun anda belum sempat menyempurnakan seluruh perancangan ibadah yang anda azamkan.', 'order' => 382],
            ['start_time' => 1279.34, 'end_time' => 1285.84, 'target_text' => 'If I intend to become a half a and I started today and I learned a small portion every day and I was moving forward and one', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya berniat untuk menjadi seorang hafiz dan saya memulakannya hari ini dengan menghafal sedikit demi sedikit setiap hari, dan saya terus melangkah ke hadapan namun suatu', 'order' => 383],
            ['start_time' => 1285.93, 'end_time' => 1293.12, 'target_text' => 'day I died, Allah will write my name among the huffaz and those who memorized the Quran even though I only did five Jews.', 'source_text' => 'hari saya meninggal dunia, Allah tetap akan mencatatkan nama saya dalam kalangan para huffaz dan mereka yang menghafal al-Quran walaupun saya baru sempat menghafal lima juzuk.', 'order' => 384],
            ['start_time' => 1293.21, 'end_time' => 1300.19, 'target_text' => 'For as long as there was intention, I started it, I continued it and the only thing that stopped me was death.', 'source_text' => 'Selagi mana ada keikhlasan niat, saya telah memulakannya, saya berterusan melakukannya dan satu-satunya perkara yang menghentikan saya hanyalah ajal maut,', 'order' => 385],
            ['start_time' => 1300.3, 'end_time' => 1301.28, 'target_text' => 'Allah will write it for you.', 'source_text' => 'Allah pasti akan mencatatkan pahala penuh itu untuk anda.', 'order' => 386],
            ['start_time' => 1301.38, 'end_time' => 1306.8, 'target_text' => 'There\'s no doubt because Allah says he will judge you by your intentions and this was the intention.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada keraguan padanya kerana Allah berfirman bahawa Dia menilai kamu berdasarkan niatmu, dan itulah niat sebenar kamu.', 'order' => 387],
            ['start_time' => 1306.89, 'end_time' => 1314.71, 'target_text' => 'Similarly, when a person comes for salah every day and he fulfills his prayer say Fajr in a certain place, the day he is sick', 'source_text' => 'Begitu juga halnya apabila seseorang istiqamah menunaikan solat berjemaah setiap hari, katakanlah solat Subuh di tempat tertentu, pada hari dia jatuh sakit', 'order' => 388],
            ['start_time' => 1314.82, 'end_time' => 1318.88, 'target_text' => 'and ill, he may do it somewhere at home or whatever it might be, but guess what?', 'source_text' => 'dan uzur, dia mungkin menunaikannya di rumah atau di mana sahaja, tetapi tahukah anda apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 389],
            ['start_time' => 1318.97, 'end_time' => 1325.99, 'target_text' => 'The angels will write him having attended that particular salah in the masjid simply because the only thing that stopped him', 'source_text' => 'Para malaikat tetap akan mencatatkannya seolah-olah dia hadir menunaikan solat berjemaah di masjid tersebut, semata-mata kerana satu-satunya penghalang', 'order' => 390],
            ['start_time' => 1326.1, 'end_time' => 1329.63, 'target_text' => 'from coming there was a sickness that he had no control over.', 'source_text' => 'yang menyebabkannya tidak dapat hadir adalah keuzuran yang di luar kawalannya.', 'order' => 391],
            ['start_time' => 1329.73, 'end_time' => 1331.32, 'target_text' => 'Allah says we write for you that deed.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: Kami tetap mencatatkan ganjaran amalan itu untukmu.', 'order' => 392],
            ['start_time' => 1331.41, 'end_time' => 1332.36, 'target_text' => 'Who is Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah Allah?', 'order' => 393],
            ['start_time' => 1332.45, 'end_time' => 1334.56, 'target_text' => 'Allah is the most honorable.', 'source_text' => 'Allah adalah Yang Maha Mulia.', 'order' => 394],
            ['start_time' => 1334.65, 'end_time' => 1336.51, 'target_text' => 'Allah is the most generous.', 'source_text' => 'Allah adalah Yang Maha Pemurah.', 'order' => 395],
            ['start_time' => 1336.62, 'end_time' => 1337.43, 'target_text' => 'The most generous.', 'source_text' => 'Zat Yang Maha Mengurniakan.', 'order' => 396],
            ['start_time' => 1337.54, 'end_time' => 1338.43, 'target_text' => 'You think you are generous.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menyangka diri anda pemurah.', 'order' => 397],
            ['start_time' => 1338.54, 'end_time' => 1339.56, 'target_text' => 'You know what Allah does?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang Allah lakukan?', 'order' => 398],
            ['start_time' => 1339.65, 'end_time' => 1342.19, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "Okay, you sinned all your life.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman, "Baiklah, kamu pernah berbuat dosa sepanjang hidupmu.', 'order' => 399],
            ['start_time' => 1342.3, 'end_time' => 1348.12, 'target_text' => 'Then there came a time when either you went for Hajj or Umrah or something happened, whatever happened and you changed your', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian tiba suatu saat di mana sama ada kamu menunaikan haji, umrah, atau berlaku sesuatu peristiwa yang menyedarkan kamu, apa jua yang berlaku lalu kamu mengubah', 'order' => 400],
            ['start_time' => 1348.21, 'end_time' => 1350.95, 'target_text' => 'life and you came back and you quit your sins.', 'source_text' => 'cara hidup kamu dan kamu kembali serta meninggalkan dosa-dosa kamu.', 'order' => 401],
            ['start_time' => 1351.06, 'end_time' => 1354.91, 'target_text' => 'Nothing made you quit them besides me, besides Allah meaning.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada apa yang membuatkan kamu meninggalkannya melainkan Aku — yakni kerana Allah semata-mata.', 'order' => 402],
            ['start_time' => 1355.01, 'end_time' => 1360.04, 'target_text' => 'Nothing made you quit besides Allah and you changed your life and you started doing good deeds for my pleasure.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada apa yang mendorong kamu berhenti melainkan Allah, lalu kamu mengubah hidupmu dan mula beramal soleh demi mencari keredaan-Ku.', 'order' => 403],
            ['start_time' => 1360.13, 'end_time' => 1366.39, 'target_text' => 'I want to tell you what I\'m going to do for you, a bonus." At the in the Quran, Allah tells us, "I will take those bad deeds', 'source_text' => 'Aku ingin memberitahu kamu apa yang akan Aku kurniakan kepadamu, suatu ganjaran bonus." Di dalam al-Quran, Allah memberitahu kita, "Aku akan mengambil amalan buruk itu', 'order' => 404],
            ['start_time' => 1366.49, 'end_time' => 1372.6, 'target_text' => 'and I will put them on the right side of the scale and consider them as good deeds even though they were done as bad deeds."', 'source_text' => 'dan meletakkannya di sebelah kanan timbangan mizan lalu mengira semuanya sebagai amalan kebajikan, sekalipun dahulu ia dilakukan sebagai kemungkaran."', 'order' => 405],
            ['start_time' => 1372.69, 'end_time' => 1375.63, 'target_text' => 'Can there be anyone more generous than Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah sesiapa yang lebih pemurah daripada Allah?', 'order' => 406],
            ['start_time' => 1375.73, 'end_time' => 1376.84, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sesiapa.', 'order' => 407],
            ['start_time' => 1376.93, 'end_time' => 1378.73, 'target_text' => 'Illuminata', 'source_text' => 'Illa man taba...', 'order' => 408],
            ['start_time' => 1397.38, 'end_time' => 1398.8, 'target_text' => 'What a beautiful verse.', 'source_text' => 'Betapa indahnya ayat al-Quran ini.', 'order' => 409],
            ['start_time' => 1398.89, 'end_time' => 1400.51, 'target_text' => 'Surat al-Furqan, right at the end.', 'source_text' => 'Surah al-Furqan, betul-betul di bahagian penghujungnya.', 'order' => 410],
            ['start_time' => 1400.62, 'end_time' => 1403.8, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "Hey, we will punish those who do bad.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman, "Ketahuilah, Kami akan mengazab mereka yang berbuat kejahatan.', 'order' => 411],
            ['start_time' => 1403.89, 'end_time' => 1411.91, 'target_text' => 'We will multiply the punishment for some, but as for those who repented and did good deeds thereafter, we will convert their', 'source_text' => 'Kami akan melipatgandakan azab bagi sebahagian orang, namun bagi sesiapa yang bertaubat dan beramal soleh selepas itu, Kami akan menukar', 'order' => 412],
            ['start_time' => 1412.01, 'end_time' => 1413.95, 'target_text' => 'bad deeds into good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'keburukan mereka menjadi amalan-amalan kebajikan."', 'order' => 413],
            ['start_time' => 1414.06, 'end_time' => 1417.32, 'target_text' => 'When you go on the day of qiyamah, you see so many good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda dibangkitkan pada hari kiamat, anda melihat begitu banyak pahala amalan kebaikan.', 'order' => 414],
            ['start_time' => 1417.41, 'end_time' => 1418.6, 'target_text' => 'What is this, oh Allah?', 'source_text' => '"Apakah semua ini, ya Allah?"', 'order' => 415],
            ['start_time' => 1418.69, 'end_time' => 1421.95, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "You changed your life, and you came back to me.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman, "Kamu telah mengubah hidupmu dan kembali kepada-Ku.', 'order' => 416],
            ['start_time' => 1422.06, 'end_time' => 1429.88, 'target_text' => 'I had to change all your bad deeds into good because the only thing that stopped you from continuing that was my love and', 'source_text' => 'Maka Aku menukar segala dosa keburukanmu menjadi pahala kebaikan kerana satu-satunya perkara yang menghentikan kamu daripada meneruskannya adalah rasa cinta dan', 'order' => 417],
            ['start_time' => 1429.97, 'end_time' => 1430.95, 'target_text' => 'my connection.', 'source_text' => 'hubunganmu dengan-Ku.', 'order' => 418],
            ['start_time' => 1431.06, 'end_time' => 1431.6, 'target_text' => 'That\'s it.', 'source_text' => 'Itu sahaja puncanya.', 'order' => 419],
            ['start_time' => 1431.69, 'end_time' => 1433.36, 'target_text' => 'For that, I give you the bonus.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana sebab itulah, Aku mengurniakan kamu ganjaran bonus ini."', 'order' => 420],
            ['start_time' => 1433.45, 'end_time' => 1434.43, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 421],
            ['start_time' => 1434.54, 'end_time' => 1434.93, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 422],
            ['start_time' => 1435.01, 'end_time' => 1435.99, 'target_text' => 'That\'s Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sifat Maha Pengasih Allah.', 'order' => 423],
            ['start_time' => 1436.1, 'end_time' => 1437.6, 'target_text' => 'Now, wouldn\'t we love that?', 'source_text' => 'Tidakkah kita mendambakan kurniaan seindah itu?', 'order' => 424],
            ['start_time' => 1437.69, 'end_time' => 1438.95, 'target_text' => 'What is Allah asking of you?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang Allah tuntut daripada diri anda?', 'order' => 425],
            ['start_time' => 1439.06, 'end_time' => 1440.43, 'target_text' => 'What does Islam say?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah seruan ajaran Islam?', 'order' => 426],
            ['start_time' => 1440.54, 'end_time' => 1442.08, 'target_text' => 'Why is there an attack on Islam?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa sentiasa ada serangan dan tohmahan terhadap Islam?', 'order' => 427],
            ['start_time' => 1442.17, 'end_time' => 1446.12, 'target_text' => 'Because Islam is the only religion that promotes', 'source_text' => 'Kerana Islam adalah satu-satunya agama yang mengangkat', 'order' => 428],
            ['start_time' => 1446.21, 'end_time' => 1449.28, 'target_text' => 'the highest of values and morals.', 'source_text' => 'nilai-nilai akhlak dan moral yang paling murni lagi terpuji.', 'order' => 429],
            ['start_time' => 1449.38, 'end_time' => 1453.12, 'target_text' => 'And your connection with your maker alone and the one whom you\'re going to go back to.', 'source_text' => 'Serta memelihara hubunganmu dengan Penciptamu semata-mata, Zat yang kepada-Nya jua kamu bakal dikembalikan.', 'order' => 430],
            ['start_time' => 1453.21, 'end_time' => 1455.39, 'target_text' => 'Look, I might be a famous person.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah, saya mungkin seorang yang terkenal.', 'order' => 431],
            ['start_time' => 1455.49, 'end_time' => 1456.71, 'target_text' => 'I want to tell you something.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin berkongsi sesuatu dengan anda.', 'order' => 432],
            ['start_time' => 1456.82, 'end_time' => 1459.19, 'target_text' => 'Fame means nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Populariti itu langsung tiada nilai.', 'order' => 433],
            ['start_time' => 1459.3, 'end_time' => 1460.8, 'target_text' => 'It means zero.', 'source_text' => 'Nilainya sifar di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 434],
            ['start_time' => 1460.89, 'end_time' => 1464.15, 'target_text' => 'The worst from among humankind are probably also famous.', 'source_text' => 'Makhluk yang paling jahat dalam kalangan umat manusia juga mungkin sangat terkenal.', 'order' => 435],
            ['start_time' => 1464.25, 'end_time' => 1466.08, 'target_text' => 'Shaitan is absolutely famous.', 'source_text' => 'Syaitan adalah makhluk yang tersangat popular.', 'order' => 436],
            ['start_time' => 1466.17, 'end_time' => 1467.56, 'target_text' => 'Do you know that?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda hakikat itu?', 'order' => 437],
            ['start_time' => 1467.65, 'end_time' => 1469.56, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 438],
            ['start_time' => 1469.65, 'end_time' => 1471.32, 'target_text' => 'How many of you have heard of Shaitan?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai antara anda yang pernah mendengar nama Syaitan?', 'order' => 439],
            ['start_time' => 1471.41, 'end_time' => 1473.15, 'target_text' => 'Put up your hands.', 'source_text' => 'Sila angkat tangan anda.', 'order' => 440],
            ['start_time' => 1473.25, 'end_time' => 1474.36, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the whole masjid.', 'source_text' => 'Satu masjid semuanya mengangkat tangan.', 'order' => 441],
            ['start_time' => 1474.45, 'end_time' => 1476.95, 'target_text' => 'Isn\'t Shaitan more famous than you and I?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah Syaitan jauh lebih terkenal daripada anda dan saya?', 'order' => 442],
            ['start_time' => 1477.06, 'end_time' => 1479.63, 'target_text' => 'Does it make him a big rock star or something?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah populariti itu menjadikannya seorang bintang hebat atau tokoh mulia?', 'order' => 443],
            ['start_time' => 1479.73, 'end_time' => 1481.15, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 444],
            ['start_time' => 1481.25, 'end_time' => 1483.67, 'target_text' => 'Some of the most famous people are some of the worst.', 'source_text' => 'Sesetengah manusia yang paling terkenal di dunia adalah antara makhluk yang paling buruk perilakunya.', 'order' => 445],
            ['start_time' => 1483.78, 'end_time' => 1487.51, 'target_text' => 'So, for me to be famous, it means nothing in the eyes of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, bagi diri saya menjadi terkenal, ia langsung tiada erti di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 446],
            ['start_time' => 1487.62, 'end_time' => 1490.56, 'target_text' => 'La yaswa indallahi janaha ba\'udah.', 'source_text' => 'La yaswa \'indallahi janaha ba\'udah — tidak bernilai walau seberat sayap nyamuk.', 'order' => 447],
            ['start_time' => 1490.65, 'end_time' => 1492.36, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, I\'m telling you it means nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, saya berterus-terang kepada anda bahawa kemasyhuran itu tiada nilai.', 'order' => 448],
            ['start_time' => 1492.45, 'end_time' => 1496.51, 'target_text' => 'If I\'m sitting here and I bring you closer to me, I\'ve lost.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya duduk di sini dan sekadar menarik anda mengagumi diri saya, sesungguhnya saya adalah insan yang rugi.', 'order' => 449],
            ['start_time' => 1496.62, 'end_time' => 1502.95, 'target_text' => 'But if I\'m sitting here and I remind you of Allah, only on the day of judgement we will see what happened.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi sekiranya saya duduk di sini dan mengingatkan anda kembali kepada Allah, hanya pada hari perhitungan kelak kita akan melihat apa hasilnya.', 'order' => 450],
            ['start_time' => 1503.06, 'end_time' => 1504.32, 'target_text' => 'Only on the day of judgement.', 'source_text' => 'Hanya pada hari pengadilan kelak.', 'order' => 451],
            ['start_time' => 1504.41, 'end_time' => 1507.23, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be deceived by the likes and the follows.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan sesekali anda terpedaya dengan jumlah \'likes\' dan pengikut di media sosial.', 'order' => 452],
            ['start_time' => 1507.34, 'end_time' => 1512.67, 'target_text' => 'I\'m telling you sitting from a position of a person who has a lot of likes and follows.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bercakap kepada anda dari posisi seseorang yang memiliki jumlah \'likes\' dan jutaan pengikut.', 'order' => 453],
            ['start_time' => 1512.78, 'end_time' => 1515.36, 'target_text' => 'And I want to tell you it means nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya ingin menegaskan bahawa semua itu langsung tiada nilai hakiki.', 'order' => 454],
            ['start_time' => 1515.45, 'end_time' => 1523.56, 'target_text' => 'Those who are enslaved by the likes and follows, they will never taste contentment on earth, I guarantee you.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka yang menjadi hamba kepada \'likes\' dan jumlah pengikut, saya jamin mereka tidak akan pernah mengecap kemanisan ketenangan hidup di dunia ini.', 'order' => 455],
            ['start_time' => 1523.65, 'end_time' => 1528.75, 'target_text' => 'Because not a moment did Allah say that your contentment lies in likes and follows.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana tidak sedetik pun Allah menjanjikan bahawa ketenangan jiwa anda terletak pada jumlah \'likes\' dan pengikut.', 'order' => 456],
            ['start_time' => 1528.86, 'end_time' => 1531.47, 'target_text' => 'In order to get likes and follows, do you know what you need to do?', 'source_text' => 'Demi meraih \'likes\' dan pengikut hari ini, tahukah anda apa yang sanggup sesetengah orang lakukan?', 'order' => 457],
            ['start_time' => 1531.58, 'end_time' => 1533.71, 'target_text' => 'You need to do the silliest of things.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu melakukan perkara-perkara yang paling mengarut dan bodoh.', 'order' => 458],
            ['start_time' => 1533.82, 'end_time' => 1535.12, 'target_text' => 'The silliest of things.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara yang paling tidak masuk akal.', 'order' => 459],
            ['start_time' => 1535.21, 'end_time' => 1538.12, 'target_text' => 'You need to follow trends that don\'t make sense.', 'source_text' => 'Anda terpaksa meniru ikutan trend yang langsung tiada faedah.', 'order' => 460],
            ['start_time' => 1538.21, 'end_time' => 1541.71, 'target_text' => 'And you need to 67 your entire life.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda perlu membazirkan masa hidup anda dengan trend karut seperti 67.', 'order' => 461],
            ['start_time' => 1541.82, 'end_time' => 1543.84, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 462],
            ['start_time' => 1543.93, 'end_time' => 1546.36, 'target_text' => 'See, the kids knew what I was What did I say?', 'source_text' => 'Lihat, anak-anak kecil ini faham apa yang saya sebutkan tadi. Apa yang saya sebut tadi?', 'order' => 463],
            ['start_time' => 1546.45, 'end_time' => 1548.04, 'target_text' => '67.', 'source_text' => '67.', 'order' => 464],
            ['start_time' => 1548.13, 'end_time' => 1549.67, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 465],
            ['start_time' => 1549.78, 'end_time' => 1550.47, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 466],
            ['start_time' => 1550.58, 'end_time' => 1551.6, 'target_text' => 'But, what is it?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi apakah maknanya?', 'order' => 467],
            ['start_time' => 1551.69, 'end_time' => 1554.15, 'target_text' => 'If I ask you what does 67 mean, they don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya bertanya kepada anda apa maksud 67, mereka sendiri tidak tahu.', 'order' => 468],
            ['start_time' => 1554.25, 'end_time' => 1555.23, 'target_text' => 'No one knows.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sesiapa pun yang tahu.', 'order' => 469],
            ['start_time' => 1555.34, 'end_time' => 1558.32, 'target_text' => 'Even the people who first said 67.', 'source_text' => 'Malah orang yang mula-mula mencipta trend 67 itu pun tidak tahu.', 'order' => 470],
            ['start_time' => 1558.41, 'end_time' => 1558.91, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan tahukah anda apa yang berlaku seterusnya?', 'order' => 471],
            ['start_time' => 1559.01, 'end_time' => 1561.32, 'target_text' => 'In 2027, they\'re planning to say 78.', 'source_text' => 'Menjelang tahun 2027 kelak, mereka bercadang mencipta trend 78 pula.', 'order' => 472],
            ['start_time' => 1561.41, 'end_time' => 1562.75, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 473],
            ['start_time' => 1562.86, 'end_time' => 1564.39, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 474],
            ['start_time' => 1564.49, 'end_time' => 1566.63, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s life, and that\'s how we will continue.', 'source_text' => 'Begitulah lumrah kehidupan duniawi dan begitulah ia akan berterusan.', 'order' => 475],
            ['start_time' => 1566.73, 'end_time' => 1571.99, 'target_text' => 'So, no matter how much of fun you might have, don\'t ever do it for likes and follows.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, walau sebesar mana sekalipun keseronokan yang anda nikmati, jangan sesekali melakukannya semata-mata demi mengejar \'likes\' dan pengikut.', 'order' => 476],
            ['start_time' => 1572.1, 'end_time' => 1576.3, 'target_text' => 'Another thing is, in order for us today', 'source_text' => 'Satu perkara lagi, demi meraih', 'order' => 477],
            ['start_time' => 1577.13, 'end_time' => 1582.97, 'target_text' => 'to gain likes and follows, many people have to remain on', 'source_text' => '\'likes\' dan pengikut pada hari ini, ramai orang terpaksa bersiaran langsung dalam talian', 'order' => 478],
            ['start_time' => 1583.17, 'end_time' => 1586.39, 'target_text' => 'alive for a long, long time.', 'source_text' => 'secara \'live\' untuk tempoh masa yang sangat lama.', 'order' => 479],
            ['start_time' => 1586.49, 'end_time' => 1587.12, 'target_text' => 'But guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi tahukah anda apa yang menyedihkan?', 'order' => 480],
            ['start_time' => 1587.21, 'end_time' => 1589.95, 'target_text' => 'You were not live with Allah at the time of salah.', 'source_text' => 'Anda langsung tidak \'live\' bersama Allah pada waktu solat fardu.', 'order' => 481],
            ['start_time' => 1590.06, 'end_time' => 1593.32, 'target_text' => 'You were not live with Allah at the time that you needed to be there.', 'source_text' => 'Anda langsung tidak \'live\' bermunajat kepada Allah pada saat-saat genting anda sepatutnya bersujud kepada-Nya.', 'order' => 482],
            ['start_time' => 1593.41, 'end_time' => 1595.15, 'target_text' => 'But you were live with everyone else.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaliknya anda bersiaran \'live\' bersama seluruh manusia lain.', 'order' => 483],
            ['start_time' => 1595.25, 'end_time' => 1597.6, 'target_text' => 'Okay, you got a million followers, big deal.', 'source_text' => 'Baiklah, katakan anda meraih sejuta pengikut, suatu pencapaian besar kononnya.', 'order' => 484],
            ['start_time' => 1597.69, 'end_time' => 1599.12, 'target_text' => 'Big deal for the dunya.', 'source_text' => 'Pencapaian besar untuk urusan duniawi semata-mata.', 'order' => 485],
            ['start_time' => 1599.21, 'end_time' => 1601.19, 'target_text' => 'Will that take you to jannah?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah itu yang bakal memimpin anda ke syurga?', 'order' => 486],
            ['start_time' => 1601.3, 'end_time' => 1602.99, 'target_text' => 'Not at all.', 'source_text' => 'Sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 487],
            ['start_time' => 1603.1, 'end_time' => 1605.67, 'target_text' => 'Unless you reminded them of goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Melainkan sekiranya anda memanfaatkan platform itu untuk mengingatkan manusia kepada kebaikan.', 'order' => 488],
            ['start_time' => 1605.78, 'end_time' => 1608.23, 'target_text' => 'Unless you were saying something good.', 'source_text' => 'Melainkan jika anda menyampaikan nasihat yang bermanfaat.', 'order' => 489],
            ['start_time' => 1608.34, 'end_time' => 1612.23, 'target_text' => 'Unless you were actually upright and call people towards Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Melainkan sekiranya anda benar-benar istiqamah dan mengajak manusia mendekatkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 490],
            ['start_time' => 1612.34, 'end_time' => 1615.71, 'target_text' => 'They like you, they don\'t like you is irrelevant.', 'source_text' => 'Sama ada mereka menyukai anda atau membenci anda, itu langsung tidak penting.', 'order' => 491],
            ['start_time' => 1615.82, 'end_time' => 1619.56, 'target_text' => 'Allah will never say how many likes did you have before you go to paradise?', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak akan sesekali bertanya, "Berapa banyakkah \'likes\' yang kamu kumpul sebelum kamu dibenarkan masuk ke syurga?"', 'order' => 492],
            ['start_time' => 1619.65, 'end_time' => 1620.47, 'target_text' => 'No chance.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada kemungkinan sedemikian.', 'order' => 493],
            ['start_time' => 1620.58, 'end_time' => 1621.19, 'target_text' => 'Not at all.', 'source_text' => 'Langsung tidak.', 'order' => 494],
            ['start_time' => 1621.3, 'end_time' => 1622.08, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be deceived.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan biarkan diri anda tertipu.', 'order' => 495],
            ['start_time' => 1622.17, 'end_time' => 1629.08, 'target_text' => 'My beloved youngsters, even if you are unknown, some of the people closest to Allah, they don\'t even have a single account', 'source_text' => 'Wahai anak-anak mudaku yang dikasihi, sekalipun anda langsung tidak dikenali di dunia, ada dalam kalangan insan yang paling dekat kedudukannya dengan Allah, mereka langsung tiada walau satu akaun', 'order' => 496],
            ['start_time' => 1629.17, 'end_time' => 1631.45, 'target_text' => 'on social media.', 'source_text' => 'di media sosial.', 'order' => 497],
            ['start_time' => 1631.65, 'end_time' => 1636.88, 'target_text' => 'And they are so close to Allah that if they were to make a dua, it would come true almost instantly.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kedudukan mereka begitu akrab dengan Allah sehinggakan sekiranya mereka berdoa, doa mereka dimakbulkan dengan serta-merta.', 'order' => 498],
            ['start_time' => 1636.97, 'end_time' => 1639.88, 'target_text' => 'They are certain people mustajabud dawah.', 'source_text' => 'Merekalah golongan insan yang digelar \'mustajabud da\'wah\'.', 'order' => 499],
            ['start_time' => 1639.97, 'end_time' => 1643.12, 'target_text' => 'Is there a single person that Allah says is mustajabud dawah?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah seseorang itu dikira oleh Allah sebagai mustajabud da\'wah', 'order' => 500],
            ['start_time' => 1643.21, 'end_time' => 1647.88, 'target_text' => 'That means when they make a dua and a supplication, it\'s accepted by Allah readily.', 'source_text' => 'Itu bermakna apabila mereka menadah tangan berdoa dan memohon, doa mereka diperkenankan oleh Allah dengan serta-merta.', 'order' => 501],
            ['start_time' => 1647.97, 'end_time' => 1654.19, 'target_text' => 'Is there any one of those with a quality where someone told them the more likes and follows you have, the quicker your dua', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah sesiapa memberitahu mereka bahawa semakin banyak \'likes\' dan pengikut yang kamu miliki, semakin cepat doa kamu', 'order' => 502],
            ['start_time' => 1654.3, 'end_time' => 1655.08, 'target_text' => 'will be accepted?', 'source_text' => 'akan dimakbulkan?', 'order' => 503],
            ['start_time' => 1655.17, 'end_time' => 1656.12, 'target_text' => 'No chance.', 'source_text' => 'Sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 504],
            ['start_time' => 1656.21, 'end_time' => 1657.39, 'target_text' => 'No chance.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada kaitan sama sekali.', 'order' => 505],
            ['start_time' => 1657.49, 'end_time' => 1659.51, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be duped and deceived.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan biarkan diri anda terpedaya dan tertipu.', 'order' => 506],
            ['start_time' => 1659.62, 'end_time' => 1661.32, 'target_text' => 'It is a huge responsibility.', 'source_text' => 'Ia suatu amanah dan tanggungjawab yang amat berat.', 'order' => 507],
            ['start_time' => 1661.41, 'end_time' => 1662.28, 'target_text' => 'Do you know why?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda mengapa?', 'order' => 508],
            ['start_time' => 1662.38, 'end_time' => 1674.91, 'target_text' => 'My fear is when you forward or like or comment on or promote anything negative, perhaps it is such a huge responsibility that', 'source_text' => 'Kebimbangan terbesar saya adalah apabila anda berkongsi, menekan tanda \'like\', meninggalkan komen atau mempromosikan apa jua perkara mungkar, amanah itu terlalu berat sehingga', 'order' => 509],
            ['start_time' => 1675.01, 'end_time' => 1677.36, 'target_text' => 'that might be our downfall.', 'source_text' => 'ia boleh menjadi punca kebinasaan kita di akhirat kelak.', 'order' => 510],
            ['start_time' => 1677.45, 'end_time' => 1678.95, 'target_text' => 'Look, I want to tell you something.', 'source_text' => 'Dengarlah, saya ingin berkongsi sesuatu yang amat penting dengan anda.', 'order' => 511],
            ['start_time' => 1679.06, 'end_time' => 1681.43, 'target_text' => 'On the day of judgment, we will have a scale.', 'source_text' => 'Pada hari kiamat kelak, akan ada timbangan mizan yang diletakkan.', 'order' => 512],
            ['start_time' => 1681.54, 'end_time' => 1682.99, 'target_text' => 'What type of scale is that?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah bentuk timbangan tersebut?', 'order' => 513],
            ['start_time' => 1683.1, 'end_time' => 1684.71, 'target_text' => 'Anyone tell me?', 'source_text' => 'Ada sesiapa boleh beritahu saya?', 'order' => 514],
            ['start_time' => 1684.82, 'end_time' => 1685.51, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the scale?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah neraca timbangan itu?', 'order' => 515],
            ['start_time' => 1685.62, 'end_time' => 1687.04, 'target_text' => 'Yes, tell me.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, silakan beritahu saya.', 'order' => 516],
            ['start_time' => 1687.13, 'end_time' => 1688.23, 'target_text' => 'Like of good deeds and bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Timbangan amalan baik dan amalan buruk.', 'order' => 517],
            ['start_time' => 1688.34, 'end_time' => 1689.6, 'target_text' => 'Good deeds and bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Amalan kebajikan dan amalan kejahatan.', 'order' => 518],
            ['start_time' => 1689.69, 'end_time' => 1692.63, 'target_text' => 'Which side is the good and which side is the bad?', 'source_text' => 'Sebelah mana diletakkan amalan baik dan sebelah mana diletakkan amalan buruk?', 'order' => 519],
            ['start_time' => 1692.73, 'end_time' => 1694.54, 'target_text' => 'Yes.', 'source_text' => 'Ya.', 'order' => 520],
            ['start_time' => 1694.97, 'end_time' => 1695.6, 'target_text' => 'Right and left.', 'source_text' => 'Kanan dan kiri.', 'order' => 521],
            ['start_time' => 1695.69, 'end_time' => 1696.88, 'target_text' => 'Right is good and left is bad.', 'source_text' => 'Sebelah kanan untuk amalan baik dan sebelah kiri untuk amalan buruk.', 'order' => 522],
            ['start_time' => 1696.97, 'end_time' => 1697.75, 'target_text' => 'Right, correct.', 'source_text' => 'Tepat, jawapan anda betul.', 'order' => 523],
            ['start_time' => 1697.86, 'end_time' => 1700.71, 'target_text' => 'So, imagine you are standing in front of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, bayangkan saat anda sedang berdiri di hadapan Allah.', 'order' => 524],
            ['start_time' => 1700.82, 'end_time' => 1703.39, 'target_text' => 'You are standing, there is a scale, right side, left side.', 'source_text' => 'Anda sedang berdiri menghadap neraca timbangan, ada daun timbangan sebelah kanan dan daun timbangan sebelah kiri.', 'order' => 525],
            ['start_time' => 1703.49, 'end_time' => 1705.15, 'target_text' => 'On the right, they\'re going to put all your good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Di sebelah kanan, malaikat akan meletakkan segala amalan soleh anda.', 'order' => 526],
            ['start_time' => 1705.25, 'end_time' => 1707.08, 'target_text' => 'On the bad, they\'re going to put your bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Di sebelah kiri, mereka akan meletakkan segala dosa keburukan anda.', 'order' => 527],
            ['start_time' => 1707.17, 'end_time' => 1711.43, 'target_text' => 'Now, there are so many bad deeds that are going one after the other.', 'source_text' => 'Pada waktu itu, kelihatan begitu banyak dosa keburukan diletakkan satu demi satu.', 'order' => 528],
            ['start_time' => 1711.54, 'end_time' => 1712.32, 'target_text' => 'What will it be?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah bentuk dosa tersebut?', 'order' => 529],
            ['start_time' => 1712.41, 'end_time' => 1714.51, 'target_text' => 'A certain like, you spread a rumor.', 'source_text' => 'Satu tanda \'like\' yang anda berikan ketika menyebarkan fitnah.', 'order' => 530],
            ['start_time' => 1714.62, 'end_time' => 1718.43, 'target_text' => 'You said something negative about someone you don\'t even know.', 'source_text' => 'Kata-kata nista yang anda lontarkan terhadap seseorang yang langsung tidak anda kenali.', 'order' => 531],
            ['start_time' => 1718.54, 'end_time' => 1721.39, 'target_text' => 'It\'s happening every day online.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara itu berlaku setiap hari di alam maya.', 'order' => 532],
            ['start_time' => 1721.49, 'end_time' => 1722.56, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t even know this person.', 'source_text' => 'Anda langsung tidak mengenali insan tersebut.', 'order' => 533],
            ['start_time' => 1722.65, 'end_time' => 1723.99, 'target_text' => 'You spoiled their life.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anda merosakkan masa depan hidupnya.', 'order' => 534],
            ['start_time' => 1724.1, 'end_time' => 1731.19, 'target_text' => 'You messed up their reputation and they are really good people and you don\'t know or you promoted someone who is who is not', 'source_text' => 'Anda mencemarkan maruah dan reputasinya sedangkan mereka orang yang amat baik, atau anda mempromosikan pempengaruh yang langsung', 'order' => 535],
            ['start_time' => 1731.3, 'end_time' => 1738.08, 'target_text' => 'worth promoting at all because of their behavior that does not live up to the morals and values that we align with.', 'source_text' => 'tidak layak dipromosikan disebabkan akhlaknya yang bercanggah dengan nilai dan syariat Islam yang kita pegang.', 'order' => 536],
            ['start_time' => 1738.17, 'end_time' => 1739.08, 'target_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'source_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'order' => 537],
            ['start_time' => 1739.17, 'end_time' => 1740.28, 'target_text' => 'So, what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Maka, apakah yang bakal berlaku?', 'order' => 538],
            ['start_time' => 1740.38, 'end_time' => 1743.51, 'target_text' => 'You see all these bad deeds pile up and pile up and pile up.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menyaksikan segala dosa keburukan itu bertimbun, bertimbun dan semakin menggunung.', 'order' => 539],
            ['start_time' => 1743.62, 'end_time' => 1744.6, 'target_text' => 'Then what\'s going to happen?', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian apakah yang akan terjadi seterusnya?', 'order' => 540],
            ['start_time' => 1744.69, 'end_time' => 1747.58, 'target_text' => 'All the good deeds are going to come.', 'source_text' => 'Segala amalan kebajikan pula akan dibawa masuk.', 'order' => 541],
            ['start_time' => 1761.17, 'end_time' => 1765.43, 'target_text' => 'Allah says on that day of Qiyamah, we will set the scales of justice.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman bahawa pada hari kiamat kelak, Kami akan menegakkan neraca-neraca keadilan yang mutlak.', 'order' => 542],
            ['start_time' => 1765.54, 'end_time' => 1767.15, 'target_text' => 'Nobody will be oppressed.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sesiapa pun yang akan dizalimi.', 'order' => 543],
            ['start_time' => 1767.25, 'end_time' => 1768.84, 'target_text' => 'No soul shall be wronged.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada satu jiwa pun yang akan dianiayai walau sedikit.', 'order' => 544],
            ['start_time' => 1768.93, 'end_time' => 1770.88, 'target_text' => 'Those are your deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Semua itu adalah rekod amalan anda sendiri.', 'order' => 545],
            ['start_time' => 1770.97, 'end_time' => 1772.08, 'target_text' => 'So, what\'s my duty?', 'source_text' => 'Maka, apakah kewajipan saya?', 'order' => 546],
            ['start_time' => 1772.17, 'end_time' => 1777.63, 'target_text' => 'I\'m sitting here in the Masjid in Abdeen trying to picture and we won\'t be able to picture it fully because we don\'t know,', 'source_text' => 'Saya duduk di sini di dalam masjid di Aberdeen cuba membayangkan — dan kita memang tidak mampu membayangkannya secara sempurna kerana kita belum melihatnya,', 'order' => 547],
            ['start_time' => 1777.73, 'end_time' => 1781.63, 'target_text' => 'but just picture for a human mind.', 'source_text' => 'tetapi sekadar gambaran akal fikiran manusia biasa.', 'order' => 548],
            ['start_time' => 1781.73, 'end_time' => 1782.47, 'target_text' => 'Here is my deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Inilah lembaran amalan saya.', 'order' => 549],
            ['start_time' => 1782.58, 'end_time' => 1783.67, 'target_text' => 'There\'s all bad, all bad.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat begitu banyak keburukan, dosa demi dosa.', 'order' => 550],
            ['start_time' => 1783.78, 'end_time' => 1787.38, 'target_text' => 'Things I know, things I don\'t know because Allah says', 'source_text' => 'Perkara yang saya sedari dan perkara yang saya sendiri terlupa, kerana Allah berfirman:', 'order' => 551],
            ['start_time' => 1791.17, 'end_time' => 1799.15, 'target_text' => 'whoever did even an a little mustard seeds weight worth of good will see it and the bad will also see it.', 'source_text' => 'sesiapa yang melakukan amalan kebaikan walau seberat biji sawi pasti akan melihat balasannya, dan sesiapa yang melakukan kejahatan pasti akan melihat balasannya juga.', 'order' => 552],
            ['start_time' => 1799.25, 'end_time' => 1800.75, 'target_text' => 'So, it\'s all getting there.', 'source_text' => 'Maka semuanya dihimpunkan di situ.', 'order' => 553],
            ['start_time' => 1800.86, 'end_time' => 1803.91, 'target_text' => 'Now, my good deeds start piling up and guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Kini, amalan kebajikan saya pula mula diletakkan di atas timbangan, dan tahukah anda apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 554],
            ['start_time' => 1804.01, 'end_time' => 1806.67, 'target_text' => 'There is still more bad than good and what am I doing?', 'source_text' => 'Timbangan dosa masih kelihatan lebih berat daripada timbangan pahala, dan apakah yang sedang saya lakukan pada waktu itu?', 'order' => 555],
            ['start_time' => 1806.78, 'end_time' => 1812.99, 'target_text' => 'I\'m holding my breath maybe and I\'m just seeing Wow, one, two, three and you\'re saying inshallah, inshallah, inshallah I make', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin saya sedang menahan nafas dengan penuh cemas sambil menyaksikan satu, dua, tiga amalan ditimbang, dan anda merintih, "Insya-Allah, insya-Allah moga aku selamat,', 'order' => 556],
            ['start_time' => 1813.1, 'end_time' => 1815.32, 'target_text' => 'it, inshallah I make it, inshallah I make it, inshallah I make it.', 'source_text' => 'moga aku berjaya, moga timbanganku melepasi, moga aku diselamatkan."', 'order' => 557],
            ['start_time' => 1815.41, 'end_time' => 1816.08, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan tahukah anda apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 558],
            ['start_time' => 1816.17, 'end_time' => 1822.28, 'target_text' => 'It starts going and going down and down and meaning it\'s getting heavier and heavier and you\'re so happy and it\'s almost there', 'source_text' => 'Daun timbangan kanan mula bergerak turun dan semakin condong ke bawah, bermakna timbangan pahala semakin berat dan anda berasa begitu gembira kerana hampir-hampir melepasi,', 'order' => 559],
            ['start_time' => 1822.38, 'end_time' => 1825.15, 'target_text' => 'and you need a few MORE DEEDS AND GUESS WHAT ALLAH SAYS?', 'source_text' => 'dan anda memerlukan sedikit sahaja lagi amalan soleh, dan tahukah anda apa yang Allah firmankan?', 'order' => 560],
            ['start_time' => 1825.25, 'end_time' => 1832.95, 'target_text' => 'Allah says wallahi, if your right side tips the left, we will forget about the whole left and give you paradise.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: Demi kemuliaan-Ku, sekiranya timbangan sebelah kananmu mengatasi timbangan sebelah kirimu, Kami akan hapuskan seluruh dosa di sebelah kiri dan mengurniakan syurga kepadamu.', 'order' => 561],
            ['start_time' => 1833.06, 'end_time' => 1833.71, 'target_text' => 'How\'s that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana pandangan anda tentang keluasan rahmat itu?', 'order' => 562],
            ['start_time' => 1833.82, 'end_time' => 1834.99, 'target_text' => 'Imagine the mercy of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan betapa agungnya rahmat Allah.', 'order' => 563],
            ['start_time' => 1835.1, 'end_time' => 1838.23, 'target_text' => 'Allah didn\'t say you have to be sin-free to go to Jannah.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak menetapkan bahawa anda wajib bebas sepenuhnya daripada dosa untuk melangkah masuk ke dalam syurga.', 'order' => 564],
            ['start_time' => 1838.34, 'end_time' => 1840.19, 'target_text' => 'Allah says,', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman,', 'order' => 565],
            ['start_time' => 1840.3, 'end_time' => 1842.1, 'target_text' => '"Whoever\'s', 'source_text' => '"Maka sesiapa yang', 'order' => 566],
            ['start_time' => 1846.38, 'end_time' => 1850.91, 'target_text' => 'good deeds are heavier, they are the ones who will be successful." So, you do have bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'berat timbangan kebaikannya, mereka itulah orang-orang yang beroleh kejayaan." Jadi, sememangnya anda pernah melakukan dosa.', 'order' => 567],
            ['start_time' => 1851.01, 'end_time' => 1852.04, 'target_text' => 'I have bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mempunyai dosa.', 'order' => 568],
            ['start_time' => 1852.13, 'end_time' => 1852.8, 'target_text' => 'You have bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Anda juga mempunyai dosa.', 'order' => 569],
            ['start_time' => 1852.89, 'end_time' => 1853.63, 'target_text' => 'But, guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Namun, tahukah anda apa kelebihannya?', 'order' => 570],
            ['start_time' => 1853.73, 'end_time' => 1856.63, 'target_text' => 'We have more good deeds than bad.', 'source_text' => 'Kita berusaha agar timbangan kebaikan kita mengatasi timbangan keburukan kita.', 'order' => 571],
            ['start_time' => 1856.73, 'end_time' => 1858.63, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah rahsia kejayaannya.', 'order' => 572],
            ['start_time' => 1858.73, 'end_time' => 1863.23, 'target_text' => 'And we seek the forgiveness of Allah to the best of our capacity for the bad.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita memohon keampunan daripada Allah mengikut sedaya upaya kemampuan kita atas segala kekhilafan lalu.', 'order' => 573],
            ['start_time' => 1863.34, 'end_time' => 1864.63, 'target_text' => 'And Allah will wipe it out.', 'source_text' => 'Maka Allah pasti akan memadamkan dosa-dosa tersebut.', 'order' => 574],
            ['start_time' => 1864.73, 'end_time' => 1868.47, 'target_text' => 'When you have more good deeds than bad, guess what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Apabila timbangan amalan baik anda lebih berat daripada amalan buruk, tahukah anda apa yang bakal terjadi?', 'order' => 575],
            ['start_time' => 1868.58, 'end_time' => 1869.95, 'target_text' => 'You will be successful.', 'source_text' => 'Anda pasti akan beroleh kejayaan hakiki.', 'order' => 576],
            ['start_time' => 1870.06, 'end_time' => 1872.17, 'target_text' => 'At the', 'source_text' => 'Hadis Nabi', 'order' => 577],
            ['start_time' => 1874.73, 'end_time' => 1877.56, 'target_text' => 'Hadith says, "Follow up your bad deed with good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam bersabda, "Iringilah perbuatan burukmu dengan melakukan amalan kebajikan.', 'order' => 578],
            ['start_time' => 1877.65, 'end_time' => 1879.56, 'target_text' => 'It will be wiped out." Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Nescaya amalan kebajikan itu akan menghapuskan dosa keburukan tersebut." Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 579],
            ['start_time' => 1879.65, 'end_time' => 1880.39, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 580],
            ['start_time' => 1880.49, 'end_time' => 1882.91, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the mercy of Allah, the favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah tanda keluasan rahmat Allah dan kurniaan kasih sayang-Nya.', 'order' => 581],
            ['start_time' => 1883.01, 'end_time' => 1887.19, 'target_text' => 'So, I want to invite you today to do as many good deeds as you can.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, saya ingin mengajak anda semua pada malam ini untuk memperbanyakkan amalan soleh sebanyak mungkin mengikut daya kemampuan anda.', 'order' => 582],
            ['start_time' => 1887.3, 'end_time' => 1887.95, 'target_text' => 'You know why?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda mengapa?', 'order' => 583],
            ['start_time' => 1888.06, 'end_time' => 1892.15, 'target_text' => 'Hey, you and I have a lot of bad deeds we\'re not proud of.', 'source_text' => 'Ketahuilah, anda dan saya mempunyai banyak dosa silam yang langsung tidak membanggakan kita.', 'order' => 584],
            ['start_time' => 1892.25, 'end_time' => 1894.88, 'target_text' => 'You and I have a lot of bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Anda dan saya memiliki banyak kesilapan lampau.', 'order' => 585],
            ['start_time' => 1894.97, 'end_time' => 1898.6, 'target_text' => 'We would be embarrassed if the people had to see what we\'ve done in our lives.', 'source_text' => 'Kita pasti akan berasa teramat malu sekiranya orang ramai dapat melihat apa yang pernah kita lakukan sepanjang hidup kita.', 'order' => 586],
            ['start_time' => 1898.69, 'end_time' => 1899.28, 'target_text' => 'Do you agree?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda bersetuju dengan saya?', 'order' => 587],
            ['start_time' => 1899.38, 'end_time' => 1900.28, 'target_text' => 'All of us.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua mengakuinya.', 'order' => 588],
            ['start_time' => 1900.38, 'end_time' => 1902.32, 'target_text' => 'We have so many secrets.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua menyimpan begitu banyak rahsia.', 'order' => 589],
            ['start_time' => 1902.41, 'end_time' => 1904.19, 'target_text' => 'We have so many secrets.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mempunyai terlalu banyak rahsia aib yang tersembunyi.', 'order' => 590],
            ['start_time' => 1904.3, 'end_time' => 1908.12, 'target_text' => 'If Allah was not merciful, he would expose us.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya Allah tidak bersifat Maha Pengasih dan Menutup Aib, nescaya Dia telah mendedahkan keaiban kita kepada khalayak ramai.', 'order' => 591],
            ['start_time' => 1908.21, 'end_time' => 1910.23, 'target_text' => 'Sorry, I\'m not trying to say I\'m a bad guy.', 'source_text' => 'Maafkan saya, bukanlah niat saya hendak mengatakan bahawa saya seorang yang jahat.', 'order' => 592],
            ['start_time' => 1910.34, 'end_time' => 1913.23, 'target_text' => 'But, what I am trying to say is we all have sins.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi apa yang ingin saya tekankan adalah hakikat bahawa kita semua insan yang pernah berdosa.', 'order' => 593],
            ['start_time' => 1913.34, 'end_time' => 1913.8, 'target_text' => 'We are sinful.', 'source_text' => 'Kita ini manusia yang lemah.', 'order' => 594],
            ['start_time' => 1913.89, 'end_time' => 1914.63, 'target_text' => 'We are Banu Adam.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah anak-cucu Nabi Adam.', 'order' => 595],
            ['start_time' => 1914.73, 'end_time' => 1916.63, 'target_text' => 'We are Bashar.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah manusia biasa yang tidak maksum.', 'order' => 596],
            ['start_time' => 1916.73, 'end_time' => 1921.71, 'target_text' => 'How many of us has have slept over prayer sometimes because of whatever the reason may be?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai antara kita yang pernah terlepas waktu solat kerana terlajak tidur disebabkan kepenatan atau apa jua punca?', 'order' => 597],
            ['start_time' => 1921.82, 'end_time' => 1923.56, 'target_text' => 'May Allah never let that happen to us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah tidak membiarkan perkara sedemikian berlaku lagi kepada kita.', 'order' => 598],
            ['start_time' => 1923.65, 'end_time' => 1925.91, 'target_text' => 'But, it\'s such a heavy feeling.', 'source_text' => 'Namun ia mendatangkan rasa bersalah yang amat berat di dalam jiwa.', 'order' => 599],
            ['start_time' => 1926.01, 'end_time' => 1931.84, 'target_text' => 'The bonus is the Hadith says, "Man nama an salatin aw nasiya fa yusalliha idha dhakaraha."', 'source_text' => 'Berita gembiranya adalah hadis Baginda bersabda, "Man nama \'an salatin aw nasiyaha falyusalliha idha dhakaraha — sesiapa yang tertidur daripada solat atau terlupa, maka solatlah sebaik sahaja dia teringat."', 'order' => 600],
            ['start_time' => 1931.93, 'end_time' => 1933.12, 'target_text' => 'Hadith correct narration.', 'source_text' => 'Riwayat hadis sahih.', 'order' => 601],
            ['start_time' => 1933.21, 'end_time' => 1938.91, 'target_text' => 'The Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam says, "Whoever sleeps over a prayer or whoever has forgotten sometimes forgetfulness."', 'source_text' => 'Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam bersabda, "Sesiapa yang tertidur daripada menunaikan solat atau terlupa — kadangkala sifat lupa itu manusiawi."', 'order' => 602],
            ['start_time' => 1939.01, 'end_time' => 1946.43, 'target_text' => 'Here in Abdeen, one of the negatives is in some of the seasons of the year, your prayers are in awkward times, on awkward', 'source_text' => 'Di sini di Aberdeen, antara cabarannya adalah pada sesetengah musim dalam setahun, waktu solat anda berada pada waktu yang agak janggal, waktu yang', 'order' => 603],
            ['start_time' => 1946.54, 'end_time' => 1947.84, 'target_text' => 'time, not easy.', 'source_text' => 'mencabar dan bukan mudah.', 'order' => 604],
            ['start_time' => 1947.93, 'end_time' => 1952.23, 'target_text' => 'You got to do Fajr, then you got to do Dhuhr, and then you don\'t know when Asr just came in and went.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu menunaikan solat Subuh, kemudian Zohor, dan selepas itu anda tidak perasan bila waktu Asar masuk dan berlalu pergi.', 'order' => 605],
            ['start_time' => 1952.34, 'end_time' => 1956.95, 'target_text' => 'And before you know it, it\'s Maghrib, and after that it\'s Maghrib and Isha, you\'re confused whether it\'s the same time or', 'source_text' => 'Dan sebelum anda sedar, waktu Maghrib telah masuk, dan sejurus selepas itu waktu Maghrib dan Isyak bertindih sehingga anda keliru sama ada ia waktu yang sama atau', 'order' => 606],
            ['start_time' => 1957.06, 'end_time' => 1957.95, 'target_text' => 'not the same time.', 'source_text' => 'bukan waktu yang sama.', 'order' => 607],
            ['start_time' => 1958.06, 'end_time' => 1962.43, 'target_text' => 'Some scholars would say you can read these two together and so so much of chaos and confusion.', 'source_text' => 'Sesetengah ulama berfatwa bahawa anda boleh menjamakkan kedua-dua solat ini, menimbulkan pelbagai kekeliruan dan tanda tanya.', 'order' => 608],
            ['start_time' => 1962.54, 'end_time' => 1963.32, 'target_text' => 'How do we do that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah cara untuk kita menghadapinya?', 'order' => 609],
            ['start_time' => 1963.41, 'end_time' => 1968.23, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, we do our best and we ask Allah to accept it and we ask Allah to forgive our shortcoming.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, kita berusaha melakukan yang terbaik semampu kita, dan kita memohon agar Allah menerimanya serta mengampunkan segala kekurangan kita.', 'order' => 610],
            ['start_time' => 1968.34, 'end_time' => 1973.28, 'target_text' => 'So, because I have bad deeds and I want the tipping of the scale on the right side, how do I start?', 'source_text' => 'Maka, oleh kerana saya memiliki dosa dan saya mendambakan timbangan neraca menjadi berat di sebelah kanan, bagaimanakah harus saya bermula?', 'order' => 611],
            ['start_time' => 1973.38, 'end_time' => 1974.28, 'target_text' => 'I teach you something.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin mengajar anda suatu amalan.', 'order' => 612],
            ['start_time' => 1974.38, 'end_time' => 1977.88, 'target_text' => 'You start off by seeking the forgiveness of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Mulakanlah langkah anda dengan memohon keampunan daripada Allah (beristighfar).', 'order' => 613],
            ['start_time' => 1977.97, 'end_time' => 1983.88, 'target_text' => 'I once gave a talk at a school to some youngsters and I told them, teenagers, I said start off by seeking the forgiveness', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah menyampaikan ceramah di sebuah sekolah kepada sekumpulan anak muda, para remaja, dan saya menasihati mereka agar memulakan langkah dengan memohon keampunan', 'order' => 614],
            ['start_time' => 1983.97, 'end_time' => 1984.67, 'target_text' => 'of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'daripada Allah.', 'order' => 615],
            ['start_time' => 1984.78, 'end_time' => 1985.95, 'target_text' => 'They said, we haven\'t sinned.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menjawab, "Kami belum pernah berbuat dosa.', 'order' => 616],
            ['start_time' => 1986.06, 'end_time' => 1987.12, 'target_text' => 'Why should we seek forgiveness?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa pula kami perlu memohon keampunan?"', 'order' => 617],
            ['start_time' => 1987.21, 'end_time' => 1989.75, 'target_text' => 'I\'m like, Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Saya terkejut, "Allahu Akbar."', 'order' => 618],
            ['start_time' => 1989.86, 'end_time' => 1991.32, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar, we haven\'t sinned.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar, \'kami belum pernah berbuat dosa\'.', 'order' => 619],
            ['start_time' => 1991.41, 'end_time' => 1993.19, 'target_text' => 'Why should I seek forgiveness?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa pula saya perlu memohon keampunan?', 'order' => 620],
            ['start_time' => 1993.3, 'end_time' => 1994.71, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, we seek forgiveness.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, kita semua wajib sentiasa beristighfar.', 'order' => 621],
            ['start_time' => 1994.82, 'end_time' => 1997.51, 'target_text' => 'Do you know how you seek forgiveness?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda bagaimana cara terbaik untuk memohon keampunan?', 'order' => 622],
            ['start_time' => 1997.62, 'end_time' => 2004.63, 'target_text' => 'Oh Allah, forgive me for the sins I know, the sins I don\'t know, the minor sins, the major sins, those I remember, those I', 'source_text' => '"Ya Allah, ampunkanlah dosa-dosa yang aku ketahui, dosa-dosa yang tidak aku ketahui, dosa kecil mahupun dosa besar, dosa yang aku ingat mahupun yang', 'order' => 623],
            ['start_time' => 2004.73, 'end_time' => 2010.88, 'target_text' => 'don\'t remember, those I know I was committing a sin and those I committed without even realizing I was committing a sin.', 'source_text' => 'aku terlupa, dosa yang aku sedari semasa melakukannya serta dosa yang aku lakukan tanpa aku sedar bahawa aku sedang melakukan maksiat."', 'order' => 624],
            ['start_time' => 2010.97, 'end_time' => 2011.8, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 625],
            ['start_time' => 2011.89, 'end_time' => 2013.86, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 626],
            ['start_time' => 2014.06, 'end_time' => 2014.6, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 627],
            ['start_time' => 2014.69, 'end_time' => 2017.67, 'target_text' => 'Oh Allah, I seek your forgiveness for that which I don\'t even know.', 'source_text' => 'Ya Allah, aku memohon keampunan-Mu atas apa jua dosa yang langsung tidak aku ketahui.', 'order' => 628],
            ['start_time' => 2017.78, 'end_time' => 2019.8, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t even realize.', 'source_text' => 'Yang langsung tidak aku sedari.', 'order' => 629],
            ['start_time' => 2019.89, 'end_time' => 2025.88, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes nowadays, you know how pressurizing the environment may be, you\'re walking on the street and you don\'t even know,', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala pada zaman ini, anda tahu betapa besarnya godaan persekitaran di luar sana, anda sedang berjalan di jalanan dan tanpa anda sedari,', 'order' => 630],
            ['start_time' => 2025.97, 'end_time' => 2030.47, 'target_text' => 'I look this way, I look that way, I look that way, you know, I saw something I wasn\'t supposed to see.', 'source_text' => 'saya memandang ke kanan, memandang ke kiri, memandang ke hadapan, dan saya terlihat sesuatu yang tidak sepatutnya saya lihat.', 'order' => 631],
            ['start_time' => 2030.58, 'end_time' => 2030.99, 'target_text' => 'What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang berlaku selepas itu?', 'order' => 632],
            ['start_time' => 2031.1, 'end_time' => 2031.91, 'target_text' => 'You just carried on moving.', 'source_text' => 'Anda teruskan sahaja berjalan.', 'order' => 633],
            ['start_time' => 2032.01, 'end_time' => 2033.51, 'target_text' => 'Did you ever say Astaghfirullah?', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah anda spontan beristighfar melafazkan Astaghfirullah?', 'order' => 634],
            ['start_time' => 2033.62, 'end_time' => 2034.12, 'target_text' => 'No, I didn\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, saya tidak mengucapkannya.', 'order' => 635],
            ['start_time' => 2034.21, 'end_time' => 2034.37, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa?', 'order' => 636],
            ['start_time' => 2034.38, 'end_time' => 2036.6, 'target_text' => 'Because everyone walks, everyone sees.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana semua orang berjalan dan semua orang melihat perkara yang sama.', 'order' => 637],
            ['start_time' => 2036.69, 'end_time' => 2040.95, 'target_text' => 'And some people, you know, when they they fear Allah, they look and they say Astaghfirullah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sesetengah insan, apabila mereka mempunyai rasa takut kepada Allah, mereka terpandang lalu segera beristighfar, "Astaghfirullah."', 'order' => 638],
            ['start_time' => 2041.06, 'end_time' => 2042.43, 'target_text' => 'Look down.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 639],
            ['start_time' => 2042.54, 'end_time' => 2045.8, 'target_text' => 'A little bit more intelligent, they look there, they say La hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi yang lebih peka, apabila terpandang mereka melafazkan, "La hawla wala quwwata illa billah."', 'order' => 640],
            ['start_time' => 2045.89, 'end_time' => 2047.59, 'target_text' => 'They look down.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 641],
            ['start_time' => 2047.7, 'end_time' => 2050.63, 'target_text' => 'And the one who\'s even more intelligent, he looks and he says In sha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan bagi yang jauh lebih cerdik, dia terpandang lalu berkata, "Insya-Allah."', 'order' => 642],
            ['start_time' => 2050.74, 'end_time' => 2051.76, 'target_text' => 'He looks down.', 'source_text' => 'Dia menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 643],
            ['start_time' => 2051.86, 'end_time' => 2052.51, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 644],
            ['start_time' => 2052.61, 'end_time' => 2054.47, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 645],
            ['start_time' => 2054.57, 'end_time' => 2056.36, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 646],
            ['start_time' => 2056.45, 'end_time' => 2059.71, 'target_text' => 'I hope that In sha Allah is for something halal, not haram.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berharap ucapan \'Insya-Allah\' itu adalah untuk perkara yang halal, bukannya perkara yang haram.', 'order' => 647],
            ['start_time' => 2059.81, 'end_time' => 2060.43, 'target_text' => 'Right?', 'source_text' => 'Betul bukan?', 'order' => 648],
            ['start_time' => 2060.53, 'end_time' => 2062.11, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah merahmati anda semua.', 'order' => 649],
            ['start_time' => 2062.22, 'end_time' => 2064.07, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty bless you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa melimpahkan barakah kepada anda.', 'order' => 650],
            ['start_time' => 2064.18, 'end_time' => 2069.71, 'target_text' => 'But nonetheless, on a more serious note, sometimes the point I\'m raising is sometimes we don\'t even realize that we might', 'source_text' => 'Namun apa pun, kembali kepada nada yang lebih serius, intipati yang ingin saya ketengahkan adalah kadangkala kita sendiri tidak menyedari bahawa kita mungkin', 'order' => 651],
            ['start_time' => 2069.81, 'end_time' => 2072.59, 'target_text' => 'have committed a minor sin and we don\'t realize it sometimes.', 'source_text' => 'telah terlanjur melakukan dosa kecil tanpa kita sedari.', 'order' => 652],
            ['start_time' => 2072.7, 'end_time' => 2076.36, 'target_text' => 'Say ask Allah, oh Allah forgive me for that which I know, that which I don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Ucapkanlah dan mohonlah kepada Allah, "Ya Allah, ampunkanlah daku atas apa yang aku ketahui dan apa yang tidak aku ketahui."', 'order' => 653],
            ['start_time' => 2076.45, 'end_time' => 2080.11, 'target_text' => 'When you seek forgiveness of Allah, learn to become humble.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda memohon keampunan daripada Allah, belajarlah untuk menjadi insan yang tawaduk dan rendah diri.', 'order' => 654],
            ['start_time' => 2080.22, 'end_time' => 2081.43, 'target_text' => 'Learn to become humble.', 'source_text' => 'Belajarlah merendahkan ego.', 'order' => 655],
            ['start_time' => 2081.53, 'end_time' => 2092.16, 'target_text' => 'Your power, your authority, your money, your fame and popularity, your good looks, none of that means anything in the eyes', 'source_text' => 'Kuasa anda, darjat jawatan anda, wang ringgit anda, kemasyhuran dan populariti anda, ketampanan atau kecantikan paras rupa anda — tiada satu pun daripadanya bernilai di sisi', 'order' => 656],
            ['start_time' => 2092.26, 'end_time' => 2094.18, 'target_text' => 'of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Allah.', 'order' => 657],
            ['start_time' => 2101.22, 'end_time' => 2104.76, 'target_text' => 'Allah doesn\'t look at those material items and those external things.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak sesekali memandang kepada kebendaan duniawi dan perkara luaran tersebut.', 'order' => 658],
            ['start_time' => 2104.86, 'end_time' => 2107.39, 'target_text' => 'He doesn\'t look at your bodies, your shapes, how you look, etc.', 'source_text' => 'Dia tidak memandang kepada rupa jasad anda, bentuk tubuh anda, bagaimana penampilan luaran anda dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 659],
            ['start_time' => 2107.49, 'end_time' => 2108.16, 'target_text' => 'etc.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 660],
            ['start_time' => 2108.26, 'end_time' => 2111.91, 'target_text' => 'Allah looks at the heart and Allah looks at your deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Allah memandang kepada keikhlasan hati kamu dan Allah memandang kepada amalan perbuatan kamu.', 'order' => 661],
            ['start_time' => 2112.01, 'end_time' => 2117.68, 'target_text' => 'And when we say Allah looks at the heart, Shaitan comes and keeps on telling you Allah looks at the heart.', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila kita menyebut bahawa Allah memandang kepada hati, Syaitan mula datang berbisik dan sentiasa menanam fikiran bahawa \'Allah hanya memandang kepada hati\'.', 'order' => 662],
            ['start_time' => 2117.78, 'end_time' => 2118.91, 'target_text' => 'You might wonder, so?', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin tertanya-tanya, apa salahnya?', 'order' => 663],
            ['start_time' => 2119.01, 'end_time' => 2120.51, 'target_text' => 'That\'s a true statement.', 'source_text' => 'Itu kenyataan yang benar.', 'order' => 664],
            ['start_time' => 2120.61, 'end_time' => 2122.84, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a true statement, but Shaitan is too clever.', 'source_text' => 'Ia memang kenyataan yang benar, namun Syaitan itu teramat licik tipu dayanya.', 'order' => 665],
            ['start_time' => 2122.93, 'end_time' => 2123.72, 'target_text' => 'You know what he does?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa helah jarumnya?', 'order' => 666],
            ['start_time' => 2123.82, 'end_time' => 2127.07, 'target_text' => 'He says, hey, Allah doesn\'t look at your body or soul or anything.', 'source_text' => 'Dia berbisik, "Hei, Allah kan tidak memandang kepada rupa tubuh kamu, pakaian kamu atau apa-apa pun.', 'order' => 667],
            ['start_time' => 2127.18, 'end_time' => 2128.72, 'target_text' => 'He looks at your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Dia hanya memandang kepada hatimu semata-mata."', 'order' => 668],
            ['start_time' => 2128.82, 'end_time' => 2130.39, 'target_text' => 'And he keeps on saying he looks at your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Dan dia terus-menerus mengulangi bahawa Allah hanya melihat hatimu.', 'order' => 669],
            ['start_time' => 2130.49, 'end_time' => 2135.88, 'target_text' => 'So you start sinning and when someone advises you, you say,', 'source_text' => 'Lalu anda mula berani melakukan maksiat, dan apabila seseorang menegur dan menasihati anda, anda terus membalas,', 'order' => 670],
            ['start_time' => 2135.97, 'end_time' => 2136.39, 'target_text' => 'keep quiet.', 'source_text' => '"Diamlah kamu.', 'order' => 671],
            ['start_time' => 2136.49, 'end_time' => 2138.55, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows my heart.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tahu apa yang ada dalam hati saya!"', 'order' => 672],
            ['start_time' => 2138.66, 'end_time' => 2139.88, 'target_text' => 'Where did you get that from?', 'source_text' => 'Dari mana anda belajar jawapan sebegitu?', 'order' => 673],
            ['start_time' => 2139.97, 'end_time' => 2141.47, 'target_text' => 'Shaitan, who else?', 'source_text' => 'Daripada Syaitan, siapa lagi?', 'order' => 674],
            ['start_time' => 2141.57, 'end_time' => 2145.16, 'target_text' => 'Because it\'s a kalimatu haqqin urida biha batil.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana itu adalah \'kalimatu haqqin urida bihal batil\' — kalimah yang benar tetapi digunakan dengan niat yang batil dan salah.', 'order' => 675],
            ['start_time' => 2145.26, 'end_time' => 2149.76, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a true statement, but your intention is false.', 'source_text' => 'Ia kenyataan yang benar, tetapi niat anda menggunakannya adalah batil semata-mata untuk membela kemungkaran.', 'order' => 676],
            ['start_time' => 2149.86, 'end_time' => 2154.88, 'target_text' => 'Is it not my duty to advise you, my beloved sister, my beloved brother?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah suatu kewajipan bagi saya untuk menasihati anda, wahai saudariku yang dikasihi, wahai saudaraku yang dikasihi?', 'order' => 677],
            ['start_time' => 2154.97, 'end_time' => 2156.84, 'target_text' => 'We need to learn to dress appropriately.', 'source_text' => 'Kita perlu belajar menutup aurat dan berpakaian dengan sopan mengikut syariat.', 'order' => 678],
            ['start_time' => 2156.93, 'end_time' => 2159.24, 'target_text' => 'Notice how I added the brothers in.', 'source_text' => 'Perhatikan bagaimana saya turut menyertakan kaum lelaki sekali.', 'order' => 679],
            ['start_time' => 2159.34, 'end_time' => 2162.24, 'target_text' => 'Because it\'s very unfair to just single the sisters out.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana amat tidak adil sekiranya kita hanya menuding jari dan menegur kaum wanita sahaja.', 'order' => 680],
            ['start_time' => 2162.34, 'end_time' => 2163.99, 'target_text' => 'No, we are all guilty.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, kita semua juga ada melakukan kesilapan.', 'order' => 681],
            ['start_time' => 2164.09, 'end_time' => 2169.99, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes some of the brothers wear clothing that is more embarrassing than all the sisters put together.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala sebahagian kaum lelaki memakai pakaian yang jauh lebih memalukan daripada gabungan pakaian seluruh kaum wanita.', 'order' => 682],
            ['start_time' => 2170.09, 'end_time' => 2172.57, 'target_text' => 'Because you come to the masjid', 'source_text' => 'Kerana anda datang melangkah ke masjid,', 'order' => 683],
            ['start_time' => 2172.89, 'end_time' => 2177.18, 'target_text' => 'wala hawla wala quwwata illa billah, you go in sujud.', 'source_text' => 'wala hawla wala quwwata illa billah, lalu anda tunduk bersujud.', 'order' => 684],
            ['start_time' => 2177.53, 'end_time' => 2180.39, 'target_text' => 'See, already people are saying hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakil.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah, jemaah sudah mula mengeluh melafazkan hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakil.', 'order' => 685],
            ['start_time' => 2180.49, 'end_time' => 2182.03, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa?', 'order' => 686],
            ['start_time' => 2182.13, 'end_time' => 2183.68, 'target_text' => 'Bro,', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudaraku,', 'order' => 687],
            ['start_time' => 2183.78, 'end_time' => 2187.57, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t even want to use the word crack in the masjid.', 'source_text' => 'saya sendiri tidak sanggup hendak menyebut perkataan terdedah bahagian punggung di dalam masjid yang mulia ini.', 'order' => 688],
            ['start_time' => 2188.01, 'end_time' => 2193.11, 'target_text' => 'But you and I know that it is so embarrassing AND NO ONE TALKS ABOUT THE MEN.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anda dan saya sedar betapa mengaibkan keadaan itu, TETAPI TIADA SESIAPA PUN YANG BERANI MENEGUR KAUM LELAKI.', 'order' => 689],
            ['start_time' => 2193.22, 'end_time' => 2195.51, 'target_text' => 'MY BROTHER, YOU NEED TO dress appropriately.', 'source_text' => 'WAHAI SAUDARAKU, ANDA WAJIB berpakaian dengan sopan dan menutup aurat dengan sempurna.', 'order' => 690],
            ['start_time' => 2195.61, 'end_time' => 2197.63, 'target_text' => 'You need to watch out your dress code.', 'source_text' => 'Anda wajib menjaga etika pemakaian anda.', 'order' => 691],
            ['start_time' => 2197.74, 'end_time' => 2199.39, 'target_text' => 'You busy worried about all the sisters.', 'source_text' => 'Anda terlalu sibuk menegur aurat kaum wanita.', 'order' => 692],
            ['start_time' => 2199.49, 'end_time' => 2202.68, 'target_text' => 'Yes, we are, but we are worried about the brothers and the sisters.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, kita perlu saling mengingatkan, tetapi kita wajib mengambil berat aurat kedua-duanya — kaum lelaki mahupun kaum wanita.', 'order' => 693],
            ['start_time' => 2202.78, 'end_time' => 2205.03, 'target_text' => 'We are worried about everyone, myself included.', 'source_text' => 'Kita wajib prihatin terhadap semua orang, termasuklah diri saya sendiri.', 'order' => 694],
            ['start_time' => 2205.13, 'end_time' => 2207.16, 'target_text' => 'If I\'m wrong, correct me.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya silap, tegurlah saya.', 'order' => 695],
            ['start_time' => 2207.26, 'end_time' => 2208.11, 'target_text' => 'I deserve it.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berhak menerima teguran itu.', 'order' => 696],
            ['start_time' => 2208.22, 'end_time' => 2212.91, 'target_text' => 'If I feel bad because I\'m corrected, I\'m going nowhere.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya berasa tersinggung semata-mata kerana ditegur, saya tidak akan ke mana-mana.', 'order' => 697],
            ['start_time' => 2213.01, 'end_time' => 2218.43, 'target_text' => 'If you are a person who feels bad when someone corrects you, you are going nowhere in life.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda jenis manusia yang cepat melatah dan terasa hati apabila seseorang menegur anda, anda tidak akan berjaya dalam hidup.', 'order' => 698],
            ['start_time' => 2218.53, 'end_time' => 2223.28, 'target_text' => 'If they were right and you were wrong, wallahi, that\'s there are chances that you may fail.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya teguran mereka itu benar dan anda yang silap, wallahi, ada kemungkinan besar anda akan kecundang.', 'order' => 699],
            ['start_time' => 2223.38, 'end_time' => 2228.51, 'target_text' => 'Imagine you\'re saying 1 + 1 is 3 and you\'re spending your life saying that one guy comes to you, "Habibi, let me tell you', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan sekiranya anda berkeras mengatakan bahawa 1 + 1 adalah 3 dan anda menghabiskan usia menegakkan kepalsuan itu, lalu seseorang datang menegur, "Habibi, mari saya terangkan', 'order' => 700],
            ['start_time' => 2228.61, 'end_time' => 2232.28, 'target_text' => 'it\'s two." Allah knows my heart.', 'source_text' => 'jawapannya adalah dua." Lalu anda menjawab, "Allah tahu apa yang ada dalam hati saya!"', 'order' => 701],
            ['start_time' => 2232.38, 'end_time' => 2233.43, 'target_text' => 'How can you say that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana anda boleh memberi alasan sebegitu?', 'order' => 702],
            ['start_time' => 2233.53, 'end_time' => 2234.43, 'target_text' => 'I\'m just telling you.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sekadar berterus-terang kepada anda.', 'order' => 703],
            ['start_time' => 2234.53, 'end_time' => 2240.51, 'target_text' => 'So, now when you write your examination, 1 + 1 is 3, you must write at the bottom, "Allah knows my heart." No matter how many', 'source_text' => 'Maka sekarang, apabila anda menduduki peperiksaan dan menulis 1 + 1 = 3, anda menulis di bahagian bawah kertas jawapan, "Allah tahu isi hati saya." Walau berapa kali pun', 'order' => 704],
            ['start_time' => 2240.61, 'end_time' => 2243.36, 'target_text' => 'times you write that, you will be marked wrong.', 'source_text' => 'anda menulis nota sebegitu, jawapan anda tetap akan dipangkah salah.', 'order' => 705],
            ['start_time' => 2243.45, 'end_time' => 2244.99, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what we are doing in our lives.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sebenarnya apa yang sedang kita lakukan dalam kehidupan kita seharian.', 'order' => 706],
            ['start_time' => 2245.09, 'end_time' => 2246.03, 'target_text' => 'Someone tells you, "You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Apabila seseorang menasihati anda, "Tahukah kamu?', 'order' => 707],
            ['start_time' => 2246.13, 'end_time' => 2247.51, 'target_text' => 'This is haram." What do you mean it\'s haram?', 'source_text' => 'Perkara ini adalah haram." Anda menjawab, "Apa maksud kamu ia haram?', 'order' => 708],
            ['start_time' => 2247.61, 'end_time' => 2248.39, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows my heart.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tahu apa yang ada dalam hati saya!"', 'order' => 709],
            ['start_time' => 2248.49, 'end_time' => 2250.47, 'target_text' => 'So, we\'re eating pork, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, kita makan daging babi, lalu berkata \'Allah tahu isi hati saya\'.', 'order' => 710],
            ['start_time' => 2250.57, 'end_time' => 2252.28, 'target_text' => 'You\'re eating interest, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Anda memakan riba, \'Allah tahu isi hati saya\'.', 'order' => 711],
            ['start_time' => 2252.38, 'end_time' => 2254.76, 'target_text' => 'You You\'re not dressing appropriately, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Anda berpakaian mendedahkan aurat, \'Allah tahu isi hati saya\'.', 'order' => 712],
            ['start_time' => 2254.86, 'end_time' => 2257.36, 'target_text' => 'You\'re sending the alcohol, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mengedar minuman arak, \'Allah tahu isi hati saya\'.', 'order' => 713],
            ['start_time' => 2257.45, 'end_time' => 2259.24, 'target_text' => 'You\'re doing everything else, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Anda melakukan pelbagai lagi kemungkaran, lalu beralasan \'Allah tahu isi hati saya\'.', 'order' => 714],
            ['start_time' => 2259.34, 'end_time' => 2260.76, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the point of Islam?', 'source_text' => 'Maka apakah gunanya kita berpegang kepada ajaran Islam?', 'order' => 715],
            ['start_time' => 2260.86, 'end_time' => 2263.55, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows the heart, everybody\'s heart.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Maha Mengetahui setiap isi hati, isi hati setiap hamba-Nya.', 'order' => 716],
            ['start_time' => 2263.66, 'end_time' => 2268.91, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why I say, "Don\'t be deceived by the statement of shaytan." What does he tell you?', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah saya tegaskan, "Jangan sesekali terpedaya dengan bisikan helah Syaitan." Apakah yang cuba diputarbelitkannya?', 'order' => 717],
            ['start_time' => 2269.01, 'end_time' => 2274.32, 'target_text' => 'He tells you, "Walakin yanzuru ila qulubikum wa a\'malikum." Hadith is correct.', 'source_text' => 'Dia membacakan potongan hadis, "Walakin yanzuru ila qulubikum wa a\'malikum." Hadis tersebut memang sahih.', 'order' => 718],
            ['start_time' => 2274.41, 'end_time' => 2276.72, 'target_text' => 'Allah looks at your hearts and your your deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Sesungguhnya Allah memandang kepada hati-hati kamu dan amalan-amalan perbuatan kamu.', 'order' => 719],
            ['start_time' => 2276.82, 'end_time' => 2280.11, 'target_text' => 'Notice how both of those go hand in hand.', 'source_text' => 'Perhatikan bagaimana kedua-dua unsur itu saling bergandingan dan tidak boleh dipisahkan sama sekali.', 'order' => 720],
            ['start_time' => 2280.22, 'end_time' => 2282.84, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t only say one without the other.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan hanya mengambil satu aspek dan meninggalkan aspek yang satu lagi.', 'order' => 721],
            ['start_time' => 2282.93, 'end_time' => 2288.8, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t only say heart without deeds because that hadith did not only mention the heart and did not only mention the deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan hanya berhujah dengan \'hati\' tanpa \'amalan perbuatan\', kerana hadis tersebut tidak menyebut tentang hati sahaja, dan tidak pula menyebut tentang amalan semata-mata.', 'order' => 722],
            ['start_time' => 2288.89, 'end_time' => 2290.36, 'target_text' => 'It mentioned both of them.', 'source_text' => 'Hadis itu menyebut kedua-duanya sekali gus.', 'order' => 723],
            ['start_time' => 2290.45, 'end_time' => 2298.03, 'target_text' => 'And from that, some of the muhaddithin have explained that Allah looks at your heart and your deed to see the intention of', 'source_text' => 'Dan daripada hadis itulah para muhaddisin (ulama hadis) menghuraikan bahawa Allah memandang kepada hatimu dan amalanmu demi menilai keikhlasan niat di sebalik', 'order' => 724],
            ['start_time' => 2298.13, 'end_time' => 2298.88, 'target_text' => 'the deed.', 'source_text' => 'amalan tersebut.', 'order' => 725],
            ['start_time' => 2298.97, 'end_time' => 2302.05, 'target_text' => 'and if the deed is wrong', 'source_text' => 'Dan sekiranya amalan perbuatannya salah,', 'order' => 726],
            ['start_time' => 2303.45, 'end_time' => 2308.03, 'target_text' => 'and the heart is wrong in the wrong place, you\'ve lost completely.', 'source_text' => 'serta niat di dalam hatinya juga terpesong, sesungguhnya kamu telah rugi sepenuhnya.', 'order' => 727],
            ['start_time' => 2308.13, 'end_time' => 2309.95, 'target_text' => 'But Allah looks at both.', 'source_text' => 'Namun Allah memandang kepada kedua-duanya.', 'order' => 728],
            ['start_time' => 2310.05, 'end_time' => 2313.8, 'target_text' => 'You need to do your salah and Allah will help you and guide you.', 'source_text' => 'Anda wajib menunaikan solat fardu anda dan Allah pasti akan memimpin serta membantu anda.', 'order' => 729],
            ['start_time' => 2313.89, 'end_time' => 2319.11, 'target_text' => 'If I see someone fulfilling salah in the masjid and I walked in, I can\'t say, "Look at this guy.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya melihat seseorang sedang khusyuk menunaikan solat di masjid ketika saya melangkah masuk, saya tidak berhak berkata, "Tengok orang itu,', 'order' => 730],
            ['start_time' => 2319.22, 'end_time' => 2322.2, 'target_text' => 'He\'s he\'s showing off." How do I know he\'s showing off?', 'source_text' => 'dia sedang menunjuk-nunjuk (riya\')." Bagaimana mungkin saya tahu bahawa dia menunjuk-nunjuk?', 'order' => 731],
            ['start_time' => 2322.3, 'end_time' => 2323.24, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a deed.', 'source_text' => 'Itu amalan ibadahnya.', 'order' => 732],
            ['start_time' => 2323.34, 'end_time' => 2324.43, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows his heart.', 'source_text' => 'Hanya Allah yang mengetahui apa yang tersembunyi di dalam hatinya.', 'order' => 733],
            ['start_time' => 2324.53, 'end_time' => 2327.36, 'target_text' => 'In that instance, it\'s correct to say Allah knows the man\'s heart.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam konteks sebeginilah amat tepat untuk diucapkan bahawa hanya Allah yang mengetahui isi hati seseorang hamba.', 'order' => 734],
            ['start_time' => 2327.45, 'end_time' => 2329.2, 'target_text' => 'Leave him alone.', 'source_text' => 'Biarkan urusan hatinya antara dirinya dengan Allah.', 'order' => 735],
            ['start_time' => 2329.3, 'end_time' => 2331.32, 'target_text' => 'But don\'t ever use it to justify.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jangan sesekali menggunakannya sebagai alasan untuk menghalalkan kemungkaran diri.', 'order' => 736],
            ['start_time' => 2331.41, 'end_time' => 2333.32, 'target_text' => 'I want to teach you something, my beloved children.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin mengajar sesuatu kepada anda, wahai anak-anakku yang dikasihi.', 'order' => 737],
            ['start_time' => 2333.41, 'end_time' => 2335.91, 'target_text' => 'When someone corrects you, you must say, "Jazakallahu khairan.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila seseorang menegur kesilapan anda, wajarlah anda membalas, "Jazakallahu khairan.', 'order' => 738],
            ['start_time' => 2336.01, 'end_time' => 2339.43, 'target_text' => 'Thank you very much." With me, someone corrects me up to now.', 'source_text' => 'Terima kasih banyak-banyak." Begitu juga halnya dengan diri saya apabila ada orang menegur saya sehingga ke hari ini.', 'order' => 739],
            ['start_time' => 2339.53, 'end_time' => 2343.32, 'target_text' => 'They say, "This guy I\'m sure you might have heard they say he doesn\'t talk about Gaza.', 'source_text' => 'Ada orang menuduh, "Orang ini — saya yakin anda mungkin pernah mendengarnya — dia tidak bercakap tentang isu Gaza.', 'order' => 740],
            ['start_time' => 2343.41, 'end_time' => 2344.11, 'target_text' => 'He doesn\'t do this.', 'source_text' => 'Dia tidak memperjuangkan isu ini.', 'order' => 741],
            ['start_time' => 2344.22, 'end_time' => 2345.84, 'target_text' => 'He\'s a Zionist." What do you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Dia ini seorang penyokong Zionis." Tahukah anda apa sikap saya?', 'order' => 742],
            ['start_time' => 2345.93, 'end_time' => 2346.63, 'target_text' => 'That\'s their opinion.', 'source_text' => 'Itu pandangan peribadi mereka.', 'order' => 743],
            ['start_time' => 2346.74, 'end_time' => 2347.76, 'target_text' => 'They probably don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka berkemungkinan besar tidak mengetahui hakikat sebenar.', 'order' => 744],
            ['start_time' => 2347.86, 'end_time' => 2351.47, 'target_text' => 'They are probably victim of the algorithms and they don\'t even know.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mungkin menjadi mangsa sekatan algoritma media sosial tanpa mereka sendiri menyedarinya.', 'order' => 745],
            ['start_time' => 2351.57, 'end_time' => 2357.59, 'target_text' => 'But I don\'t want to cause a war with my own brothers and sisters because they are thinking bad of me.', 'source_text' => 'Namun saya tidak mahu mencetuskan perbalahan sesama saudara seislam saya semata-mata kerana mereka bersangka buruk terhadap saya.', 'order' => 746],
            ['start_time' => 2357.7, 'end_time' => 2363.43, 'target_text' => 'I\'d rather they think bad of me and the ummah remains together than for me to fight them and split the ummah in another 20', 'source_text' => 'Saya lebih rela mereka bersangka buruk terhadap peribadi saya asalkan kesatuan ummah kekal terpelihara, daripada saya membalas serangan mereka lalu memecahbelahkan ummah kepada 20', 'order' => 747],
            ['start_time' => 2363.53, 'end_time' => 2364.55, 'target_text' => 'different ways.', 'source_text' => 'puak yang berbeza.', 'order' => 748],
            ['start_time' => 2364.66, 'end_time' => 2366.03, 'target_text' => 'We are not Zionistic.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sama sekali bukan penyokong Zionis.', 'order' => 749],
            ['start_time' => 2366.13, 'end_time' => 2373.68, 'target_text' => 'We are definitely pro-Palestine and pro-Gaza and we\'ve done more than we have pro more than we have advertised.', 'source_text' => 'Kita berdiri teguh menyokong perjuangan Palestin dan membela warga Gaza, malah kami telah menyalurkan bantuan jauh lebih banyak daripada apa yang kami war-warkan kepada umum.', 'order' => 750],
            ['start_time' => 2373.78, 'end_time' => 2379.76, 'target_text' => 'And we will definitely continue to speak about the genocide that continues up to now.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kami akan terus-menerus bersuara menentang kekejaman pembunuhan beramai-ramai (genosid) yang masih berlarutan sehingga ke saat ini.', 'order' => 751],
            ['start_time' => 2379.86, 'end_time' => 2381.43, 'target_text' => 'Even though they say there is a ceasefire.', 'source_text' => 'Walaupun ada pihak yang mendakwa kononnya telah berlaku gencatan senjata.', 'order' => 752],
            ['start_time' => 2381.53, 'end_time' => 2382.36, 'target_text' => 'What ceasefire?', 'source_text' => 'Gencatan senjata apa yang dimaksudkan?', 'order' => 753],
            ['start_time' => 2382.45, 'end_time' => 2384.59, 'target_text' => 'Every day they are dying.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap hari saudara kita di sana terus gugur syahid.', 'order' => 754],
            ['start_time' => 2384.7, 'end_time' => 2386.84, 'target_text' => 'Not just dying, being butchered and murdered.', 'source_text' => 'Bukan sekadar meninggal dunia biasa, mereka disembelih, dibantai dan dibunuh dengan kejam.', 'order' => 755],
            ['start_time' => 2386.93, 'end_time' => 2388.39, 'target_text' => 'And every day land is being taken.', 'source_text' => 'Dan setiap hari tanah air mereka terus dirampas.', 'order' => 756],
            ['start_time' => 2388.49, 'end_time' => 2389.99, 'target_text' => 'Do you know?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda?', 'order' => 757],
            ['start_time' => 2390.09, 'end_time' => 2392.84, 'target_text' => 'I came in here and I wanted to say to you, "Do you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Saya melangkah masuk ke sini dan saya ingin menegaskan kepada anda, "Tahukah anda?', 'order' => 758],
            ['start_time' => 2392.93, 'end_time' => 2397.88, 'target_text' => 'Our brothers and sisters are all over I am very very on the button with what\'s going on.', 'source_text' => 'Saudara-mara kita berada di seluruh pelosok dunia, dan saya sentiasa mengikuti rapat setiap perkembangan terkini yang berlaku.', 'order' => 759],
            ['start_time' => 2397.97, 'end_time' => 2398.68, 'target_text' => 'Trust me.', 'source_text' => 'Percayalah kepada saya.', 'order' => 760],
            ['start_time' => 2398.78, 'end_time' => 2404.68, 'target_text' => 'I will tell you what happened today in Nepal, what happened yesterday in Indonesia and the last 2 weeks in the Philippines', 'source_text' => 'Saya boleh memberitahu anda apa yang berlaku pada hari ini di Nepal, apa yang menimpa semalam di Indonesia, dan apa yang melanda Filipina dalam tempoh dua minggu lalu,', 'order' => 761],
            ['start_time' => 2404.78, 'end_time' => 2406.11, 'target_text' => 'and those kind I will let you know.', 'source_text' => 'dan musibah seumpamanya, saya akan kongsikan dengan anda.', 'order' => 762],
            ['start_time' => 2406.22, 'end_time' => 2407.03, 'target_text' => 'There were earthquakes.', 'source_text' => 'Berlaku bencana gempa bumi.', 'order' => 763],
            ['start_time' => 2407.13, 'end_time' => 2407.91, 'target_text' => 'There were mudslides.', 'source_text' => 'Berlaku tragedi tanah runtuh.', 'order' => 764],
            ['start_time' => 2408.01, 'end_time' => 2408.76, 'target_text' => 'There were tsunamis.', 'source_text' => 'Berlaku malapetaka tsunami.', 'order' => 765],
            ['start_time' => 2408.86, 'end_time' => 2412.84, 'target_text' => 'There were so much more there and so much of destruction and floods.', 'source_text' => 'Terlalu banyak kemusnahan harta benda dan banjir besar yang melanda di sana.', 'order' => 766],
            ['start_time' => 2412.93, 'end_time' => 2416.59, 'target_text' => 'Do you even know this?" So, it\'s all over the world.', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah anda mengambil tahu tentang semua ini?" Musibah berlaku di seluruh pelusuk dunia.', 'order' => 767],
            ['start_time' => 2416.7, 'end_time' => 2417.91, 'target_text' => 'I belong to a charity.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bernaung di bawah sebuah badan kebajikan.', 'order' => 768],
            ['start_time' => 2418.01, 'end_time' => 2421.36, 'target_text' => 'I work with an international aid organization.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berkhidmat bersama sebuah organisasi bantuan kemanusiaan antarabangsa.', 'order' => 769],
            ['start_time' => 2421.45, 'end_time' => 2423.55, 'target_text' => 'You really reckon I don\'t know?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda benar-benar menyangka bahawa saya tidak mengambil peduli?', 'order' => 770],
            ['start_time' => 2423.66, 'end_time' => 2426.32, 'target_text' => 'If you didn\'t see something, who does that platform belong to?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda tidak melihat sesuatu hantaran di media sosial, milik siapakah platform tersebut?', 'order' => 771],
            ['start_time' => 2426.41, 'end_time' => 2427.43, 'target_text' => 'Why didn\'t you see it?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa anda tidak dapat melihatnya?', 'order' => 772],
            ['start_time' => 2427.53, 'end_time' => 2428.43, 'target_text' => 'Do you know?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda puncanya?', 'order' => 773],
            ['start_time' => 2428.53, 'end_time' => 2433.99, 'target_text' => 'There\'s something called shadow banning, there\'s something called a deletion, there\'s something called There are so many things.', 'source_text' => 'Ada sistem yang dipanggil \'shadow banning\' (sekatan halimunan), ada sistem pemadaman kandungan, ada pelbagai bentuk sekatan lain.', 'order' => 774],
            ['start_time' => 2434.09, 'end_time' => 2435.72, 'target_text' => 'It doesn\'t belong to you and I.', 'source_text' => 'Platform media sosial tersebut bukan milik anda dan saya.', 'order' => 775],
            ['start_time' => 2435.82, 'end_time' => 2437.43, 'target_text' => 'Anyway, I don\'t want to get into that topic.', 'source_text' => 'Apapun, saya tidak berniat untuk memanjangkan perbahasan mengenai isu itu.', 'order' => 776],
            ['start_time' => 2437.53, 'end_time' => 2441.84, 'target_text' => 'All I\'m saying is still when people tell me something, I just say jazakallahu khairan.', 'source_text' => 'Apa yang ingin saya tegaskan adalah, apabila orang menegur saya tentang sesuatu perkara, saya tetap memilih untuk membalas, "Jazakallahu khairan.', 'order' => 777],
            ['start_time' => 2441.93, 'end_time' => 2443.39, 'target_text' => 'Uncle, please make dua for me.', 'source_text' => 'Pakcik, tolong doakan saya.', 'order' => 778],
            ['start_time' => 2443.49, 'end_time' => 2444.32, 'target_text' => 'I\'m weak.', 'source_text' => 'Saya insan yang serba lemah."', 'order' => 779],
            ['start_time' => 2444.41, 'end_time' => 2445.16, 'target_text' => 'That\'s all.', 'source_text' => 'Cukup sekadar itu.', 'order' => 780],
            ['start_time' => 2445.26, 'end_time' => 2446.63, 'target_text' => 'And end it and go away.', 'source_text' => 'Selesaikan perbualan dan beredarlah dengan tenang.', 'order' => 781],
            ['start_time' => 2446.74, 'end_time' => 2447.88, 'target_text' => 'I\'m weak.', 'source_text' => '"Saya seorang yang lemah."', 'order' => 782],
            ['start_time' => 2447.97, 'end_time' => 2450.24, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the best way of closing the discussion.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah cara yang paling damai untuk menutup sebarang pertikaian.', 'order' => 783],
            ['start_time' => 2450.34, 'end_time' => 2451.24, 'target_text' => 'Someone says, "You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Apabila seseorang berkata, "Tahukah kamu?', 'order' => 784],
            ['start_time' => 2451.34, 'end_time' => 2451.84, 'target_text' => 'You didn\'t do this.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu tidak buat perkara ini.', 'order' => 785],
            ['start_time' => 2451.93, 'end_time' => 2457.28, 'target_text' => 'You didn\'t do that." The other day in one of the masajid, I asked the people, I said, "Please give me one piece of advice."', 'source_text' => 'Kamu terlepas pandang perkara itu." Baru-baru ini di salah sebuah masjid, saya meminta jemaah dengan berkata, "Tolong berikan saya satu nasihat."', 'order' => 786],
            ['start_time' => 2457.38, 'end_time' => 2459.28, 'target_text' => 'So, many people put up their hands.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu ramai jemaah mengangkat tangan mereka.', 'order' => 787],
            ['start_time' => 2459.38, 'end_time' => 2461.88, 'target_text' => 'And one of the brothers gave me good a very good piece of advice.', 'source_text' => 'Dan salah seorang jemaah lelaki telah memberikan nasihat yang sangat bermakna kepada saya.', 'order' => 788],
            ['start_time' => 2461.97, 'end_time' => 2463.03, 'target_text' => 'And I told him jazakallahu khairan.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya berkata kepadanya, "Jazakallahu khairan.', 'order' => 789],
            ['start_time' => 2463.13, 'end_time' => 2463.76, 'target_text' => 'Thank you so much.', 'source_text' => 'Terima kasih banyak-banyak."', 'order' => 790],
            ['start_time' => 2463.86, 'end_time' => 2466.63, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, it was It touched my heart what he said.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, kata-kata nasihatnya itu benar-benar menyentuh hati sanubari saya.', 'order' => 791],
            ['start_time' => 2466.74, 'end_time' => 2468.99, 'target_text' => 'But, I was willing to listen to anything.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya sentiasa bersedia untuk mendengar apa jua teguran.', 'order' => 792],
            ['start_time' => 2469.09, 'end_time' => 2475.03, 'target_text' => 'Imagine if I were to ask you, "Give me a piece of advice." Many of you are itching to tell me something to correct me.', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan sekiranya saya bertanya kepada anda, "Berikan saya satu teguran." Ramai antara anda pasti berkobar-kobar ingin menegur sesuatu kesilapan saya.', 'order' => 793],
            ['start_time' => 2475.13, 'end_time' => 2477.11, 'target_text' => 'Maybe you might have heard something, seen something.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin anda pernah mendengar sesuatu khabar angin atau melihat sesuatu perkara.', 'order' => 794],
            ['start_time' => 2477.22, 'end_time' => 2478.91, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, I\'m willing to listen to you.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, saya sentiasa berlapang dada untuk mendengar pandangan anda.', 'order' => 795],
            ['start_time' => 2479.01, 'end_time' => 2485.97, 'target_text' => 'And I want to be corrected because I believe the only way we can outshine the whole world is when we accept correction.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya bersedia untuk diperbetulkan kerana saya yakin satu-satunya jalan untuk kita melakar kecemerlangan di dunia adalah apabila kita bersedia menerima teguran.', 'order' => 796],
            ['start_time' => 2486.38, 'end_time' => 2487.95, 'target_text' => 'Otherwise, you\'re not going to move anywhere.', 'source_text' => 'Jika tidak, anda tidak akan mampu melangkah maju ke mana-mana.', 'order' => 797],
            ['start_time' => 2488.05, 'end_time' => 2490.32, 'target_text' => 'When I read Quran, I thought I knew it all.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu ketika saya mula-mula membaca al-Quran, saya menyangka saya sudah mengetahui segalanya.', 'order' => 798],
            ['start_time' => 2490.41, 'end_time' => 2493.51, 'target_text' => 'I went to another teacher, and he corrected what I already knew.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu saya berguru dengan seorang guru lain, dan beliau memperbetulkan apa yang saya sangka saya sudah mahir.', 'order' => 799],
            ['start_time' => 2493.61, 'end_time' => 2497.24, 'target_text' => 'And then I went to a third teacher, and he corrected what I learned from the second teacher.', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian saya berguru pula dengan guru ketiga, dan beliau memperbetulkan lagi bacaan yang saya pelajari daripada guru kedua.', 'order' => 800],
            ['start_time' => 2497.34, 'end_time' => 2498.59, 'target_text' => 'And then I got ijaza.', 'source_text' => 'Dan selepas itu saya memperoleh sanad ijazah al-Quran.', 'order' => 801],
            ['start_time' => 2498.7, 'end_time' => 2501.43, 'target_text' => 'And then I made sure that ijaza was on a very high level.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya memastikan bahawa sanad ijazah tersebut adalah pada sanad yang bersambung tinggi.', 'order' => 802],
            ['start_time' => 2501.53, 'end_time' => 2502.16, 'target_text' => 'And what happened?', 'source_text' => 'Dan apakah yang berlaku selepas itu?', 'order' => 803],
            ['start_time' => 2502.26, 'end_time' => 2505.76, 'target_text' => 'We now learned something that we really didn\'t imagine.', 'source_text' => 'Kami kini mempelajari sesuatu ilmu yang tidak pernah kami bayangkan sebelum ini.', 'order' => 804],
            ['start_time' => 2505.86, 'end_time' => 2507.95, 'target_text' => 'And when we were young, we wouldn\'t have believed.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ketika kami masih muda dahulu, kami mungkin sukar mempercayainya.', 'order' => 805],
            ['start_time' => 2508.05, 'end_time' => 2510.51, 'target_text' => 'Why did I not, you know, I\'m reading Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa dahulu saya tidak — anda tahu, ketika saya mendengar bacaan al-Quran.', 'order' => 806],
            ['start_time' => 2510.61, 'end_time' => 2512.59, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes we hear people read Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala kita mendengar orang membaca al-Quran di sekeliling kita.', 'order' => 807],
            ['start_time' => 2512.7, 'end_time' => 2513.39, 'target_text' => 'And you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan tahukah anda apa yang terlintas dalam fikiran saya?', 'order' => 808],
            ['start_time' => 2513.49, 'end_time' => 2515.59, 'target_text' => 'In my mind, I say this person needs correction.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalam hati saya berbisik bahawa bacaan insan ini memerlukan pembetulan makhraj dan tajwid.', 'order' => 809],
            ['start_time' => 2515.7, 'end_time' => 2517.43, 'target_text' => 'Someone with love needs to go to them.', 'source_text' => 'Seseorang perlu mendekatinya dengan penuh kasih sayang dan kelembutan.', 'order' => 810],
            ['start_time' => 2517.53, 'end_time' => 2522.99, 'target_text' => 'Beautiful voice, beautiful tone, beautiful tune, but no tajweed, no pronunciation.', 'source_text' => 'Suaranya sungguh merdu, alunannya indah, lagunya memukau, namun tiada kaedah tajwid dan sebutan makhraj huruf yang betul.', 'order' => 811],
            ['start_time' => 2523.09, 'end_time' => 2525.38, 'target_text' => 'How would you know?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah anda boleh mengetahuinya?', 'order' => 812],
            ['start_time' => 2526.89, 'end_time' => 2528.7, 'target_text' => 'Cool.', 'source_text' => 'Hebat bukan?', 'order' => 813],
            ['start_time' => 2529.01, 'end_time' => 2531.22, 'target_text' => 'What does that mean?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah maksud di sebalik hakikat itu?', 'order' => 814],
            ['start_time' => 2531.7, 'end_time' => 2536.95, 'target_text' => 'Indeed, the people of a certain virtue are only recognized by people of a similar virtue.', 'source_text' => 'Sesungguhnya kelebihan sesuatu kemahiran itu hanya mampu dinilai oleh mereka yang mempunyai kemahiran yang sama.', 'order' => 815],
            ['start_time' => 2537.05, 'end_time' => 2541.32, 'target_text' => 'It takes a Qari al-Quran to recognize another Qari al-Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Ia memerlukan seorang qari al-Quran untuk mengenali mutu bacaan qari al-Quran yang lain.', 'order' => 816],
            ['start_time' => 2541.41, 'end_time' => 2543.95, 'target_text' => 'The rest of the public THEY SAY, "MASHA ALLAH!', 'source_text' => 'Orang awam yang lain sekadar bersorak, "MASYA-ALLAH!', 'order' => 817],
            ['start_time' => 2544.05, 'end_time' => 2546.76, 'target_text' => 'TAKBIR!" AND THE Sheikh sitting in the front says, "You know what?', 'source_text' => 'TAKBIR!" Namun tuan guru syeikh yang duduk di saf hadapan berkata, "Tahukah kamu?', 'order' => 818],
            ['start_time' => 2546.86, 'end_time' => 2548.32, 'target_text' => 'He couldn\'t pronounce his Qaf.', 'source_text' => 'Dia tadi gagal menyebut huruf Qaf dengan tepat.', 'order' => 819],
            ['start_time' => 2548.41, 'end_time' => 2552.91, 'target_text' => 'Instead of Qalb, he says Kalb." Inna fi dhalika la dhikra liman kana lahu Kalb.', 'source_text' => 'Daripada menyebut Qalb (hati), dia menyebut Kalb (anjing)." Inna fi dhalika la dhikra liman kana lahu Kalb.', 'order' => 820],
            ['start_time' => 2553.01, 'end_time' => 2554.99, 'target_text' => 'La hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'source_text' => 'La hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'order' => 821],
            ['start_time' => 2555.09, 'end_time' => 2557.95, 'target_text' => 'I corrected one brother who said that and he got upset with me.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah menegur seorang jemaah lelaki yang membaca begitu lalu dia berasa kecil hati dan marah kepada saya.', 'order' => 822],
            ['start_time' => 2558.05, 'end_time' => 2563.24, 'target_text' => 'I said, "Habibi, if you know Arabic, you will know what you said is haram.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berkata kepadanya, "Habibi, sekiranya anda memahami bahasa Arab, anda akan tahu bahawa apa yang anda baca tadi membawa erti yang rosak.', 'order' => 823],
            ['start_time' => 2563.34, 'end_time' => 2564.72, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not allowed.', 'source_text' => 'Ia tidak dibenarkan.', 'order' => 824],
            ['start_time' => 2564.82, 'end_time' => 2567.47, 'target_text' => 'Qalb is a heart and Kalb is a dog.', 'source_text' => 'Qalb (dengan huruf Qaf) bermaksud hati nurani, manakala Kalb (dengan huruf Kaf) bermaksud anjing.', 'order' => 825],
            ['start_time' => 2567.57, 'end_time' => 2568.68, 'target_text' => 'And you are saying Kalb.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda tadi telah menyebut perkataan Kalb (anjing).', 'order' => 826],
            ['start_time' => 2568.78, 'end_time' => 2569.36, 'target_text' => 'Come on, man.', 'source_text' => 'Bertenanglah, wahai saudaraku.', 'order' => 827],
            ['start_time' => 2569.45, 'end_time' => 2570.2, 'target_text' => 'Relax.', 'source_text' => 'Bertenang.', 'order' => 828],
            ['start_time' => 2570.3, 'end_time' => 2571.2, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t feel bad.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan berasa tersinggung.', 'order' => 829],
            ['start_time' => 2571.3, 'end_time' => 2572.51, 'target_text' => 'It\'s the word of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Ini adalah kalam Allah.', 'order' => 830],
            ['start_time' => 2572.61, 'end_time' => 2573.47, 'target_text' => 'You need to be corrected.', 'source_text' => 'Wajib bagi anda untuk menerima pembetulan.', 'order' => 831],
            ['start_time' => 2573.57, 'end_time' => 2579.91, 'target_text' => 'When the Imam comes up, no matter who the Imam is, Imam of the Haram, if someone corrects him at the back and he feels bad,', 'source_text' => 'Apabila imam melangkah ke hadapan mengimami solat, tidak kira siapa imam tersebut — sekalipun Imam Masjidil Haram — sekiranya jemaah di belakang menegur kesilapan ayatnya lalu dia berasa malu,', 'order' => 832],
            ['start_time' => 2580.01, 'end_time' => 2580.59, 'target_text' => 'what will happen?', 'source_text' => 'apakah yang bakal berlaku?', 'order' => 833],
            ['start_time' => 2580.7, 'end_time' => 2581.36, 'target_text' => 'Do they feel bad?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah para imam di Masjidil Haram berasa tersinggung?', 'order' => 834],
            ['start_time' => 2581.45, 'end_time' => 2582.07, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t feel bad.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka langsung tidak berasa kecil hati.', 'order' => 835],
            ['start_time' => 2582.18, 'end_time' => 2583.03, 'target_text' => 'You know what I love?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang amat saya kagumi?', 'order' => 836],
            ['start_time' => 2583.13, 'end_time' => 2584.91, 'target_text' => 'When I was young, I used to do Tarawih.', 'source_text' => 'Ketika zaman muda saya dahulu, saya sering mengimami solat tarawih.', 'order' => 837],
            ['start_time' => 2585.01, 'end_time' => 2587.55, 'target_text' => 'From the age of 14, I was the Imam in the masjid.', 'source_text' => 'Sejak berumur 14 tahun lagi, saya telah diberi amanah menjadi imam di masjid.', 'order' => 838],
            ['start_time' => 2587.66, 'end_time' => 2588.43, 'target_text' => 'I used to lead Tarawih.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sering mengimami solat tarawih.', 'order' => 839],
            ['start_time' => 2588.53, 'end_time' => 2593.36, 'target_text' => 'Full Quran I used to lead in some instances and some uh a portion of it.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala saya mengimami khatam 30 juzuk al-Quran sepenuhnya, dan kadangkala sebahagian daripadanya.', 'order' => 840],
            ['start_time' => 2593.45, 'end_time' => 2597.11, 'target_text' => 'And when someone corrects us, they don\'t even give you a moment and they fire.', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila seseorang makmum menegur kesilapan ayat, mereka tidak menunggu walau sesaat dan terus menyergah menegur.', 'order' => 841],
            ['start_time' => 2597.22, 'end_time' => 2598.76, 'target_text' => 'And we used to feel bad.', 'source_text' => 'Dan dahulu kami sering berasa tersinggung di dalam hati.', 'order' => 842],
            ['start_time' => 2598.86, 'end_time' => 2602.76, 'target_text' => 'We used to feel, "Hey, at least give me a few moments." When you know, this guy here, he\'s just whacking it.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu kami berbisik, "Aduh, berilah peluang beberapa saat dahulu untuk saya ingat kembali." Tetapi jemaah di belakang terus menegur dengan pantas.', 'order' => 843],
            ['start_time' => 2602.86, 'end_time' => 2604.95, 'target_text' => 'And then I went to Mecca.', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian saya berpeluang menjejakkan kaki ke Makkah.', 'order' => 844],
            ['start_time' => 2605.05, 'end_time' => 2609.11, 'target_text' => 'When I went to Mecca, it was 1988 in Ramadan.', 'source_text' => 'Ketika saya pergi ke Makkah pada bulan Ramadan tahun 1988.', 'order' => 845],
            ['start_time' => 2609.22, 'end_time' => 2610.95, 'target_text' => 'There were three Imams in Mecca.', 'source_text' => 'Pada waktu itu terdapat tiga orang imam utama di Makkah.', 'order' => 846],
            ['start_time' => 2611.05, 'end_time' => 2614.24, 'target_text' => 'They used to read the whole Tarawih one day, one day, one day.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mengimami solat tarawih bergilir-gilir secara penuh — sehari seorang imam, kemudian imam seterusnya.', 'order' => 847],
            ['start_time' => 2614.34, 'end_time' => 2615.51, 'target_text' => 'Do you know who they were?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda siapakah mereka?', 'order' => 848],
            ['start_time' => 2615.61, 'end_time' => 2617.84, 'target_text' => 'The first day, Sheikh Abdur Rahman as-Sudais.', 'source_text' => 'Malam pertama diimami oleh Sheikh Abdur Rahman as-Sudais.', 'order' => 849],
            ['start_time' => 2617.93, 'end_time' => 2620.36, 'target_text' => 'The second day, Sheikh Ali Abdullah Jabir.', 'source_text' => 'Malam kedua diimami oleh Sheikh Ali Abdullah Jabir.', 'order' => 850],
            ['start_time' => 2620.45, 'end_time' => 2623.84, 'target_text' => 'And the third day, Sheikh Ali Abdur Rahman al-Hudaifi.', 'source_text' => 'Dan malam ketiga diimami oleh Sheikh Ali Abdur Rahman al-Hudaifi.', 'order' => 851],
            ['start_time' => 2623.93, 'end_time' => 2626.84, 'target_text' => 'This was in Mecca in 1988, right?', 'source_text' => 'Peristiwa ini berlaku di Makkah pada tahun 1988, betul bukan?', 'order' => 852],
            ['start_time' => 2626.93, 'end_time' => 2627.95, 'target_text' => 'These were the three Imams.', 'source_text' => 'Merekalah tiga orang imam besar pada ketika itu.', 'order' => 853],
            ['start_time' => 2628.05, 'end_time' => 2629.28, 'target_text' => 'They used to rotate.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mengimami solat secara bergilir-gilir.', 'order' => 854],
            ['start_time' => 2629.38, 'end_time' => 2630.47, 'target_text' => 'Now, what happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang berlaku?', 'order' => 855],
            ['start_time' => 2630.57, 'end_time' => 2635.68, 'target_text' => 'When one makes a mistake, they are corrected and they carry on like nothing happened.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila salah seorang imam tersilap ayat, makmum di belakang menegur dan imam tersebut meneruskan bacaan seperti tiada apa-apa yang berlaku.', 'order' => 856],
            ['start_time' => 2635.78, 'end_time' => 2636.43, 'target_text' => 'They continue.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka terus membaca dengan tenang.', 'order' => 857],
            ['start_time' => 2636.53, 'end_time' => 2637.32, 'target_text' => 'No one felt bad.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada seorang pun berasa tersinggung atau malu.', 'order' => 858],
            ['start_time' => 2637.41, 'end_time' => 2638.47, 'target_text' => 'The tune doesn\'t change.', 'source_text' => 'Alunan taranum mereka langsung tidak berubah sumbang.', 'order' => 859],
            ['start_time' => 2638.57, 'end_time' => 2640.95, 'target_text' => 'When I used to be corrected, the tune used to change.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu ketika saya ditegur kesilapan, alunan suara saya terus berubah serak.', 'order' => 860],
            ['start_time' => 2641.05, 'end_time' => 2642.63, 'target_text' => 'I used to feel upset and like I want to give up.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu saya berasa kecewa dan rasa hendak berundur mengalah.', 'order' => 861],
            ['start_time' => 2642.74, 'end_time' => 2643.16, 'target_text' => 'Okay, خلاص.', 'source_text' => '"Sudahlah, cukuplah.', 'order' => 862],
            ['start_time' => 2643.26, 'end_time' => 2644.36, 'target_text' => 'You made two, three mistakes.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu dah buat dua tiga kesilapan tadi."', 'order' => 863],
            ['start_time' => 2644.45, 'end_time' => 2647.84, 'target_text' => 'Now I\'m I\'m slumped and I feel like you know I\'m punctured.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu saya berasa jatuh semangat dan rasa bagaikan \'tayar yang bocor\'.', 'order' => 864],
            ['start_time' => 2647.93, 'end_time' => 2648.76, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa?', 'order' => 865],
            ['start_time' => 2648.86, 'end_time' => 2651.32, 'target_text' => 'Who do you want to impress that you did not make mistakes?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah yang ingin anda kagumkan kononnya anda tidak pernah melakukan kesilapan?', 'order' => 866],
            ['start_time' => 2651.41, 'end_time' => 2653.47, 'target_text' => 'No, I want to impress Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, niat saya hanyalah semata-mata mencari keredaan Allah.', 'order' => 867],
            ['start_time' => 2653.57, 'end_time' => 2657.24, 'target_text' => 'Oh Allah, I was corrected and I took the correction because this is your word.', 'source_text' => '"Ya Allah, aku ditegur dan aku menerima teguran ini kerana ini adalah kalam suci-Mu.', 'order' => 868],
            ['start_time' => 2657.34, 'end_time' => 2659.72, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not It\'s not anyone\'s book.', 'source_text' => 'Ini bukan buku karangan mana-mana manusia biasa."', 'order' => 869],
            ['start_time' => 2659.82, 'end_time' => 2661.24, 'target_text' => 'I felt good.', 'source_text' => 'Maka saya berasa amat tenang dan lapang dada.', 'order' => 870],
            ['start_time' => 2661.34, 'end_time' => 2662.55, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 871],
            ['start_time' => 2662.66, 'end_time' => 2664.16, 'target_text' => 'So', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu,', 'order' => 872],
            ['start_time' => 2664.26, 'end_time' => 2666.07, 'target_text' => 'feel good when someone corrects you.', 'source_text' => 'berlapang dadalah dan berasa gembiralah apabila seseorang menegur kesilapan anda.', 'order' => 873],
            ['start_time' => 2666.18, 'end_time' => 2667.28, 'target_text' => 'After that I learned.', 'source_text' => 'Sejak daripada peristiwa itulah saya belajar menjadi matang.', 'order' => 874],
            ['start_time' => 2667.38, 'end_time' => 2669.68, 'target_text' => 'Now correct me, I will not feel bad.', 'source_text' => 'Kini sekiranya anda menegur saya, saya tidak akan berasa kecil hati lagi.', 'order' => 875],
            ['start_time' => 2669.78, 'end_time' => 2670.8, 'target_text' => 'Because I realized you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Kerana saya sedar bahawa tahukah anda?', 'order' => 876],
            ['start_time' => 2670.89, 'end_time' => 2674.36, 'target_text' => 'You want to be Imam You must not feel bad when you are corrected.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda ingin menjadi seorang imam, anda tidak boleh berasa tersinggung apabila ditegur.', 'order' => 877],
            ['start_time' => 2674.45, 'end_time' => 2675.99, 'target_text' => 'Up to today they they are excited.', 'source_text' => 'Sehingga ke hari ini para imam di sana sentiasa berlapang dada.', 'order' => 878],
            ['start_time' => 2676.09, 'end_time' => 2680.8, 'target_text' => 'You correct any one of them subhanallah they will take the correction and keep it moving as though nothing happened because', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda menegur mana-mana seorang daripada mereka, subhanallah mereka menerima teguran tersebut dan meneruskan bacaan seolah-olah tiada apa yang berlaku kerana menyedari', 'order' => 879],
            ['start_time' => 2680.89, 'end_time' => 2681.63, 'target_text' => 'human beings.', 'source_text' => 'hakikat sifat manusia biasa.', 'order' => 880],
            ['start_time' => 2681.74, 'end_time' => 2685.43, 'target_text' => 'And sometimes there a lot of mistakes that happen in the Haram, a lot.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kadangkala terdapat juga kesilapan yang berlaku dalam bacaan di Masjidil Haram, banyak kali juga.', 'order' => 881],
            ['start_time' => 2685.53, 'end_time' => 2686.95, 'target_text' => 'Because everyone is a human.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana setiap insan adalah manusia biasa.', 'order' => 882],
            ['start_time' => 2687.05, 'end_time' => 2691.39, 'target_text' => 'The point I\'m raising here is let\'s not justify when we are corrected.', 'source_text' => 'Intipati yang ingin saya tekankan di sini adalah marilah kita jangan mencari alasan membela diri apabila kita ditegur.', 'order' => 883],
            ['start_time' => 2691.49, 'end_time' => 2692.43, 'target_text' => 'I want to correct myself.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sentiasa ingin memperbaiki diri saya.', 'order' => 884],
            ['start_time' => 2692.53, 'end_time' => 2696.32, 'target_text' => 'I need that scale on that day of judgement to be tipped on the right side.', 'source_text' => 'Saya amat mendambakan timbangan mizan pada hari kiamat kelak menjadi berat di sebelah kanan.', 'order' => 885],
            ['start_time' => 2696.41, 'end_time' => 2700.43, 'target_text' => 'So keep on doing lots and lots and lots of good deeds by the help and the will of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka teruskanlah melipatgandakan sebanyak mungkin amalan kebajikan dengan pertolongan dan kehendak Allah.', 'order' => 886],
            ['start_time' => 2700.53, 'end_time' => 2703.07, 'target_text' => 'So we start off by seeking the forgiveness of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka langkah pertama kita bermula dengan memohon keampunan (istighfar) daripada Allah.', 'order' => 887],
            ['start_time' => 2703.18, 'end_time' => 2704.68, 'target_text' => 'Secondly,', 'source_text' => 'Keduanya,', 'order' => 888],
            ['start_time' => 2704.78, 'end_time' => 2705.68, 'target_text' => 'humble yourself.', 'source_text' => 'rendahkanlah hati anda dengan sifat tawaduk.', 'order' => 889],
            ['start_time' => 2705.78, 'end_time' => 2712.05, 'target_text' => 'Become a person who is not arrogant because with arrogance you\'re not going to go far in life.', 'source_text' => 'Jadilah insan yang tidak takbur dan sombong kerana sifat sombong tidak akan membawa anda ke mana-mana dalam hidup ini.', 'order' => 890],
            ['start_time' => 2716.26, 'end_time' => 2717.2, 'target_text' => 'Hadith.', 'source_text' => 'Sabda hadis Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam.', 'order' => 891],
            ['start_time' => 2717.3, 'end_time' => 2721.99, 'target_text' => 'He will not enter paradise in whose heart is even a droplet of pride.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak akan masuk syurga sesiapa yang di dalam hatinya terdapat sebesar zarah perasaan sombong takbur.', 'order' => 892],
            ['start_time' => 2722.09, 'end_time' => 2722.59, 'target_text' => 'Remove the pride.', 'source_text' => 'Buangkanlah rasa takbur itu.', 'order' => 893],
            ['start_time' => 2722.7, 'end_time' => 2723.24, 'target_text' => 'Who am I?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah saya ini?', 'order' => 894],
            ['start_time' => 2723.34, 'end_time' => 2724.2, 'target_text' => 'I\'m your brother.', 'source_text' => 'Saya hanyalah saudara anda.', 'order' => 895],
            ['start_time' => 2724.3, 'end_time' => 2725.16, 'target_text' => 'Alas.', 'source_text' => 'Cukup sekadar itu.', 'order' => 896],
            ['start_time' => 2725.26, 'end_time' => 2731.43, 'target_text' => 'If I complete this talk well I if the masjid was maybe half full quarter full, I would have probably sat later on greeted', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya selesai menyampaikan ceramah ini — sekiranya jemaah di masjid ini separuh atau suku sahaja yang hadir, saya pasti akan duduk lebih lama bersalaman dengan', 'order' => 897],
            ['start_time' => 2731.53, 'end_time' => 2734.2, 'target_text' => 'everyone and you know shaken hands with the people and so on.', 'source_text' => 'semua orang, beramah mesra dan berjabat tangan dengan para jemaah sekalian.', 'order' => 898],
            ['start_time' => 2734.3, 'end_time' => 2735.59, 'target_text' => 'But I have a duty.', 'source_text' => 'Namun saya mempunyai amanah dan tanggungjawab menjaga ketenteraman.', 'order' => 899],
            ['start_time' => 2735.7, 'end_time' => 2737.32, 'target_text' => 'This is a masjid it\'s packed.', 'source_text' => 'Ini rumah Allah dan suasananya terlalu padat dengan jemaah.', 'order' => 900],
            ['start_time' => 2737.41, 'end_time' => 2739.11, 'target_text' => 'If I\'m to greet you they will be stampeding.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya berdiri bersalaman dengan anda, pasti akan berlaku tolak-menolak dan kesesakan.', 'order' => 901],
            ['start_time' => 2739.22, 'end_time' => 2741.36, 'target_text' => 'They will be hurting of people, the kids and so on.', 'source_text' => 'Orang ramai mungkin akan tercedera, anak-anak kecil terhimpit dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 902],
            ['start_time' => 2741.45, 'end_time' => 2742.84, 'target_text' => 'It\'s my duty to walk out.', 'source_text' => 'Maka menjadi kewajipan saya untuk segera beredar keluar.', 'order' => 903],
            ['start_time' => 2742.93, 'end_time' => 2744.2, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what I do?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang biasa saya lakukan?', 'order' => 904],
            ['start_time' => 2744.3, 'end_time' => 2746.51, 'target_text' => 'You invite me to a wedding for example.', 'source_text' => 'Katakanlah anda menjemput saya menghadiri majlis perkahwinan.', 'order' => 905],
            ['start_time' => 2746.61, 'end_time' => 2750.11, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t give preference to go to weddings but sometimes we have to go.', 'source_text' => 'Saya biasanya tidak mengutamakan menghadiri kenduri perkahwinan, namun kadangkala kita perlu hadir.', 'order' => 906],
            ['start_time' => 2750.22, 'end_time' => 2753.76, 'target_text' => 'So if I go to the wedding I\'ll tell the brother, brother I\'ll come but I leave immediately.', 'source_text' => 'Maka sekiranya saya hadir ke majlis perkahwinan itu, saya akan berpesan kepada tuan rumah, "Wahai saudaraku, saya akan hadir tetapi saya akan terus beredar sejurus selepas itu."', 'order' => 907],
            ['start_time' => 2753.86, 'end_time' => 2756.03, 'target_text' => 'I\'ll come do a talk, officiate and move.', 'source_text' => 'Saya hadir menyampaikan tazkirah ringkas, mendoakan keberkatan dan segera beredar.', 'order' => 908],
            ['start_time' => 2756.13, 'end_time' => 2756.55, 'target_text' => 'No, but why?', 'source_text' => 'Tuan rumah bertanya, "Kenapa begitu tergesa-gesa?"', 'order' => 909],
            ['start_time' => 2756.66, 'end_time' => 2759.57, 'target_text' => 'I said no, I have something to do.', 'source_text' => 'Saya menjawab, "Saya ada urusan lain yang perlu diselesaikan."', 'order' => 910],
            ['start_time' => 2760.01, 'end_time' => 2761.03, 'target_text' => 'What did I do?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda mengapa saya bertindak sedemikian?', 'order' => 911],
            ['start_time' => 2761.13, 'end_time' => 2764.07, 'target_text' => 'That day belongs to the bride and the groom.', 'source_text' => 'Hari tersebut adalah hari bahagia milik pasangan pengantin lelaki dan perempuan.', 'order' => 912],
            ['start_time' => 2764.18, 'end_time' => 2771.16, 'target_text' => 'I\'m going to go there just because of a few likes and clicks that people have, the focus is going to change onto me.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya duduk berlama-lama di situ semata-mata kerana segelintir \'likes\' dan perhatian manusia, tumpuan majlis pasti akan beralih kepada diri saya.', 'order' => 913],
            ['start_time' => 2771.26, 'end_time' => 2773.32, 'target_text' => 'And everyone wants to take photos and they want to do that.', 'source_text' => 'Dan semua orang akan mengerumuni hendak mengambil gambar dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 914],
            ['start_time' => 2773.41, 'end_time' => 2774.39, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t need all of that.', 'source_text' => 'Saya langsung tidak memerlukan semua publisiti itu.', 'order' => 915],
            ['start_time' => 2774.49, 'end_time' => 2775.32, 'target_text' => 'And they don\'t need all of it.', 'source_text' => 'Dan mereka sendiri sebenarnya tidak memerlukannya.', 'order' => 916],
            ['start_time' => 2775.41, 'end_time' => 2775.82, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tidak sedar.', 'order' => 917],
            ['start_time' => 2775.89, 'end_time' => 2778.32, 'target_text' => 'They\'re excited we\'ve invited this guy to the wedding.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka cuma berasa teruja kononnya berjaya menjemput penceramah ini ke majlis perkahwinan mereka.', 'order' => 918],
            ['start_time' => 2778.41, 'end_time' => 2779.2, 'target_text' => 'What did I do?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang saya lakukan?', 'order' => 919],
            ['start_time' => 2779.3, 'end_time' => 2783.07, 'target_text' => 'I went away as a blessing for me and for everyone else.', 'source_text' => 'Saya segera beredar sebagai suatu rahmat dan kebaikan bagi diri saya dan bagi semua orang yang hadir.', 'order' => 920],
            ['start_time' => 2783.18, 'end_time' => 2784.39, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t need the food.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak berniat untuk menikmati jamuan makanan.', 'order' => 921],
            ['start_time' => 2784.49, 'end_time' => 2787.28, 'target_text' => 'I just mashallah I delivered what I had to and I went away.', 'source_text' => 'Saya telah menyampaikan apa yang diamanahkan dan kemudian saya beredar dengan tenang.', 'order' => 922],
            ['start_time' => 2787.38, 'end_time' => 2789.99, 'target_text' => 'Now the focus remains on the people it\'s supposed to be on.', 'source_text' => 'Kini tumpuan majlis kekal terarah kepada mereka yang sepatutnya diraikan.', 'order' => 923],
            ['start_time' => 2790.09, 'end_time' => 2791.84, 'target_text' => 'It\'s your big day, your big day.', 'source_text' => 'Hari itu adalah hari bersejarah anda, hari bahagia anda.', 'order' => 924],
            ['start_time' => 2791.93, 'end_time' => 2793.43, 'target_text' => 'You wonder why I went.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin tertanya-tanya mengapa saya segera pergi.', 'order' => 925],
            ['start_time' => 2793.53, 'end_time' => 2796.36, 'target_text' => 'Between me and Allah I know why I went.', 'source_text' => 'Antara diri saya dengan Allah, saya tahu apa niat sebenar saya berbuat demikian.', 'order' => 926],
            ['start_time' => 2796.45, 'end_time' => 2798.72, 'target_text' => 'The same applies here.', 'source_text' => 'Begitu juga halnya di sini pada malam ini.', 'order' => 927],
            ['start_time' => 2798.82, 'end_time' => 2801.11, 'target_text' => 'I\'m going to walk out straight after my talk and I\'m going to be gone.', 'source_text' => 'Saya akan melangkah keluar sebaik sahaja selesai menyampaikan ceramah dan saya akan terus beredar.', 'order' => 928],
            ['start_time' => 2801.22, 'end_time' => 2802.47, 'target_text' => 'Before you know it, the man is gone.', 'source_text' => 'Sebelum anda sempat menyedarinya, penceramah sudah pun beredar.', 'order' => 929],
            ['start_time' => 2802.57, 'end_time' => 2802.97, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa?', 'order' => 930],
            ['start_time' => 2803.01, 'end_time' => 2803.55, 'target_text' => 'Who am I?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah diri saya ini?', 'order' => 931],
            ['start_time' => 2803.66, 'end_time' => 2806.84, 'target_text' => 'If there was any virtue in shaking my hand, I\'d shake everybody\'s hand.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya ada fadhilat istimewa dengan bersalaman dengan tangan saya, nescaya saya akan bersalaman dengan setiap orang yang ada.', 'order' => 932],
            ['start_time' => 2806.93, 'end_time' => 2808.11, 'target_text' => 'There\'s no virtue.', 'source_text' => 'Namun tiada keistimewaan luar biasa padanya.', 'order' => 933],
            ['start_time' => 2808.22, 'end_time' => 2810.11, 'target_text' => 'You shake my hand doesn\'t mean a thing.', 'source_text' => 'Bersalaman dengan saya langsung tidak menjamin apa-apa.', 'order' => 934],
            ['start_time' => 2810.22, 'end_time' => 2813.45, 'target_text' => 'Again, in Allahhi', 'source_text' => 'Sekali lagi, di sisi Allah...', 'order' => 935],
            ['start_time' => 2814.53, 'end_time' => 2815.99, 'target_text' => 'You know, so I\'m a human like you.', 'source_text' => 'Saya hanyalah manusia biasa seperti anda semua.', 'order' => 936],
            ['start_time' => 2816.09, 'end_time' => 2817.51, 'target_text' => 'You\'re probably better than me.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin jauh lebih mulia di sisi Allah daripada diri saya.', 'order' => 937],
            ['start_time' => 2817.61, 'end_time' => 2819.03, 'target_text' => 'But I\'m just here to remind you.', 'source_text' => 'Saya hadir di sini sekadar untuk saling mengingatkan.', 'order' => 938],
            ['start_time' => 2819.13, 'end_time' => 2820.95, 'target_text' => 'Maybe you want to listen to me.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin anda sudi mendengarkan nasihat saya.', 'order' => 939],
            ['start_time' => 2821.05, 'end_time' => 2822.63, 'target_text' => 'And maybe you want to hear a few things.', 'source_text' => 'Dan mungkin anda ingin mendengar beberapa patah pesanan.', 'order' => 940],
            ['start_time' => 2822.74, 'end_time' => 2823.47, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a reminder.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah suatu peringatan bersama.', 'order' => 941],
            ['start_time' => 2823.57, 'end_time' => 2826.2, 'target_text' => 'I need this reminder more than you do.', 'source_text' => 'Malah saya sendiri amat memerlukan peringatan ini melebihi diri anda.', 'order' => 942],
            ['start_time' => 2826.3, 'end_time' => 2828.16, 'target_text' => 'But mashallah I will I don\'t mind.', 'source_text' => 'Namun masya-Allah saya tidak keberatan.', 'order' => 943],
            ['start_time' => 2828.26, 'end_time' => 2831.07, 'target_text' => 'We can shake hands because it\'s it\'s a good sunnah.', 'source_text' => 'Kita boleh bersalaman kerana ia adalah amalan sunnah yang sangat dituntut.', 'order' => 944],
            ['start_time' => 2831.18, 'end_time' => 2837.68, 'target_text' => 'But when you know there is a negative side to it and they may be stampeding and there\'s going to be so much of chaos, the', 'source_text' => 'Namun apabila anda menyedari ada risiko kemudaratan di mana jemaah mungkin berasak-asak dan timbul kekecohan yang tidak terkawal, perkara', 'order' => 945],
            ['start_time' => 2837.78, 'end_time' => 2842.95, 'target_text' => 'best thing for you to do is to bismillah salaam alaikum my brothers, my sisters and you walk away.', 'source_text' => 'terbaik yang wajar anda lakukan adalah dengan melafazkan, "Bismillah, assalamu alaykum wahai saudara-saudariku," lalu beredar dengan tenang.', 'order' => 946],
            ['start_time' => 2843.05, 'end_time' => 2844.68, 'target_text' => 'You feel You hear what I\'m saying?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda memahami maksud yang saya sampaikan ini?', 'order' => 947],
            ['start_time' => 2844.78, 'end_time' => 2846.63, 'target_text' => 'May Allah grant us Jannah.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mengurniakan syurga kepada kita semua.', 'order' => 948],
            ['start_time' => 2846.74, 'end_time' => 2848.11, 'target_text' => 'May Allah almighty grant us Jannah.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan Jannatul Firdaus kepada kita semua.', 'order' => 949],
            ['start_time' => 2848.22, 'end_time' => 2850.84, 'target_text' => 'The point I\'m raising, second thing is you need to humble yourself.', 'source_text' => 'Intipati penting yang saya kemukakan, perkara kedua adalah anda wajib merendahkan ego dan bersikap tawaduk.', 'order' => 950],
            ['start_time' => 2850.93, 'end_time' => 2857.2, 'target_text' => 'Third thing, the third thing when you want to change your life and you want that scale to tip in the proper way, learn to', 'source_text' => 'Perkara ketiga — rukun ketiga apabila anda ingin mengubah haluan hidup anda dan mendambakan neraca mizan condong ke sebelah kanan, belajarlah', 'order' => 951],
            ['start_time' => 2857.3, 'end_time' => 2860.11, 'target_text' => 'pray five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'untuk mendirikan solat lima waktu sehari semalam secara istiqamah.', 'order' => 952],
            ['start_time' => 2860.22, 'end_time' => 2862.55, 'target_text' => 'Learn to pray five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'Belajarlah menjaga solat fardu lima waktu.', 'order' => 953],
            ['start_time' => 2862.66, 'end_time' => 2873.51, 'target_text' => 'PUSH YOURSELF HARD HARD HARD because that is the only pillar of Islam after the shahada that nobody has an excuse not to engage', 'source_text' => 'PAKSA DAN DISIPLINKAN DIRI ANDA BERSUNGGUH-SUNGGUH kerana solat adalah satu-satunya rukun Islam selepas syahadah yang tiada sesiapa pun mempunyai alasan untuk mengabaikannya,', 'order' => 954],
            ['start_time' => 2873.61, 'end_time' => 2875.36, 'target_text' => 'in.', 'source_text' => 'walau dalam apa jua keadaan sekalipun.', 'order' => 955],
            ['start_time' => 2875.45, 'end_time' => 2876.43, 'target_text' => 'You know what I mean?', 'source_text' => 'Fahamkah anda apa yang saya maksudkan?', 'order' => 956],
            ['start_time' => 2876.53, 'end_time' => 2877.59, 'target_text' => 'I said it before.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah menyebutnya sebelum ini.', 'order' => 957],
            ['start_time' => 2877.7, 'end_time' => 2879.51, 'target_text' => 'Can tell you quickly.', 'source_text' => 'Boleh saya terangkan kepada anda secara ringkas.', 'order' => 958],
            ['start_time' => 2879.61, 'end_time' => 2881.11, 'target_text' => 'How many pillars in Islam?', 'source_text' => 'Berapakah rukun di dalam Islam?', 'order' => 959],
            ['start_time' => 2881.22, 'end_time' => 2881.68, 'target_text' => 'Five.', 'source_text' => 'Lima.', 'order' => 960],
            ['start_time' => 2881.78, 'end_time' => 2882.18, 'target_text' => 'Five.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, lima rukun.', 'order' => 961],
            ['start_time' => 2882.26, 'end_time' => 2884.72, 'target_text' => 'When you want to enter Islam, what do you say?', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda ingin memeluk Islam, apakah yang anda lafazkan?', 'order' => 962],
            ['start_time' => 2884.82, 'end_time' => 2885.55, 'target_text' => 'Shahada, right?', 'source_text' => 'Dua kalimah syahadah, betul bukan?', 'order' => 963],
            ['start_time' => 2885.66, 'end_time' => 2886.8, 'target_text' => 'So, that\'s first pillar done.', 'source_text' => 'Maka rukun pertama telah terlaksana.', 'order' => 964],
            ['start_time' => 2886.89, 'end_time' => 2887.95, 'target_text' => 'There\'s no no compromise.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada tolak ansur padanya.', 'order' => 965],
            ['start_time' => 2888.05, 'end_time' => 2889.24, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the entry into faith.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah pintu gerbang masuk ke dalam keimanan.', 'order' => 966],
            ['start_time' => 2889.34, 'end_time' => 2890.11, 'target_text' => 'Right.', 'source_text' => 'Baiklah.', 'order' => 967],
            ['start_time' => 2890.22, 'end_time' => 2891.36, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s go from the bottom.', 'source_text' => 'Mari kita teliti dari rukun yang paling bawah.', 'order' => 968],
            ['start_time' => 2891.45, 'end_time' => 2892.68, 'target_text' => 'The last pillar is Hajj.', 'source_text' => 'Rukun Islam yang terakhir adalah ibadah Haji.', 'order' => 969],
            ['start_time' => 2892.78, 'end_time' => 2895.84, 'target_text' => 'If you don\'t have money, is it applicable to you?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda tidak mempunyai kemampuan kewangan, adakah haji wajib ke atas anda?', 'order' => 970],
            ['start_time' => 2895.93, 'end_time' => 2899.07, 'target_text' => 'I believe it a pillar, but I didn\'t fulfill it cuz I don\'t have to.', 'source_text' => 'Saya meyakininya sebagai rukun, tetapi saya tidak menunaikannya kerana saya belum berkemampuan.', 'order' => 971],
            ['start_time' => 2899.18, 'end_time' => 2899.95, 'target_text' => 'Zakat.', 'source_text' => 'Seterusnya, Zakat.', 'order' => 972],
            ['start_time' => 2900.05, 'end_time' => 2904.11, 'target_text' => 'Zakat, you believe it as a pillar, but if you don\'t have wealth, is it applicable to you to fulfill?', 'source_text' => 'Zakat, anda meyakininya sebagai rukun Islam, namun jika anda tidak memiliki harta yang mencukupi nisab, adakah anda diwajibkan mengeluarkannya?', 'order' => 973],
            ['start_time' => 2904.22, 'end_time' => 2905.28, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak wajib.', 'order' => 974],
            ['start_time' => 2905.38, 'end_time' => 2906.2, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s go to the next one.', 'source_text' => 'Mari kita beralih ke rukun seterusnya.', 'order' => 975],
            ['start_time' => 2906.3, 'end_time' => 2906.99, 'target_text' => 'Fasting.', 'source_text' => 'Ibadah Puasa.', 'order' => 976],
            ['start_time' => 2907.09, 'end_time' => 2909.11, 'target_text' => 'Fasting is a very important pillar.', 'source_text' => 'Puasa adalah rukun Islam yang amat penting.', 'order' => 977],
            ['start_time' => 2909.22, 'end_time' => 2915.16, 'target_text' => 'I believe it, but if you are unwell or sick and you cannot fast, does Allah compel you to fast?', 'source_text' => 'Saya meyakininya, namun sekiranya anda uzur atau terlantar sakit dan tidak mampu berpuasa, adakah Allah memaksa anda berpuasa?', 'order' => 978],
            ['start_time' => 2915.26, 'end_time' => 2915.66, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak sama sekali.', 'order' => 979],
            ['start_time' => 2915.7, 'end_time' => 2916.55, 'target_text' => 'You can do a fidiya.', 'source_text' => 'Anda boleh menggantikannya dengan membayar fidyah.', 'order' => 980],
            ['start_time' => 2916.66, 'end_time' => 2918.28, 'target_text' => 'There are other ways of dealing with it.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat jalan keluar syariat untuk menanganinya.', 'order' => 981],
            ['start_time' => 2918.38, 'end_time' => 2920.39, 'target_text' => 'But come to salah.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi apabila tiba kepada kewajipan Solat.', 'order' => 982],
            ['start_time' => 2920.49, 'end_time' => 2922.76, 'target_text' => 'You can\'t read it standing, what do you do?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda tidak mampu solat berdiri, apakah yang anda lakukan?', 'order' => 983],
            ['start_time' => 2922.86, 'end_time' => 2923.25, 'target_text' => 'You sit.', 'source_text' => 'Anda solat secara duduk.', 'order' => 984],
            ['start_time' => 2923.26, 'end_time' => 2924.68, 'target_text' => 'You can\'t sit, what do you do?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda tidak mampu duduk, apa yang anda lakukan?', 'order' => 985],
            ['start_time' => 2924.78, 'end_time' => 2925.32, 'target_text' => 'You lie down.', 'source_text' => 'Anda solat secara berbaring.', 'order' => 986],
            ['start_time' => 2925.41, 'end_time' => 2928.32, 'target_text' => 'You can\'t use the water and do wudu, what do you do?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda tidak boleh menggunakan air untuk berwuduk, apa yang anda lakukan? Anda bertayammum.', 'order' => 987],
            ['start_time' => 2928.41, 'end_time' => 2930.95, 'target_text' => 'But you will always have to pray.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anda tetap diwajibkan untuk mendirikan solat dalam apa jua keadaan.', 'order' => 988],
            ['start_time' => 2931.05, 'end_time' => 2931.84, 'target_text' => 'Prayer.', 'source_text' => 'Ibadah solat.', 'order' => 989],
            ['start_time' => 2931.93, 'end_time' => 2933.8, 'target_text' => 'So, you want to build a connection with Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka sekiranya anda ingin membina hubungan yang akrab dengan Allah.', 'order' => 990],
            ['start_time' => 2933.89, 'end_time' => 2935.8, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what Allah says?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang Allah firmankan?', 'order' => 991],
            ['start_time' => 2935.89, 'end_time' => 2941.59, 'target_text' => 'Allah says there is nothing more beloved unto me than those things which I made compulsory.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman bahawa tiada amalan yang lebih Aku cintai melainkan amalan-amalan yang telah Aku fardukan ke atas hamba-Ku.', 'order' => 992],
            ['start_time' => 2941.7, 'end_time' => 2943.76, 'target_text' => 'That\'s a Hadith Qudsi.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sabda Hadis Qudsi yang agung.', 'order' => 993],
            ['start_time' => 2943.86, 'end_time' => 2948.03, 'target_text' => 'There is nothing more beloved to me than those things which I made compulsory.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada perkara yang lebih Aku cintai melainkan amalan yang telah Aku fardukan ke atas hamba-Ku.', 'order' => 994],
            ['start_time' => 2948.13, 'end_time' => 2951.99, 'target_text' => 'If I made something compulsory, it means I love it the most.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya Aku memfardukan sesuatu amalan, itu bermakna amalan itulah yang paling Aku cintai.', 'order' => 995],
            ['start_time' => 2952.09, 'end_time' => 2954.88, 'target_text' => 'And one of the first things he made compulsory is the five prayers.', 'source_text' => 'Dan antara perkara terawal yang difardukan oleh Allah adalah solat lima waktu.', 'order' => 996],
            ['start_time' => 2954.97, 'end_time' => 2956.84, 'target_text' => 'So, you want to connect with Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, sekiranya anda ingin mendekatkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 997],
            ['start_time' => 2956.93, 'end_time' => 2957.91, 'target_text' => 'I know we\'re weak.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sedar kita semua insan yang lemah.', 'order' => 998],
            ['start_time' => 2958.01, 'end_time' => 2959.76, 'target_text' => 'I know all of us have weakness.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tahu kita semua mempunyai kekurangan diri.', 'order' => 999],
            ['start_time' => 2959.86, 'end_time' => 2965.95, 'target_text' => 'My brothers, my sisters, my beloved children, I encourage you strongly.', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudara-saudaraku, para saudariku, anak-anakku yang dikasihi, saya menyeru anda semua dengan penuh kesungguhan.', 'order' => 1000],
            ['start_time' => 2966.05, 'end_time' => 2967.16, 'target_text' => 'Become serious with your prayer.', 'source_text' => 'Ambillah berat dan bersungguh-sungguhlah menjaga solat anda.', 'order' => 1001],
            ['start_time' => 2967.26, 'end_time' => 2968.32, 'target_text' => 'Your life will change.', 'source_text' => 'Nescaya kehidupan anda pasti akan berubah menjadi lebih baik.', 'order' => 1002],
            ['start_time' => 2968.41, 'end_time' => 2969.8, 'target_text' => 'Be a proud Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Jadilah seorang Muslim yang bangga dengan agamanya.', 'order' => 1003],
            ['start_time' => 2969.89, 'end_time' => 2972.16, 'target_text' => 'Be a person whose identity is known.', 'source_text' => 'Jadilah insan yang jelas dan teguh identiti Islamnya.', 'order' => 1004],
            ['start_time' => 2972.26, 'end_time' => 2975.28, 'target_text' => 'So what if they if they do not treat you well?', 'source_text' => 'Pedulikan apa sekiranya mereka tidak melayan anda dengan baik?', 'order' => 1005],
            ['start_time' => 2975.38, 'end_time' => 2978.24, 'target_text' => 'They did not treat Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam well.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu mereka juga tidak melayan Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam dengan baik.', 'order' => 1006],
            ['start_time' => 2978.34, 'end_time' => 2979.36, 'target_text' => 'He took it as an honor.', 'source_text' => 'Namun Baginda menganggapnya sebagai suatu kemuliaan di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 1007],
            ['start_time' => 2979.45, 'end_time' => 2982.26, 'target_text' => 'He didn\'t compromise his faith.', 'source_text' => 'Baginda langsung tidak menggadaikan pegangan agamanya.', 'order' => 1008],
            ['start_time' => 2983.13, 'end_time' => 2984.51, 'target_text' => 'They tortured them in Mecca.', 'source_text' => 'Kaum musyrikin menyeksa para sahabat di kota Makkah.', 'order' => 1009],
            ['start_time' => 2984.61, 'end_time' => 2986.84, 'target_text' => 'They did not compromise their faith.', 'source_text' => 'Namun mereka tidak sesekali menggadaikan keimanan mereka.', 'order' => 1010],
            ['start_time' => 2986.93, 'end_time' => 2988.28, 'target_text' => 'So, they might not like you.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, mungkin ada orang yang tidak menyukai anda.', 'order' => 1011],
            ['start_time' => 2988.38, 'end_time' => 2989.11, 'target_text' => 'So what?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah masalahnya?', 'order' => 1012],
            ['start_time' => 2989.22, 'end_time' => 2990.24, 'target_text' => 'I\'m still going to pray.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tetap akan istiqamah mendirikan solat.', 'order' => 1013],
            ['start_time' => 2990.34, 'end_time' => 2996.47, 'target_text' => 'I\'m still my own I\'m unapologetically Muslim and I will prove to them that Islam is an amazing, beautiful religion.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tetap berpegang teguh pada prinsip saya — saya seorang Muslim tanpa sekelumit rasa malu dan saya akan buktikan kepada mereka bahawa Islam adalah agama yang amat indah dan mengagumkan.', 'order' => 1014],
            ['start_time' => 2996.57, 'end_time' => 2999.68, 'target_text' => 'We are taught to help Muslims, non-Muslims, whoever it may be.', 'source_text' => 'Kita dididik untuk membantu sesiapa sahaja — sama ada orang Islam mahupun bukan Islam, sesiapa jua yang memerlukan.', 'order' => 1015],
            ['start_time' => 2999.78, 'end_time' => 3003.43, 'target_text' => 'I gave you an example at the beginning of this talk of a dog.', 'source_text' => 'Saya telah memberikan contoh kepada anda pada awal ceramah tadi mengenai kisah seekor anjing.', 'order' => 1016],
            ['start_time' => 3003.53, 'end_time' => 3007.51, 'target_text' => 'And I told you even the animals we have to be kind to them, look out for them, and so on.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya telah menegaskan bahawa terhadap haiwan sekalipun kita wajib berbuat ihsan, mengambil berat kebajikannya dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 1017],
            ['start_time' => 3007.61, 'end_time' => 3011.55, 'target_text' => 'I even said a pig you got to be kind to the pig.', 'source_text' => 'Malah saya turut menyebut terhadap babi sekalipun kita wajib berlaku ihsan dan tidak menyeksanya.', 'order' => 1018],
            ['start_time' => 3011.66, 'end_time' => 3013.8, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty honor us all.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa memuliakan kita semua.', 'order' => 1019],
            ['start_time' => 3013.89, 'end_time' => 3015.16, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty bless us all.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa melimpahkan barakah kepada kita semua.', 'order' => 1020],
            ['start_time' => 3015.26, 'end_time' => 3020.36, 'target_text' => 'So, this is how you start and this is how you get closer to Allah and this is how the doors begin to open.', 'source_text' => 'Maka begitulah cara anda bermula, dan begitulah cara untuk anda semakin mendekatkan diri kepada Allah, dan begitulah pintu-pintu rahmat mula terbuka luas.', 'order' => 1021],
            ['start_time' => 3020.45, 'end_time' => 3022.43, 'target_text' => 'Simple beginnings, simple start.', 'source_text' => 'Permulaan yang sederhana, langkah awal yang tulus.', 'order' => 1022],
            ['start_time' => 3022.53, 'end_time' => 3028.47, 'target_text' => 'We start with Allah subhanahu wa ta\'ala and Allah will open the doors one after the other and Allah will grant us the goodness', 'source_text' => 'Kita memulakannya kerana Allah subhanahu wa ta\'ala, nescaya Allah akan membuka pintu-pintu kebaikan satu demi satu dan mengurniakan kita kebaikan', 'order' => 1023],
            ['start_time' => 3028.57, 'end_time' => 3029.72, 'target_text' => 'of this world and the next.', 'source_text' => 'di dunia dan kebaikan di akhirat kelak.', 'order' => 1024],
            ['start_time' => 3029.82, 'end_time' => 3036.51, 'target_text' => 'So, we sought the forgiveness of Allah, we humbled ourselves, we started our prayer, and then Allah will open our doors.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kita telah memulakannya dengan istighfar memohon keampunan Allah, kita merendahkan diri dengan tawaduk, kita mendirikan solat lima waktu, dan sesudah itu Allah pasti membuka jalan kemudahan.', 'order' => 1025],
            ['start_time' => 3036.61, 'end_time' => 3039.32, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t justify when you\'ve done something wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan sesekali mencari alasan membela diri apabila anda melakukan sesuatu kesilapan.', 'order' => 1026],
            ['start_time' => 3039.41, 'end_time' => 3045.24, 'target_text' => 'Always ask Allah, "Oh Allah, strengthen me to do that which is obligatory.', 'source_text' => 'Sentiasalah memohon kepada Allah, "Ya Allah, kurniakanlah aku kekuatan untuk menunaikan segala apa yang difardukan.', 'order' => 1027],
            ['start_time' => 3045.34, 'end_time' => 3048.76, 'target_text' => 'Oh Allah, strengthen me to do that which is pleasing to you.', 'source_text' => 'Ya Allah, berikanlah daku kekuatan untuk melakukan segala amalan yang mendatangkan keredaan-Mu.', 'order' => 1028],
            ['start_time' => 3048.86, 'end_time' => 3054.97, 'target_text' => 'And oh Allah, strengthen me to quit those things that are displeasing to you."', 'source_text' => 'Dan ya Allah, kurniakanlah daku keazaman untuk meninggalkan segala perkara yang mengundang kemurkaan-Mu."', 'order' => 1029],
            ['start_time' => 3055.61, 'end_time' => 3057.8, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty bless you all.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa memberkati anda semua.', 'order' => 1030],
            ['start_time' => 3057.89, 'end_time' => 3058.88, 'target_text' => 'These brothers have stood up.', 'source_text' => 'Saudara-saudara penganjur ini sudah mula berdiri.', 'order' => 1031],
            ['start_time' => 3058.97, 'end_time' => 3061.43, 'target_text' => 'They want me to leave Aberdeen.', 'source_text' => 'Nampaknya mereka memberi isyarat meminta saya meninggalkan Aberdeen.', 'order' => 1032],
            ['start_time' => 3061.53, 'end_time' => 3065.47, 'target_text' => 'I said something that seems to have offended some people.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin ada kata-kata saya tadi yang menyinggung perasaan sesetengah orang?', 'order' => 1033],
            ['start_time' => 3065.57, 'end_time' => 3066.68, 'target_text' => 'Did I?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah saya menyinggung perasaan anda?', 'order' => 1034],
            ['start_time' => 3066.78, 'end_time' => 3067.59, 'target_text' => 'No, I didn\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 1035],
            ['start_time' => 3067.7, 'end_time' => 3068.16, 'target_text' => 'Come on, guys.', 'source_text' => 'Bertenanglah, sahabat-sahabat sekalian.', 'order' => 1036],
            ['start_time' => 3068.26, 'end_time' => 3068.66, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 1037],
            ['start_time' => 3068.7, 'end_time' => 3070.03, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless you all.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah merahmati anda semua.', 'order' => 1038],
            ['start_time' => 3070.13, 'end_time' => 3070.91, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 1039],
            ['start_time' => 3071.01, 'end_time' => 3072.55, 'target_text' => 'Can I ask you a question?', 'source_text' => 'Bolehkah saya bertanyakan satu soalan kepada anda?', 'order' => 1040],
            ['start_time' => 3072.66, 'end_time' => 3074.39, 'target_text' => 'What\'s your name?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah nama anda?', 'order' => 1041],
            ['start_time' => 3074.49, 'end_time' => 3074.95, 'target_text' => 'Yunus.', 'source_text' => 'Yunus.', 'order' => 1042],
            ['start_time' => 3075.05, 'end_time' => 3076.03, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 1043],
            ['start_time' => 3076.13, 'end_time' => 3078.89, 'target_text' => 'What made you come here today?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang mendorong anda hadir ke sini pada hari ini?', 'order' => 1044],
            ['start_time' => 3079.86, 'end_time' => 3081.72, 'target_text' => 'What was the reason?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah tujuannya?', 'order' => 1045],
            ['start_time' => 3081.82, 'end_time' => 3083.63, 'target_text' => 'Seems like you came a little bit early, right?', 'source_text' => 'Kelihatan seolah-olah anda hadir awal ke masjid ini, bukan?', 'order' => 1046],
            ['start_time' => 3083.74, 'end_time' => 3088.55, 'target_text' => 'Yeah, I wanted to be enlightened and I wanted to be enlightened, he says.', 'source_text' => '"Ya, saya ingin mendapatkan pencerahan ilmu," katanya.', 'order' => 1047],
            ['start_time' => 3088.66, 'end_time' => 3088.96, 'target_text' => 'And?', 'source_text' => 'Dan apa lagi?', 'order' => 1048],
            ['start_time' => 3088.97, 'end_time' => 3096.72, 'target_text' => 'something and I\'m about to start university and I wanted to Masha make sure that I live in accordance Alhamdulillah.', 'source_text' => '"Sesuatu nasihat kerana saya bakal memulakan pengajian di universiti dan saya ingin memastikan kehidupan saya sentiasa bertepatan dengan syariat," alhamdulillah.', 'order' => 1049],
            ['start_time' => 3096.82, 'end_time' => 3097.12, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 1050],
            ['start_time' => 3097.18, 'end_time' => 3101.68, 'target_text' => 'The brother says he wanted to be enlightened and whatever else he said after that is connected to that.', 'source_text' => 'Saudara muda ini menyatakan bahawa dia hadir untuk menimba pencerahan ilmu dan apa jua yang disebutkannya selepas itu berkait rapat dengan niat murni tersebut.', 'order' => 1051],
            ['start_time' => 3101.78, 'end_time' => 3103.95, 'target_text' => 'Do feel you you feel a little bit better?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda kini berasa sedikit lebih tenang dan bersemangat?', 'order' => 1052],
            ['start_time' => 3104.05, 'end_time' => 3105.8, 'target_text' => 'Yes, I May Allah bless all of us.', 'source_text' => 'Ya. Semoga Allah melimpahkan barakah kepada kita semua.', 'order' => 1053],
            ['start_time' => 3105.89, 'end_time' => 3111.36, 'target_text' => 'The reason I ask you is many young people come and I always ask them what made you come and why did you come.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab utama saya bertanya adalah kerana ramai anak muda yang hadir dan saya sentiasa ingin tahu apa dorongan dan tujuan mereka hadir.', 'order' => 1054],
            ['start_time' => 3111.45, 'end_time' => 3114.55, 'target_text' => 'I hope it\'s never to take a photo with you.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berharap ia bukanlah semata-mata kerana ingin bergambar dengan saya.', 'order' => 1055],
            ['start_time' => 3114.66, 'end_time' => 3116.47, 'target_text' => 'Because that\'s not going to get you anywhere.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana gambar semata-mata tidak akan membawa anda ke mana-mana.', 'order' => 1056],
            ['start_time' => 3116.57, 'end_time' => 3118.8, 'target_text' => 'You get a photo, you don\'t get a photo.', 'source_text' => 'Sama ada anda dapat bergambar atau tidak dapat bergambar.', 'order' => 1057],
            ['start_time' => 3118.89, 'end_time' => 3121.74, 'target_text' => 'I I like to use the term', 'source_text' => 'Saya suka menggunakan istilah', 'order' => 1058],
            ['start_time' => 3121.97, 'end_time' => 3126.47, 'target_text' => 'which means in the eyes of Allah it\'s not even the weight of a fly.', 'source_text' => 'yang bermaksud di sisi Allah ia tidak bernilai walau seberat sayap lalat sekalipun.', 'order' => 1059],
            ['start_time' => 3126.57, 'end_time' => 3127.24, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah hakikatnya.', 'order' => 1060],
            ['start_time' => 3127.34, 'end_time' => 3132.2, 'target_text' => 'So, inshallah if we can I don\'t mind a photo or two, but if you didn\'t get it don\'t be upset.', 'source_text' => 'Maka insya-Allah sekiranya berkesempatan, saya tidak keberatan untuk mengambil sekeping dua gambar, namun sekiranya anda tidak berpeluang mendapatkannya, janganlah berasa kecil hati.', 'order' => 1061],
            ['start_time' => 3132.3, 'end_time' => 3133.68, 'target_text' => 'We will walk out inshallah.', 'source_text' => 'Kami akan beredar keluar insya-Allah.', 'order' => 1062],
            ['start_time' => 3133.78, 'end_time' => 3138.16, 'target_text' => 'The young boys that are here that I see I\'m so touched to see so many young people.', 'source_text' => 'Anak-anak muda yang berada di sini yang saya perhatikan, hati saya amat tersentuh melihat begitu ramai golongan belia yang hadir.', 'order' => 1063],
            ['start_time' => 3138.26, 'end_time' => 3140.16, 'target_text' => 'How many of you are below the age of 30?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai antara anda yang berumur di bawah 30 tahun?', 'order' => 1064],
            ['start_time' => 3140.26, 'end_time' => 3141.76, 'target_text' => 'Put up your hands.', 'source_text' => 'Sila angkat tangan anda.', 'order' => 1065],
            ['start_time' => 3141.86, 'end_time' => 3142.51, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 1066],
            ['start_time' => 3142.61, 'end_time' => 3143.8, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the bulk of the masjid.', 'source_text' => 'Hampir seluruh ruang masjid dipenuhi anak muda.', 'order' => 1067],
            ['start_time' => 3143.89, 'end_time' => 3145.07, 'target_text' => 'That\'s a very good sign.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah petanda yang amat memberangsangkan.', 'order' => 1068],
            ['start_time' => 3145.18, 'end_time' => 3150.55, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless this wonderful community inshallah and may Allah subhanahu wa ta\'ala grant us ease and goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah melimpahkan barakah kepada komuniti yang hebat ini insya-Allah, dan semoga Allah subhanahu wa ta\'ala mengurniakan kemudahan dan kebaikan.', 'order' => 1069],
            ['start_time' => 3150.66, 'end_time' => 3156.43, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t want to get up, but these guys are trying to tell me you know what Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Sebenarnya saya masih belum ingin beredar, namun sahabat-sahabat penganjur ini memberi isyarat mengingatkan saya, masya-Allah.', 'order' => 1070],
            ['start_time' => 3156.53, 'end_time' => 3157.36, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 1071],
            ['start_time' => 3157.45, 'end_time' => 3158.32, 'target_text' => 'Just a minute.', 'source_text' => 'Beri saya masa seminit lagi.', 'order' => 1072],
            ['start_time' => 3158.41, 'end_time' => 3162.88, 'target_text' => 'So, I\'ve just been reminded that you know what I\'ve come here with Abdullah Aid.', 'source_text' => 'Saya baru sahaja diingatkan bahawa kehadiran saya ke sini adalah bersama-sama dengan pertubuhan kebajikan Abdullah Aid.', 'order' => 1073],
            ['start_time' => 3162.97, 'end_time' => 3170.28, 'target_text' => 'Abdullah Aid is a legitimate UK-based charity that I am not just affiliated to, I\'m an ambassador of.', 'source_text' => 'Abdullah Aid adalah sebuah badan kebajikan berdaftar yang sah di United Kingdom di mana saya bukan sekadar bernaung di bawahnya, malah saya merupakan dutanya.', 'order' => 1074],
            ['start_time' => 3170.38, 'end_time' => 3171.51, 'target_text' => 'I work with.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bekerjasama rapat dengan mereka.', 'order' => 1075],
            ['start_time' => 3171.61, 'end_time' => 3174.76, 'target_text' => 'You know, it\'s not easy to put your name next to a charity.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, bukanlah mudah untuk meletakkan nama peribadi kita di samping sesebuah badan kebajikan.', 'order' => 1076],
            ['start_time' => 3174.86, 'end_time' => 3182.8, 'target_text' => 'I know so many charities, masha Allah they\'re doing good work, but the ones that I felt that I would like to work with fisabilillah', 'source_text' => 'Saya mengenali banyak pertubuhan kebajikan, masya-Allah mereka melakukan kerja-kerja yang baik, namun badan yang saya rasa terpanggil untuk bekerjasama fi sabilillah', 'order' => 1077],
            ['start_time' => 3182.89, 'end_time' => 3189.47, 'target_text' => 'because of the brothers being on a certain level I felt and I went through everything that I had to.', 'source_text' => 'disebabkan ketelusan dan integriti para penggeraknya, setelah saya meneliti secara terperinci segala operasinya.', 'order' => 1078],
            ['start_time' => 3189.57, 'end_time' => 3196.16, 'target_text' => 'These brothers, masha Allah I\'ve told them, you know what, once twice a year we will go around the country and we will introduce', 'source_text' => 'Sahabat-sahabat ini, masya-Allah saya telah berjanji dengan mereka bahawa sekali atau dua kali setahun kami akan menjelajah ke seluruh negara bagi memperkenalkan', 'order' => 1079],
            ['start_time' => 3196.26, 'end_time' => 3199.11, 'target_text' => 'Abdullah Aid and at the same time we will meet the communities.', 'source_text' => 'Abdullah Aid di samping mengeratkan ukhuwah bersama komuniti setempat.', 'order' => 1080],
            ['start_time' => 3199.22, 'end_time' => 3204.11, 'target_text' => 'So, I want you to reach out to be able to help us to help others.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, saya menyeru anda semua untuk bersama-sama membantu kami agar kami dapat membantu mereka yang memerlukan.', 'order' => 1081],
            ['start_time' => 3204.22, 'end_time' => 3210.95, 'target_text' => 'We have a project, a work project, because so far something known as the gift aid, you might know what it is, right?', 'source_text' => 'Kami mempunyai sebuah projek wakaf, kerana setakat ini bantuan geran kerajaan seperti \'Gift Aid\' — anda mungkin tahu mengenainya, bukan?', 'order' => 1082],
            ['start_time' => 3211.05, 'end_time' => 3218.76, 'target_text' => 'Gift aid helps us to cover overheads, but the overheads are becoming more and we don\'t want to touch even a penny of the donation', 'source_text' => '\'Gift Aid\' membantu kami menampung kos operasi, namun kos operasi semakin meningkat dan kami sama sekali tidak mahu menyentuh walau satu sen pun daripada wang sumbangan', 'order' => 1083],
            ['start_time' => 3218.86, 'end_time' => 3219.68, 'target_text' => 'itself.', 'source_text' => 'derma orang ramai.', 'order' => 1084],
            ['start_time' => 3219.78, 'end_time' => 3226.03, 'target_text' => 'So, what we\'ve decided is we want a waqf to be able to bring in enough income to cover all the overheads.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, kami telah mengambil ketetapan untuk mewujudkan dana wakaf agar ia menjana pendapatan mampan bagi menampung keseluruhan kos operasi pentadbiran.', 'order' => 1085],
            ['start_time' => 3226.13, 'end_time' => 3233.39, 'target_text' => 'And whoever contributes to that waqf, which is not an easy project, they will have a reward of facilitation of everybody\'s', 'source_text' => 'Dan sesiapa yang menyumbang kepada dana wakaf tersebut — yang bukanlah suatu projek yang mudah — mereka akan beroleh ganjaran pahala mempermudahkan pengurusan', 'order' => 1086],
            ['start_time' => 3233.49, 'end_time' => 3235.8, 'target_text' => 'sadaqat and zakawat, inshallah.', 'source_text' => 'sedekah dan zakat setiap insan lain, insya-Allah.', 'order' => 1087],
            ['start_time' => 3235.89, 'end_time' => 3241.39, 'target_text' => 'So, tonight we\'re asking you, even if it means 10 pounds a month, you may donate towards the waqf, number one.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, pada malam ini kami menyeru anda, sekalipun sekadar sumbangan 10 paun sebulan, anda boleh menyumbang ke arah dana wakaf ini, itu yang pertama.', 'order' => 1088],
            ['start_time' => 3241.49, 'end_time' => 3249.07, 'target_text' => 'Number two is you can still give zakat and sadaqat towards other projects across the globe, including Palestine and Gaza.', 'source_text' => 'Keduanya adalah anda masih boleh menyalurkan zakat dan sedekah anda untuk projek bantuan lain di seluruh dunia, termasuklah Palestin dan Gaza.', 'order' => 1089],
            ['start_time' => 3249.18, 'end_time' => 3255.68, 'target_text' => 'To the best of our ability, we will get whatever has to get to wherever it has to get to, inshallah, by the help of Allah', 'source_text' => 'Mengikut kemampuan terbaik kami, kami akan memastikan bantuan tersebut sampai ke destinasi yang disasarkan, insya-Allah, dengan pertolongan Allah', 'order' => 1090],
            ['start_time' => 3255.78, 'end_time' => 3256.59, 'target_text' => 'subhanahu wa ta\'ala.', 'source_text' => 'subhanahu wa ta\'ala.', 'order' => 1091],
            ['start_time' => 3256.7, 'end_time' => 3263.88, 'target_text' => 'So, that\'s just a word I decided to throw in so that I can remind you why we have come and what we have brought to you.', 'source_text' => 'Maka itulah sedikit pesanan yang ingin saya selitkan agar dapat mengingatkan anda tujuan utama kami hadir dan amanah yang kami bawa.', 'order' => 1092],
            ['start_time' => 3263.97, 'end_time' => 3265.03, 'target_text' => 'It\'s an opportunity.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah suatu peluang amal jariah.', 'order' => 1093],
            ['start_time' => 3265.13, 'end_time' => 3268.91, 'target_text' => 'Nonetheless, I know you are already doing a lot of good.', 'source_text' => 'Walau bagaimanapun, saya tahu anda semua sudah banyak menyumbang kebaikan.', 'order' => 1094],
            ['start_time' => 3269.01, 'end_time' => 3276.51, 'target_text' => 'So, inshallah, if there is a surplus, you can also donate to this wonderful, beautiful charity that we are connected to.', 'source_text' => 'Maka insya-Allah sekiranya ada lebihan rezeki, anda juga boleh menyumbang kepada badan kebajikan yang indah ini yang kami wakili.', 'order' => 1095],
            ['start_time' => 3276.61, 'end_time' => 3280.84, 'target_text' => 'Shukran to the Imam and the committee and all the brothers and sisters who are here.', 'source_text' => 'Jutaan terima kasih (syukran) kepada tuan Imam, jawatankuasa masjid dan seluruh saudara serta saudari yang hadir pada malam ini.', 'order' => 1096],
            ['start_time' => 3280.93, 'end_time' => 3283.99, 'target_text' => 'And inshallah, I pray that everything goes well.', 'source_text' => 'Dan insya-Allah, saya berdoa agar segala urusan dipermudahkan.', 'order' => 1097],
            ['start_time' => 3284.09, 'end_time' => 3286.99, 'target_text' => 'Aqulu qawli hadha wa sallallahu ala nabiyina Muhammad.', 'source_text' => 'Aqulu qawli hadha wa sallallahu \'ala nabiyyina Muhammad.', 'order' => 1098],
            ['start_time' => 3287.09, 'end_time' => 3289.34, 'target_text' => 'Wa salaam alaykum.', 'source_text' => 'Wa salaamu \'alaykum wa rahmatullah.', 'order' => 1099],
        ];

        foreach (array_chunk($subtitles, 100) as $chunk) {
            $records = [];
            foreach ($chunk as $item) {
                $records[] = [
                    'id'          => (string) Str::uuid(),
